(2981158, 413909, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good study. Great clarity. I love the pose of the subject, very intrigueing and interesting. To me, for this image the lighting seems just a touch harsh. Right edge of subject, especially on the feet look to be on the verge of blowing out. Perhaps just a little more ''subdued'' lighting? A nice, thought provoking image though, nice work.</td>', 'A good study. Great clarity. I love the pose of the subject, very intrigueing and interesting. To me, for this image the lighting seems just a touch harsh. Right edge of subject, especially on the feet look to be on the verge of blowing out. Perhaps just a little more ''subdued'' lighting? A nice, thought provoking image though, nice work.', '2006-11-01 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
