(2982681, 420810, 32767, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to tell if this is well level or not but the way the city starts to dip to the right is a little tough on the eye. The center of most lenses tend to handle the pincussioning and barreling a little better so it the city was more centered with less sky this might help that effect unless it was what you were going for. Good Luck!</td>', 'It''s difficult to tell if this is well level or not but the way the city starts to dip to the right is a little tough on the eye. The center of most lenses tend to handle the pincussioning and barreling a little better so it the city was more centered with less sky this might help that effect unless it was what you were going for. Good Luck!', '2006-11-01 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
