(2982813, 420971, 15711, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I like the black that is here and there.  Lovely bokeh. If I could change anything, I might just have the single leaf facing the camera, but overlal, nice. I''d kill the tiny orange part of the frame. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous. I like the black that is here and there.  Lovely bokeh. If I could change anything, I might just have the single leaf facing the camera, but overlal, nice. I''d kill the tiny orange part of the frame. 7', '2006-11-01 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
