(2983558, 414428, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit crooked. And I am unsure how the title goes with the image. I see the moon, but I don''t get the "stars" reference? OH, is it the FLAG? As in Stars &amp; Stripes? If so, the flag is just not salient enough in the image. It is actually a bit blurry due to the shutter speed.</td>', 'A bit crooked. And I am unsure how the title goes with the image. I see the moon, but I don''t get the "stars" reference? OH, is it the FLAG? As in Stars & Stripes? If so, the flag is just not salient enough in the image. It is actually a bit blurry due to the shutter speed.', '2006-11-01 11:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983561, 420607, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this. It''s gritty, detailed and has some oomph. Great composition. If I could change anything, I''d not have the shoulder(?) to the right but if you cloned it, then you''d be dqed and I like the composition the way it is.  Good job.</td>', 'I love this. It''s gritty, detailed and has some oomph. Great composition. If I could change anything, I''d not have the shoulder(?) to the right but if you cloned it, then you''d be dqed and I like the composition the way it is.  Good job.', '2006-11-01 11:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
