(2984370, 420927, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2006-11-01 13:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984375, 416396, 50695, '<td valign="top">long exposure? great effect with the clouds. Nice quality of light.</td>', 'long exposure? great effect with the clouds. Nice quality of light.', '2006-11-01 13:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984379, 405423, 35708, '<td valign="top">I find the mail box a little distracting. Everything else about this is good.</td>', 'I find the mail box a little distracting. Everything else about this is good.', '2006-11-01 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984381, 414724, 60495, '<td valign="top">Very nice, makes me want to be there.</td>', 'Very nice, makes me want to be there.', '2006-11-01 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984386, 420953, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the eye makeup combined with the distorting angle of the face and the intense highlights. Creates a kind of melodramatic but surreal effect, like opera. But there''s also a calligraphic sort of beauty to the lines.</td>', 'love the eye makeup combined with the distorting angle of the face and the intense highlights. Creates a kind of melodramatic but surreal effect, like opera. But there''s also a calligraphic sort of beauty to the lines.', '2006-11-01 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984389, 417139, 52713, '<td valign="top">outstanding moment, too much noise reduction.</td>', 'outstanding moment, too much noise reduction.', '2006-11-01 13:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984393, 418252, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice bokeh, good colors. kind of a standard composition, though.</td>', 'nice bokeh, good colors. kind of a standard composition, though.', '2006-11-01 13:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984394, 411774, 35708, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and I like this but the angle is not easy on the eyes... It looks like something from Escher. Pretty cool.</td>', 'Very cool idea and I like this but the angle is not easy on the eyes... It looks like something from Escher. Pretty cool.', '2006-11-01 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984397, 413192, 35708, '<td valign="top">The photo itself looks over exposed or burned out but the idea and composition is awesome!</td>', 'The photo itself looks over exposed or burned out but the idea and composition is awesome!', '2006-11-01 13:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984398, 419265, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The green at the top left takes away from the scene in my opinion.</td>', 'Nicely done. The green at the top left takes away from the scene in my opinion.', '2006-11-01 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984402, 414665, 35708, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I cant find anything that really bothers me about this. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great shot. I cant find anything that really bothers me about this. Nicely done.', '2006-11-01 13:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984404, 420456, 50695, '<td valign="top">paper is so hard to manipulate. this must have taken you all day? I hate shots like this, but your variations make this shot fascinating. Also, the illusion keeps shifting between concave and convex. It''s the kind of image you can just stare at it for hours. I''ll give it a 7 for now and possibly bump it higher.</td>', 'paper is so hard to manipulate. this must have taken you all day? I hate shots like this, but your variations make this shot fascinating. Also, the illusion keeps shifting between concave and convex. It''s the kind of image you can just stare at it for hours. I''ll give it a 7 for now and possibly bump it higher.', '2006-11-01 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984413, 420511, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great pic terrible title. Let the image tell the story. not marking down because of it - just thought you should know.</td>', 'Great pic terrible title. Let the image tell the story. not marking down because of it - just thought you should know.', '2006-11-01 13:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984415, 405941, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the old-timey processing, though the shot itself is fairly standard (though very well executed). The most interesting thing about it is how much the deer seem to be mirroring each other. I wonder if there''s something you could do with that? 6</td>', 'I like the old-timey processing, though the shot itself is fairly standard (though very well executed). The most interesting thing about it is how much the deer seem to be mirroring each other. I wonder if there''s something you could do with that? 6', '2006-11-01 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984421, 415952, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful triangular composition. This looks like a classic painting.</td>', 'wonderful triangular composition. This looks like a classic painting.', '2006-11-01 13:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984427, 406856, 35708, '<td valign="top">very interesting! It makes the mind think about what it is seeing. The blend of colors and the trunks at different angles makes this very intereting. Some may say it is too busy but I like it.</td>', 'very interesting! It makes the mind think about what it is seeing. The blend of colors and the trunks at different angles makes this very intereting. Some may say it is too busy but I like it.', '2006-11-01 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984432, 410254, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel like I know this man. Poignant portrait. The soft focus and flatness of it just make it seem more real.</td>', 'I feel like I know this man. Poignant portrait. The soft focus and flatness of it just make it seem more real.', '2006-11-01 13:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984438, 409090, 64929, '<td valign="top">The top of the bridge is a little too tightly cropped, IMHO, but still a great capture</td>', 'The top of the bridge is a little too tightly cropped, IMHO, but still a great capture', '2006-11-01 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984440, 409090, 50695, '<td valign="top">looks like you might have had trouble with the jpeg compression. I suggest starting a thread about it when the challenge is over. you''ll get great advice. I like the "in your face" composition. 6</td>', 'looks like you might have had trouble with the jpeg compression. I suggest starting a thread about it when the challenge is over. you''ll get great advice. I like the "in your face" composition. 6', '2006-11-01 13:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984449, 420128, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The fountain in the background may be a little distracting but you did a great job at capturing the person and the wall surrounding. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nicely done. The fountain in the background may be a little distracting but you did a great job at capturing the person and the wall surrounding. Nice composition.', '2006-11-01 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984450, 418996, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve known many babies and their souls were not golden baskets holding butterflies.</td>', 'I''ve known many babies and their souls were not golden baskets holding butterflies.', '2006-11-01 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984456, 420456, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is odd but so dang interesting. Very very creative and just downright artistic. Great idea and great job turning the idea into a still shot. I would hang this on my wall any day!</td>', 'This is odd but so dang interesting. Very very creative and just downright artistic. Great idea and great job turning the idea into a still shot. I would hang this on my wall any day!', '2006-11-01 13:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984461, 420635, 35708, '<td valign="top">Great! There looks to be a little blur under the main center vein - the loss of sharpness here is distracting. But it is a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great! There looks to be a little blur under the main center vein - the loss of sharpness here is distracting. But it is a great shot nonetheless.', '2006-11-01 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984463, 408923, 50695, '<td valign="top">you leash your cat? how does that work? I like this. The title says it all. He is so surrounded by the leaves that they seem to be redefining his outline, creating a tension between positive and negative (or faux-negative) space. 7</td>', 'you leash your cat? how does that work? I like this. The title says it all. He is so surrounded by the leaves that they seem to be redefining his outline, creating a tension between positive and negative (or faux-negative) space. 7', '2006-11-01 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984464, 413029, 64929, '<td valign="top">Much stronger presentation withOUT the border...but cool capture nonetheless</td>', 'Much stronger presentation withOUT the border...but cool capture nonetheless', '2006-11-01 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984468, 420129, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nice highlighting and the composition is interesting but the blur around the people is a bit annoying. Were you going for a softer feel?</td>', 'Nice highlighting and the composition is interesting but the blur around the people is a bit annoying. Were you going for a softer feel?', '2006-11-01 13:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984476, 413134, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. The leaf on the right side is annoying but the pose and look was captured wonderfully.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. The leaf on the right side is annoying but the pose and look was captured wonderfully.', '2006-11-01 13:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984480, 420487, 4967, '<td valign="top">In my honest opinion there is just too much blank space here... and I''m really looking for something dominant on the bottom.</td>', 'In my honest opinion there is just too much blank space here... and I''m really looking for something dominant on the bottom.', '2006-11-01 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984485, 418349, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice... I just wish you had shifted the camera a bit down more to include more of the rock and less of the sky.</td>', 'Nice... I just wish you had shifted the camera a bit down more to include more of the rock and less of the sky.', '2006-11-01 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984488, 421086, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the simple symmetric background. great subject. love how you get the drama of a blown highlight on her hat, which we don''t need to see details of, while keeping all the details of her face. The fact that she''s not looking at us gives this a candid feel, but also hints at character: she doesn''t have time to sit staring at a camera! It suggests a practical nature, though her expression hints at emotional depth. A first-class portrait.</td>', 'love the simple symmetric background. great subject. love how you get the drama of a blown highlight on her hat, which we don''t need to see details of, while keeping all the details of her face. The fact that she''s not looking at us gives this a candid feel, but also hints at character: she doesn''t have time to sit staring at a camera! It suggests a practical nature, though her expression hints at emotional depth. A first-class portrait.', '2006-11-01 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984492, 421130, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the subtlty and gradatiion of color in background. 6</td>', 'Love the subtlty and gradatiion of color in background. 6', '2006-11-01 13:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984493, 411808, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is nice although I feel that the lipstick drags your eye away from her eye.</td>', 'This is nice although I feel that the lipstick drags your eye away from her eye.', '2006-11-01 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984495, 417354, 35708, '<td valign="top">The white border is a little too thick for my liking but the shot itself is great. I would thin the border a little and it would be perfect.</td>', 'The white border is a little too thick for my liking but the shot itself is great. I would thin the border a little and it would be perfect.', '2006-11-01 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984501, 416854, 33947, '<td valign="top">Ah, I love dahlias, and that one''s a beauty. Nice job. Interesting, swiggly center. I''ve not seen one like that. Good crop. 7</td>', 'Ah, I love dahlias, and that one''s a beauty. Nice job. Interesting, swiggly center. I''ve not seen one like that. Good crop. 7', '2006-11-01 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984502, 416191, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting. I think the radius of light around the rock could be a little larger. I like it... Id probably hang this on the wall!</td>', 'This is really interesting. I think the radius of light around the rock could be a little larger. I like it... Id probably hang this on the wall!', '2006-11-01 13:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984503, 420815, 50695, '<td valign="top">a surprising amount of personality for a bug. Nice soft yellows, too. In fact, a very pleasing all around softness to the image, except for that black background which detracts from the picture, imho.  6</td>', 'a surprising amount of personality for a bug. Nice soft yellows, too. In fact, a very pleasing all around softness to the image, except for that black background which detracts from the picture, imho.  6', '2006-11-01 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2984507, 421037, 4967, '<td valign="top">Since you don''t get all of the horse''s legs anyway... I think you might have cropped tighter here for a more impactful image. Also looks a bit light to me.</td>', 'Since you don''t get all of the horse''s legs anyway... I think you might have cropped tighter here for a more impactful image. Also looks a bit light to me.', '2006-11-01 13:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984508, 420966, 35708, '<td valign="top">If you cropped this photo I would re-crop it without cutting off the chin. I think the lighting is perfect but would like it more if the chin wasnt cut off and maybe a little bit more of the hat was visible. Nice!</td>', 'If you cropped this photo I would re-crop it without cutting off the chin. I think the lighting is perfect but would like it more if the chin wasnt cut off and maybe a little bit more of the hat was visible. Nice!', '2006-11-01 13:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984509, 417088, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity, and nicely posed within frame. Great crop. 8</td>', 'Wonderful clarity, and nicely posed within frame. Great crop. 8', '2006-11-01 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984512, 410430, 4967, '<td valign="top">very pretty...  I like the use of blank space at the top.  Why the black stripe on the left though?</td>', 'very pretty...  I like the use of blank space at the top.  Why the black stripe on the left though?', '2006-11-01 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984515, 419384, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and fuzzy lighting near top. 6</td>', 'Love the perspective and fuzzy lighting near top. 6', '2006-11-01 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984516, 413909, 35708, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think moving the angle to being straight on her back so you cannot see her legs, only her feet sticking up above her buttocks would be a cool angle also. This is nice... great study on the human form and lighting. Great job.</td>', 'Interesting. I think moving the angle to being straight on her back so you cannot see her legs, only her feet sticking up above her buttocks would be a cool angle also. This is nice... great study on the human form and lighting. Great job.', '2006-11-01 13:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984518, 417898, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but maybe zoomed in a little too tight. Needs some lighting (shadows) on the face though to make it a little more interesting. Nice.</td>', 'Nice composition but maybe zoomed in a little too tight. Needs some lighting (shadows) on the face though to make it a little more interesting. Nice.', '2006-11-01 13:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984530, 418666, 4967, '<td valign="top">Why the choice to put the drop almost directly in the center?  For this I''m not sure I agree with all the empty space on the right.</td>', 'Why the choice to put the drop almost directly in the center?  For this I''m not sure I agree with all the empty space on the right.', '2006-11-01 13:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984534, 410783, 60495, '<td valign="top">I only gave you a 6 but on the plus side it is the nicest bus shelter I have seen...</td>', 'I only gave you a 6 but on the plus side it is the nicest bus shelter I have seen...', '2006-11-01 13:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984535, 410479, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. So simple yet tells all. Great job!</td>', 'Nice composition. So simple yet tells all. Great job!', '2006-11-01 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984541, 410466, 35708, '<td valign="top">This must have been tough to get it just right but very nice composition. Any time spent on this was well spent.</td>', 'This must have been tough to get it just right but very nice composition. Any time spent on this was well spent.', '2006-11-01 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984542, 420077, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. Great portrait!!</td>', 'This is wonderful. Great portrait!!', '2006-11-01 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984564, 415274, 61379, '<td valign="top">Keep using this model.  She is gorgous.  I vote a perfect 10.</td>', 'Keep using this model.  She is gorgous.  I vote a perfect 10.', '2006-11-01 13:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
