(2985916, 416501, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wild guess: Luke or Carl? :) Looks very Kinderdijk and the quality is good. Must be magic in the air there. :)</td>', 'Wild guess: Luke or Carl? :) Looks very Kinderdijk and the quality is good. Must be magic in the air there. :)', '2006-11-01 18:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985920, 420487, 3032, '<td valign="top">This must look very cool when you can see it bigger, like 1024px on the wide side. I think that the size here at DPC unables you to show its full potential and impact. But I''ll vote on it as if it does, because I really like the idea. :)</td>', 'This must look very cool when you can see it bigger, like 1024px on the wide side. I think that the size here at DPC unables you to show its full potential and impact. But I''ll vote on it as if it does, because I really like the idea. :)', '2006-11-01 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985954, 420681, 33947, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a fun shot. Makes me smile. 6</td>', 'Now THAT is a fun shot. Makes me smile. 6', '2006-11-01 18:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985955, 420554, 18349, '<td valign="top">My goal is to comment on all the free study entries...and this happens to be the first one I open up to view.  All I can say is WOW.  I''m adding it to my faves because this is the kind of image that I aspire to create someday.  I wish you the best in the challenge, and think that even though this is the first image I''ve viewed of all the entries, I''ve already found the blue.  Congratulations.  :)</td>', 'My goal is to comment on all the free study entries...and this happens to be the first one I open up to view.  All I can say is WOW.  I''m adding it to my faves because this is the kind of image that I aspire to create someday.  I wish you the best in the challenge, and think that even though this is the first image I''ve viewed of all the entries, I''ve already found the blue.  Congratulations.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985963, 421060, 33947, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, rich color. Like how you positioned and cropped it. Nicely done. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous, rich color. Like how you positioned and cropped it. Nicely done. 7', '2006-11-01 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985969, 421064, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, reflected color. 8</td>', 'Fantastic, reflected color. 8', '2006-11-01 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985982, 416279, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective. Like how you cropped it. 7</td>', 'Neat perspective. Like how you cropped it. 7', '2006-11-01 18:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985984, 417650, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and processing technique.  The colors of the sky are a tiny bit oversaturated for my tastes, but in a huge field of images, it sometimes takes that to make an image stand out from the crowd.  I''m glad the saturation gave me cause to really study your image because I think it''s a great piece of art.  Congrats.  :)</td>', 'Very nice composition and processing technique.  The colors of the sky are a tiny bit oversaturated for my tastes, but in a huge field of images, it sometimes takes that to make an image stand out from the crowd.  I''m glad the saturation gave me cause to really study your image because I think it''s a great piece of art.  Congrats.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985988, 415171, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot...perfect timing and great field of view.  I love the colors and the tranquil feeling the image brings to mind.  :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot...perfect timing and great field of view.  I love the colors and the tranquil feeling the image brings to mind.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986004, 415274, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, great light.  There are some brighter spots on her face that are a tiny bit distracting.  I also find my eyes distracted by the bluish/white areas in the background, particularly on the right side near the bottom, and the dark area on the top left corner.  I''d crop in a bit closer on the top and right just to eliminate those areas, or clone in the greenery.  She seems very centered and I''d rather have some lead room, particularly on the right side since she''s looking into the frame.  I also find myself wishing to see either more or less of the arms...the mid-forearm seems like an unnatural place for cropping (but that''s just me).</td>', 'Beautiful model, great light.  There are some brighter spots on her face that are a tiny bit distracting.  I also find my eyes distracted by the bluish/white areas in the background, particularly on the right side near the bottom, and the dark area on the top left corner.  I''d crop in a bit closer on the top and right just to eliminate those areas, or clone in the greenery.  She seems very centered and I''d rather have some lead room, particularly on the right side since she''s looking into the frame.  I also find myself wishing to see either more or less of the arms...the mid-forearm seems like an unnatural place for cropping (but that''s just me).', '2006-11-01 18:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986008, 420975, 61155, '<td valign="top">:o) the curious little otters look very familier ;o)</td>', ':o) the curious little otters look very familier ;o)', '2006-11-01 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986009, 420708, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun concept. The wrinkles in the cloth are distracting, though. It''s too bad because you had some neat interplay going on with the light and shadows where the folds are. 5</td>', 'Fun concept. The wrinkles in the cloth are distracting, though. It''s too bad because you had some neat interplay going on with the light and shadows where the folds are. 5', '2006-11-01 18:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986011, 420002, 18349, '<td valign="top">Poor rhinos...such is life I suppose.  Good timing on your part, as this is a powerful image.  The shadows across the center are distracting and take away from some of the power of the image.  Nice sharpness and coloring.  :)</td>', 'Poor rhinos...such is life I suppose.  Good timing on your part, as this is a powerful image.  The shadows across the center are distracting and take away from some of the power of the image.  Nice sharpness and coloring.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986026, 412309, 33705, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective! Incredible capture! 10</td>', 'I love the perspective! Incredible capture! 10', '2006-11-01 18:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986039, 421137, 33947, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some major imagination going on in the title! Fun.</td>', 'You''ve got some major imagination going on in the title! Fun.', '2006-11-01 18:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986043, 420828, 33947, '<td valign="top">Makes you want to have a join in for a major group cuddle. Fun feel good shot. 6</td>', 'Makes you want to have a join in for a major group cuddle. Fun feel good shot. 6', '2006-11-01 18:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986046, 409567, 18349, '<td valign="top">A bit too hypersaturated for my tastes. The "glow" around the sun is workable, but appears a little too unnatural due to the coloring.  I love the composition and the reflection, which work well to set a wonderful mood.</td>', 'A bit too hypersaturated for my tastes. The "glow" around the sun is workable, but appears a little too unnatural due to the coloring.  I love the composition and the reflection, which work well to set a wonderful mood.', '2006-11-01 18:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986051, 421018, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stone formations. Sharp. 6</td>', 'Wonderful stone formations. Sharp. 6', '2006-11-01 18:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986054, 407899, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful moment to capture.  The lighting and fog are perfectly picturesque, and the image really brings the whole scene to reality in my mind.  I can almost feel the crisp air.  My only suggestion would be to take this same shot from a slightly lower angle, rather than from standing height, which might add a bit more depth or drama to it.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'What a beautiful moment to capture.  The lighting and fog are perfectly picturesque, and the image really brings the whole scene to reality in my mind.  I can almost feel the crisp air.  My only suggestion would be to take this same shot from a slightly lower angle, rather than from standing height, which might add a bit more depth or drama to it.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986055, 417972, 25042, '<td valign="top">Good composition, Some level adjustments might help bring out the colors and textures in the rock.</td>', 'Good composition, Some level adjustments might help bring out the colors and textures in the rock.', '2006-11-01 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986057, 420963, 25042, '<td valign="top">Great texture, Black and white was and excellent choice</td>', 'Great texture, Black and white was and excellent choice', '2006-11-01 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986058, 421018, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great array of textures and a good composition for such an odd assortment of shapes.  Nice black and white conversion as well.  I do think a darker sky would be better, because the whiteness seems to steal the thunder from the great texture of the rocks.  :)</td>', 'Great array of textures and a good composition for such an odd assortment of shapes.  Nice black and white conversion as well.  I do think a darker sky would be better, because the whiteness seems to steal the thunder from the great texture of the rocks.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986059, 421132, 33947, '<td valign="top">Sharp. I can''t help but wonder how far away you were. :) 6</td>', 'Sharp. I can''t help but wonder how far away you were. :) 6', '2006-11-01 18:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986062, 420553, 33705, '<td valign="top">Nice. I was in VFA-203 at Cecil Field.</td>', 'Nice. I was in VFA-203 at Cecil Field.', '2006-11-01 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986064, 414055, 25042, '<td valign="top">very unique composure I like the symmetry</td>', 'very unique composure I like the symmetry', '2006-11-01 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986067, 420123, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, and nicely executed. Like how they are positioned. 7</td>', 'Very cool idea, and nicely executed. Like how they are positioned. 7', '2006-11-01 18:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
