(2986076, 421080, 25042, '<td valign="top">Great colors, some areas of the photo are a bit too dark. The image lacks a ture focal point. Although it could just be a result of the image size. I find that landscape shots like this one are very hard to judge at the 640 pixel limit set by DPC.</td>', 'Great colors, some areas of the photo are a bit too dark. The image lacks a ture focal point. Although it could just be a result of the image size. I find that landscape shots like this one are very hard to judge at the 640 pixel limit set by DPC.', '2006-11-01 18:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986079, 420456, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, love it. Super lighting. Big 10</td>', 'Love it, love it, love it. Super lighting. Big 10', '2006-11-01 18:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986081, 409918, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect portrait. Great lighting. Great composition. Great Pose. Wondeful Model. Nice softness and textures. A 3 Way Tie for first from me.</td>', 'This is a perfect portrait. Great lighting. Great composition. Great Pose. Wondeful Model. Nice softness and textures. A 3 Way Tie for first from me.', '2006-11-01 18:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986082, 420561, 62318, '<td valign="top">Amazing stop motion. The slight color in the vase really make this image shine.  Truly one of my favorites. A three way tie for first for me.</td>', 'Amazing stop motion. The slight color in the vase really make this image shine.  Truly one of my favorites. A three way tie for first for me.', '2006-11-01 18:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986083, 419472, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I like the highlight of the one Songbird, and the fact you can just make out another. However I think there is a bit too much space that is "dead" perhaps a very slight crop? Still giving very high marks. Hope it does well. Three way tie for First Place for me.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I like the highlight of the one Songbird, and the fact you can just make out another. However I think there is a bit too much space that is "dead" perhaps a very slight crop? Still giving very high marks. Hope it does well. Three way tie for First Place for me.', '2006-11-01 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986084, 413689, 25042, '<td valign="top">great color and texture</td>', 'great color and texture', '2006-11-01 18:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986085, 415946, 33705, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing!</td>', 'Perfect timing!', '2006-11-01 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986088, 420847, 25042, '<td valign="top">the texture of the sky is excellent. great shot.</td>', 'the texture of the sky is excellent. great shot.', '2006-11-01 18:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986091, 417656, 18349, '<td valign="top">Practically perfection...I adore this!  The color, the mood, the emotive quality, the composition...I would be proud to have taken this and even prouder to hang it on the wall.  I think my only suggestion would be to take it from one side or the other to add a bit more depth to the shot, so that it''s not so centered, but then again it might not have worked due to things out of frame that I don''t know about.  Congrats on such a great capture and good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Practically perfection...I adore this!  The color, the mood, the emotive quality, the composition...I would be proud to have taken this and even prouder to hang it on the wall.  I think my only suggestion would be to take it from one side or the other to add a bit more depth to the shot, so that it''s not so centered, but then again it might not have worked due to things out of frame that I don''t know about.  Congrats on such a great capture and good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-01 18:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986096, 417685, 25042, '<td valign="top">Good composition, I like the lines. I think you could improve this shot by making the sky color more of a true black as opposed to a brown. This would accent the lighting a bit more.</td>', 'Good composition, I like the lines. I think you could improve this shot by making the sky color more of a true black as opposed to a brown. This would accent the lighting a bit more.', '2006-11-01 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986097, 413029, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh, great capture.  He needs a toothbrush.  ;)  I think this is my favorite animal shot of the challenge.  Good luck!!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh, great capture.  He needs a toothbrush.  ;)  I think this is my favorite animal shot of the challenge.  Good luck!!  :)', '2006-11-01 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986100, 420481, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a tried-and-true subject.  I like the lighting and the colors.  I think there is a bit too much negative space around the subject.  The frame is nice and works well.  :)</td>', 'Nice take on a tried-and-true subject.  I like the lighting and the colors.  I think there is a bit too much negative space around the subject.  The frame is nice and works well.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986104, 414036, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and natural coloring.  I wish there were more space around her as the image feels kind of cramped as it is cropped.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great clarity and natural coloring.  I wish there were more space around her as the image feels kind of cramped as it is cropped.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986105, 419386, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fall scene.  Great exposure control and depth of field.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful fall scene.  Great exposure control and depth of field.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986106, 415171, 47205, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and use of thirds. Well done (8)</td>', 'Wonderful colors and use of thirds. Well done (8)', '2006-11-01 18:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986109, 420480, 18349, '<td valign="top">The bright spots along the top really draw the attention away from the subject.  The dark scene is probably hard for some viewers on uncalibrated monitors to see well, so that will probably affect your score.  Nice frame.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The bright spots along the top really draw the attention away from the subject.  The dark scene is probably hard for some viewers on uncalibrated monitors to see well, so that will probably affect your score.  Nice frame.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-01 18:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986110, 420895, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good clarity under the circumstances and the perspective of the shot.</td>', 'Nice capture, good clarity under the circumstances and the perspective of the shot.', '2006-11-01 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986111, 421089, 25042, '<td valign="top">good colors. I like the reflection effect. You could enchance this shot by centering and leveling the shore line. This would increase the effect of the refection by giving and equal perspective on both sides.</td>', 'good colors. I like the reflection effect. You could enchance this shot by centering and leveling the shore line. This would increase the effect of the refection by giving and equal perspective on both sides.', '2006-11-01 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986112, 414403, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a pretty cat!  Great sharpness, especially on the eyes; lighting seems a bit harsh; the stem of the green gourd is chopped off and leads me out of the frame wondering where it went.  I''d lose the border but that''s just me.  :)</td>', 'What a pretty cat!  Great sharpness, especially on the eyes; lighting seems a bit harsh; the stem of the green gourd is chopped off and leads me out of the frame wondering where it went.  I''d lose the border but that''s just me.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986114, 420812, 18349, '<td valign="top">Terrific colors and composition.  Appears to be a bit too soft for the soft focus look, but still retains a painterly quality to it that I like.  :)</td>', 'Terrific colors and composition.  Appears to be a bit too soft for the soft focus look, but still retains a painterly quality to it that I like.  :)', '2006-11-01 18:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986115, 417898, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is creepy. I like creepy. 7</td>', 'this is creepy. I like creepy. 7', '2006-11-01 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986116, 415513, 47205, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot</td>', 'Beautiful shot', '2006-11-01 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986118, 418597, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the flame with good exposure control.  I''d lose some of the negative space around it to bring the viewer into the subject a bit more.</td>', 'Nice capture of the flame with good exposure control.  I''d lose some of the negative space around it to bring the viewer into the subject a bit more.', '2006-11-01 18:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2986121, 413519, 18349, '<td valign="top">The ocean is a great place to capture images.  The rooftop seems to cut into the frame at an odd angle, which is a bit uncomfortable framing-wise.  If the rooftop is the subject, it seems to lack some punch or power.</td>', 'The ocean is a great place to capture images.  The rooftop seems to cut into the frame at an odd angle, which is a bit uncomfortable framing-wise.  If the rooftop is the subject, it seems to lack some punch or power.', '2006-11-01 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
