(2986210, 417412, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenic shot!  Love the colors and the great vastness of the image.  I think the composition is good, but could be better without the shrubbery in the foreground and a bit more leading room along the bottom, drawing you into the bridge.  Perhaps setting the bridge off to the right a bit more would also increase the potential in this shot.  Great find and terrific view.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful scenic shot!  Love the colors and the great vastness of the image.  I think the composition is good, but could be better without the shrubbery in the foreground and a bit more leading room along the bottom, drawing you into the bridge.  Perhaps setting the bridge off to the right a bit more would also increase the potential in this shot.  Great find and terrific view.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-01 19:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
