(2986405, 412362, 18349, '<td valign="top">Fun bridal shot...but there are some things that take away from the bride''s beauty, which is probably not something the bride would want.  The green patch in the corner, and the line along the walkway...they really distract.  I''d like to see her out away from the brick wall, just on the walkway, and just it as the background...cloning it in if necessary.  Processing is beautiful, and I love the natural smile and the soft radiance of the image.  :)</td>', 'Fun bridal shot...but there are some things that take away from the bride''s beauty, which is probably not something the bride would want.  The green patch in the corner, and the line along the walkway...they really distract.  I''d like to see her out away from the brick wall, just on the walkway, and just it as the background...cloning it in if necessary.  Processing is beautiful, and I love the natural smile and the soft radiance of the image.  :)', '2006-11-01 20:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
