(2987125, 416789, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot!  Detail and lighting look good to me, as does composition.  The only thing I might suggest would be to use a background color that offsets (rather than matches) your subject.</td>', 'Interesting shot!  Detail and lighting look good to me, as does composition.  The only thing I might suggest would be to use a background color that offsets (rather than matches) your subject.', '2006-11-01 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987126, 419866, 811, '<td valign="top">This is too funny.  I like all the bright colors, but the little hot spots become distracting, just because there are so many of them.  I can''t offer any advice to fix them, though, so I suppose it isn''t really helpful. <br/> <br/>Something I do think would make the composition a bit stronger is to move the hand out of the center of the frame and use negative space to your advantage.  By having the hand in the lower right or left corner, it would kind of give the impression of being "smothered" by the candy.</td>', 'This is too funny.  I like all the bright colors, but the little hot spots become distracting, just because there are so many of them.  I can''t offer any advice to fix them, though, so I suppose it isn''t really helpful.  Something I do think would make the composition a bit stronger is to move the hand out of the center of the frame and use negative space to your advantage.  By having the hand in the lower right or left corner, it would kind of give the impression of being "smothered" by the candy.', '2006-11-01 22:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987129, 408761, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice sillhouette!  The ripples on the water add some really nice texture to this photo.</td>', 'Very nice sillhouette!  The ripples on the water add some really nice texture to this photo.', '2006-11-01 22:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
