(2987153, 406384, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how he/she is "hiding" behind the rock.  He looks kind of sad though.  Is it a catamount or a cougar?   I thought catamounts'' ears were more pointy, and they had smaller heads.  They are mean looking little boogers.  (My college mascot was the catamount so I am basing it on that, and may be totally off base.  In which case, just ignore everything after "sad.")</td>', 'I really like how he/she is "hiding" behind the rock.  He looks kind of sad though.  Is it a catamount or a cougar?   I thought catamounts'' ears were more pointy, and they had smaller heads.  They are mean looking little boogers.  (My college mascot was the catamount so I am basing it on that, and may be totally off base.  In which case, just ignore everything after "sad.")', '2006-11-01 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987154, 421067, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks pretty good on this shot.  I feel like the framing might be a little too close for my tastes...I feel like seeing a little more of her would tell more about her personality.</td>', 'Lighting looks pretty good on this shot.  I feel like the framing might be a little too close for my tastes...I feel like seeing a little more of her would tell more about her personality.', '2006-11-01 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987156, 406917, 29011, '<td valign="top">Looks like the kitchen table after a fun family night :)<br/>There are a few technical areas this photo could be improved upon. 1. the white balance, the photo has a harsh yellow cast, the colors too warm. 2. the verticals aren''t straight. Would like to see straight verticals on this kind of image. 3. There seems to be some slight motion blur. Either you can bump up the ISO or use a tripod if your cam has too much noise at those setting.</td>', 'Looks like the kitchen table after a fun family night :)There are a few technical areas this photo could be improved upon. 1. the white balance, the photo has a harsh yellow cast, the colors too warm. 2. the verticals aren''t straight. Would like to see straight verticals on this kind of image. 3. There seems to be some slight motion blur. Either you can bump up the ISO or use a tripod if your cam has too much noise at those setting.', '2006-11-01 22:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987157, 408451, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and lighting on the car..but with the main focal point (for me) being the reflection on the car, I might like to see a more interesting scene reflected.</td>', 'Nice detail and lighting on the car..but with the main focal point (for me) being the reflection on the car, I might like to see a more interesting scene reflected.', '2006-11-01 22:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
