(2987242, 418833, 41337, '<td valign="top">The color or lack there of near the sun seems a little strange to me but all in all I really like the scene you captured.</td>', 'The color or lack there of near the sun seems a little strange to me but all in all I really like the scene you captured.', '2006-11-01 23:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987244, 420671, 20462, '<td valign="top">nice, but without the IR would this even be a photographable location??</td>', 'nice, but without the IR would this even be a photographable location??', '2006-11-01 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987246, 409532, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on this shot.  I like the way the curve of the road leads my eye and how the yellow line stands out so vibrantly.  I think the shot might have even more impact if taken from slightly lower to the ground--so that the road almost leads out directly from the viewer''s perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on this shot.  I like the way the curve of the road leads my eye and how the yellow line stands out so vibrantly.  I think the shot might have even more impact if taken from slightly lower to the ground--so that the road almost leads out directly from the viewer''s perspective.', '2006-11-01 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987247, 407307, 20462, '<td valign="top">effective...but I wonder if the mountain cutting into the building is distracting the viewer.</td>', 'effective...but I wonder if the mountain cutting into the building is distracting the viewer.', '2006-11-01 23:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987248, 418616, 20462, '<td valign="top">that title just scares me.</td>', 'that title just scares me.', '2006-11-01 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987249, 412051, 20462, '<td valign="top">oh like the...</td>', 'oh like the...', '2006-11-01 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987250, 409070, 811, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the colors in this shot really do it justice.  They are kind of flat and muted.  Also, I think a different crop would help to make the composition stronger.  If the model were further up in the frame, it was cropped closer on the left, and more of the right falls were showing, you would have a nice triangle for the eyes to go "around" when viewing.</td>', 'I don''t think the colors in this shot really do it justice.  They are kind of flat and muted.  Also, I think a different crop would help to make the composition stronger.  If the model were further up in the frame, it was cropped closer on the left, and more of the right falls were showing, you would have a nice triangle for the eyes to go "around" when viewing.', '2006-11-01 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987251, 407427, 20462, '<td valign="top">this is just weird.  is that a lot of noise i see?</td>', 'this is just weird.  is that a lot of noise i see?', '2006-11-01 23:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987253, 417173, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a nice moment that you''ve captured!  The colors and tones look great, but I wish there was more included in the shot!  I feel as though it''s cropped too close for my tastes.  When I look at a photo like this, what''s important to me is what the small child is doing, and the action of the child reaching.  I think that minght have been emphasized with more of the scene in the frame.</td>', 'This is a nice moment that you''ve captured!  The colors and tones look great, but I wish there was more included in the shot!  I feel as though it''s cropped too close for my tastes.  When I look at a photo like this, what''s important to me is what the small child is doing, and the action of the child reaching.  I think that minght have been emphasized with more of the scene in the frame.', '2006-11-01 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987254, 420933, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot. Super lighting. 7</td>', 'Very fun shot. Super lighting. 7', '2006-11-01 23:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987255, 420917, 20462, '<td valign="top">it is not soft and it is not sharp.  It is like you took the brightness and contrast slider and went left 20%.</td>', 'it is not soft and it is not sharp.  It is like you took the brightness and contrast slider and went left 20%.', '2006-11-01 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987258, 420505, 811, '<td valign="top">Very clean and crisp.  The front of his face is a bit hidden in the shadows, and I find this to be a bit distracting.  Otherwise an excellent shot with a lot of character.</td>', 'Very clean and crisp.  The front of his face is a bit hidden in the shadows, and I find this to be a bit distracting.  Otherwise an excellent shot with a lot of character.', '2006-11-01 23:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2987259, 420591, 35513, '<td valign="top">Oh, would I LOVE to have a boat out there!  A very majestic scene that is well composed.  The light on the hills to the right is very striking--I only wish that the mountaintops weren''t so hazy.  Still a wonderful scene.</td>', 'Oh, would I LOVE to have a boat out there!  A very majestic scene that is well composed.  The light on the hills to the right is very striking--I only wish that the mountaintops weren''t so hazy.  Still a wonderful scene.', '2006-11-01 23:14:52.000000', NULL, 1);
