(2987992, 417088, 19831, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a very nice portrait. A lovely model, and I really like the pose, and the backdrop you''ve used, it seems to compliment her nicely. I have one minor nitpick, there seems to be just ever so slightly too much shadow around her right eye. Perhaps a well placed reflector could fix that. But still a wonderful photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Overall, this is a very nice portrait. A lovely model, and I really like the pose, and the backdrop you''ve used, it seems to compliment her nicely. I have one minor nitpick, there seems to be just ever so slightly too much shadow around her right eye. Perhaps a well placed reflector could fix that. But still a wonderful photo. Nice job.', '2006-11-02 05:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
