(2988587, 418575, 811, '<td valign="top">Very graceful.  Even though the shot is obviously static, you can almost feel the movement of the petals.  Great lighting, I think, an dthe colors are wonderful.</td>', 'Very graceful.  Even though the shot is obviously static, you can almost feel the movement of the petals.  Great lighting, I think, an dthe colors are wonderful.', '2006-11-02 09:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988595, 419044, 811, '<td valign="top">I like thecomposition on this .  Even though the gazebo is lit and forefront, the eyes are drawn back to the church as well.  The lighting is a touch hot on the inside of the gazebo, and at first I thought the shadow on the church from teh tree was a saturation "splotch."  Otherwise a very well done photograph.</td>', 'I like thecomposition on this .  Even though the gazebo is lit and forefront, the eyes are drawn back to the church as well.  The lighting is a touch hot on the inside of the gazebo, and at first I thought the shadow on the church from teh tree was a saturation "splotch."  Otherwise a very well done photograph.', '2006-11-02 09:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988599, 421124, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors here.  Very dramatic.  As the picture was loading, I was thinking, "wow, what a nice soft focus image."  then, it "cleared" up as it finished loading.  So, I think a soft effect would work well with these colors (though maybe not as well in voting &lt;grin&gt;).</td>', 'Interesting colors here.  Very dramatic.  As the picture was loading, I was thinking, "wow, what a nice soft focus image."  then, it "cleared" up as it finished loading.  So, I think a soft effect would work well with these colors (though maybe not as well in voting <grin>).', '2006-11-02 09:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988605, 418996, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  My monitor is a bit brighter than the norm, I think, so it is a bit too bright for me and some of the colors start washing out.  My only nitpick (and if it is not your child, it is not something you could control) would be that a pair of "bloomers" over the diaper would give it a more finished look.</td>', 'Nice set up.  My monitor is a bit brighter than the norm, I think, so it is a bit too bright for me and some of the colors start washing out.  My only nitpick (and if it is not your child, it is not something you could control) would be that a pair of "bloomers" over the diaper would give it a more finished look.', '2006-11-02 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988619, 413963, 40430, '<td valign="top">Great background. It brings the bird to the forefront of the image. Very good work here. -9-</td>', 'Great background. It brings the bird to the forefront of the image. Very good work here. -9-', '2006-11-02 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988620, 419887, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  The man walking really adds to the scene I believe because it adds a human element to the picture and helps to develop a "story" for the picture to tell.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  The man walking really adds to the scene I believe because it adds a human element to the picture and helps to develop a "story" for the picture to tell.', '2006-11-02 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988627, 420980, 811, '<td valign="top">The lights are a bit hot.  Maybe a higher aperture number or faster shutter speed would help knock that down a bit.  Also, the focus is a bit soft.  Assuming you were using a tripod, was there a slight wind blowing? or possible movement on the water that could cause a slight movement where you were?</td>', 'The lights are a bit hot.  Maybe a higher aperture number or faster shutter speed would help knock that down a bit.  Also, the focus is a bit soft.  Assuming you were using a tripod, was there a slight wind blowing? or possible movement on the water that could cause a slight movement where you were?', '2006-11-02 10:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988634, 421047, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a point of view this is! Magnificent light to say the least...I also enjoy the muted color, it really emphasizes this light, the true star of the show, and the lay of the land...great shot.</td>', 'What a point of view this is! Magnificent light to say the least...I also enjoy the muted color, it really emphasizes this light, the true star of the show, and the lay of the land...great shot.', '2006-11-02 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988641, 417673, 40430, '<td valign="top">what does this look like in B/W? good job here.-8-</td>', 'what does this look like in B/W? good job here.-8-', '2006-11-02 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988645, 421095, 811, '<td valign="top">Your composition is good here.  I like how the tree provides a "stable" starting point, and the train leads the eye out of the frame.  The colors are a bit strange to me.  It almost looks like you brightened it too much in pp, or applied too much of a curves adjustment to it and it caused you to lose some details.</td>', 'Your composition is good here.  I like how the tree provides a "stable" starting point, and the train leads the eye out of the frame.  The colors are a bit strange to me.  It almost looks like you brightened it too much in pp, or applied too much of a curves adjustment to it and it caused you to lose some details.', '2006-11-02 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988653, 414428, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well. . .since I was with you when you took this shot -- I can''t deny that I know whose it is -- but I have to say:  It takes my breath away!   The exposure and focus are perfect!  The moon adds so much beautiful drama to the photo -- and that starry fence taken with a wide angle lens was a genius touch that adds so much elegance to this photo!  At first -- I was hoping to maybe enter one of my Capitol shots into this Free Study -- but now I''m so glad I didn''t because I did''t have one nearly this cool and beautiful!  It''s going straight into my favorites folder -- and it gets an unhesitating 10!</td>', 'Well. . .since I was with you when you took this shot -- I can''t deny that I know whose it is -- but I have to say:  It takes my breath away!   The exposure and focus are perfect!  The moon adds so much beautiful drama to the photo -- and that starry fence taken with a wide angle lens was a genius touch that adds so much elegance to this photo!  At first -- I was hoping to maybe enter one of my Capitol shots into this Free Study -- but now I''m so glad I didn''t because I did''t have one nearly this cool and beautiful!  It''s going straight into my favorites folder -- and it gets an unhesitating 10!', '2006-11-02 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988654, 420909, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the color...makes a spooky cool abstract.</td>', 'Love the color...makes a spooky cool abstract.', '2006-11-02 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988659, 420590, 811, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like how the river leads through the picture.  Good detail throughout.  I do, however, find myself wanting to tilt it to the right about 2 degrees, even though I understand it is probably just the natural slope of the mountains.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like how the river leads through the picture.  Good detail throughout.  I do, however, find myself wanting to tilt it to the right about 2 degrees, even though I understand it is probably just the natural slope of the mountains.', '2006-11-02 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988661, 420840, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this processing...the color is simply delicious and works so well with the subject matter and wide view, really grabbed my attention.</td>', 'I really like this processing...the color is simply delicious and works so well with the subject matter and wide view, really grabbed my attention.', '2006-11-02 10:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988665, 414844, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how PRETTY!  "My" kind of photo for sure!  I love the softness of it.  Too much sharpening on animal fur ruins it imo -- and this one is just right!    Beautiful rich colors -- Aren''t tigers just so amazingly photogenic?   I hope your tiger is scoring as good as they were nice enough to score mine at  :)</td>', 'Oh how PRETTY!  "My" kind of photo for sure!  I love the softness of it.  Too much sharpening on animal fur ruins it imo -- and this one is just right!    Beautiful rich colors -- Aren''t tigers just so amazingly photogenic?   I hope your tiger is scoring as good as they were nice enough to score mine at  :)', '2006-11-02 10:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988669, 420121, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!!  God did GOOD!!!!!   And so did YOU!!!!!!!   He not only gave us the gift of that glorious scene -- but He gave YOU the gift to capture it perfectly for us :)   Thank you!</td>', 'Oh yeah!!  God did GOOD!!!!!   And so did YOU!!!!!!!   He not only gave us the gift of that glorious scene -- but He gave YOU the gift to capture it perfectly for us :)   Thank you!', '2006-11-02 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988680, 420209, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition, but the focus is off enough to really just steal from a spectacular image.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition, but the focus is off enough to really just steal from a spectacular image.', '2006-11-02 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988687, 417656, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the clothes are read and yellow, and so are leaves.</td>', 'I like how the clothes are read and yellow, and so are leaves.', '2006-11-02 10:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988690, 408713, 20462, '<td valign="top">whoa.  this is right up my alley.  you directed the placement of eyes and "look away" masterfully.</td>', 'whoa.  this is right up my alley.  you directed the placement of eyes and "look away" masterfully.', '2006-11-02 10:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988697, 420589, 20462, '<td valign="top">truly endearing. but is it aloofness, joy or a "that''s life!" kinda look?</td>', 'truly endearing. but is it aloofness, joy or a "that''s life!" kinda look?', '2006-11-02 10:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988699, 420117, 20462, '<td valign="top">i like...i am suspecting others will too.</td>', 'i like...i am suspecting others will too.', '2006-11-02 10:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988701, 416191, 20462, '<td valign="top">aggressive editing.  i normally see this is b/w, not super saturation.  It pays off 94% for me.  like.</td>', 'aggressive editing.  i normally see this is b/w, not super saturation.  It pays off 94% for me.  like.', '2006-11-02 10:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988702, 418113, 811, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go riding. . .<br/> <br/>I like the angle of perspective you have chosen.  My only two suggestions would be a slightly sharper focus, and turn down the yellow/greens a bit.  teh trees in the background are so "bright" they end up being the focal point, to me, instead of the the bike, which is what I assume is your subject.</td>', 'Makes me want to go riding. . . I like the angle of perspective you have chosen.  My only two suggestions would be a slightly sharper focus, and turn down the yellow/greens a bit.  teh trees in the background are so "bright" they end up being the focal point, to me, instead of the the bike, which is what I assume is your subject.', '2006-11-02 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988704, 420192, 20462, '<td valign="top">as in the man?  wait a second....this looks real...on a technical note, the shadow on the right is the only thing that should go.</td>', 'as in the man?  wait a second....this looks real...on a technical note, the shadow on the right is the only thing that should go.', '2006-11-02 10:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988709, 407372, 20462, '<td valign="top">i love this colorful desat look.</td>', 'i love this colorful desat look.', '2006-11-02 10:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988718, 413946, 20462, '<td valign="top">i like this concept enough I might have to steal the "general" idea for myself!...i don''t like the background way back though.  still good score.</td>', 'i like this concept enough I might have to steal the "general" idea for myself!...i don''t like the background way back though.  still good score.', '2006-11-02 10:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988724, 418626, 20462, '<td valign="top">cool..this is the same color scheme firsty used on a ribbon winner.  It does the opera house justice every time</td>', 'cool..this is the same color scheme firsty used on a ribbon winner.  It does the opera house justice every time', '2006-11-02 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
