(2988732, 417650, 20462, '<td valign="top">not too overprocessed at all.  You captured the stillness, color spectrum and general atmosphere of this scene.  Too bad you couldn''t have a light emitting from the tower ;)</td>', 'not too overprocessed at all.  You captured the stillness, color spectrum and general atmosphere of this scene.  Too bad you couldn''t have a light emitting from the tower ;)', '2006-11-02 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
