(2988797, 418312, 811, '<td valign="top">The saturation makes for a nice reflection, but it is a bit much, I think.</td>', 'The saturation makes for a nice reflection, but it is a bit much, I think.', '2006-11-02 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
