(2989065, 420848, 50695, '<td valign="top">turning this sideways was a great idea. you''ve got a big old triangle and the bird''s position is just ambiguous enough that we can "buy" it. 7</td>', 'turning this sideways was a great idea. you''ve got a big old triangle and the bird''s position is just ambiguous enough that we can "buy" it. 7', '2006-11-02 12:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989073, 418822, 50695, '<td valign="top">good eye. excellent composition. the interplay of natural and geometric shadow on geometric forms is complex and fascinating. the high contrast simplifies it just enough to make it visually palatable. I''ll start this at 9</td>', 'good eye. excellent composition. the interplay of natural and geometric shadow on geometric forms is complex and fascinating. the high contrast simplifies it just enough to make it visually palatable. I''ll start this at 9', '2006-11-02 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
