(2989218, 418975, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image to look at.  The natural lines formed by the trees coming to a ''V'' and the clouds loosely matching the shape all enhance this photo.  Big downer for me is the processing done on the clouds.  There seems to be a distinct line/area of clouds in the ''V'' section that are burned in while the same color and pattern of clouds just to the left are in a more natural state.  I wouldn''t have messed with that sky.  It would have been great left as is.  Great eye to see this image shape up.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image to look at.  The natural lines formed by the trees coming to a ''V'' and the clouds loosely matching the shape all enhance this photo.  Big downer for me is the processing done on the clouds.  There seems to be a distinct line/area of clouds in the ''V'' section that are burned in while the same color and pattern of clouds just to the left are in a more natural state.  I wouldn''t have messed with that sky.  It would have been great left as is.  Great eye to see this image shape up.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
