(2989665, 418626, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloration you have used on this .  So many times it is seen at night in color, but this adds a different aspect to it.  Also different from the typically seen angle.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the coloration you have used on this .  So many times it is seen at night in color, but this adds a different aspect to it.  Also different from the typically seen angle.  Very nicely done.', '2006-11-02 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989666, 420895, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. The photographer enters the photograph... feeds the photograph... a powerful metaphor. Your processing is perfect for this idea. It seems like everything is on the verge of utter whiteness... like you are crossing over... I''ll start this at 8</td>', 'Wow. The photographer enters the photograph... feeds the photograph... a powerful metaphor. Your processing is perfect for this idea. It seems like everything is on the verge of utter whiteness... like you are crossing over... I''ll start this at 8', '2006-11-02 15:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989670, 407372, 48479, '<td valign="top">what a shot. bring on the melbourne cup.</td>', 'what a shot. bring on the melbourne cup.', '2006-11-02 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989671, 418619, 811, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and good control of the exposure.  The sky being something other than white would be better, I think, but hard to control the sky. ;)  Good work.</td>', 'Very pretty and good control of the exposure.  The sky being something other than white would be better, I think, but hard to control the sky. ;)  Good work.', '2006-11-02 15:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989680, 412866, 811, '<td valign="top">good lighting.  i think a warmer color tone would help a bit.  the cool blue makes him seem dead.</td>', 'good lighting.  i think a warmer color tone would help a bit.  the cool blue makes him seem dead.', '2006-11-02 15:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989684, 417268, 811, '<td valign="top">There has to be a story behind this shot.  This is great!</td>', 'There has to be a story behind this shot.  This is great!', '2006-11-02 15:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989687, 417972, 811, '<td valign="top">good color and exposure.  I like how the trees/rock/blue make three distinct diagonal strata.  Very balanced compositionally.</td>', 'good color and exposure.  I like how the trees/rock/blue make three distinct diagonal strata.  Very balanced compositionally.', '2006-11-02 15:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989689, 421128, 811, '<td valign="top">Good crop.  A slightly sharper focus would help, I think, but otherwise nicely done.  I like that the tiger''s coloring is very natural.</td>', 'Good crop.  A slightly sharper focus would help, I think, but otherwise nicely done.  I like that the tiger''s coloring is very natural.', '2006-11-02 15:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989692, 414885, 52713, '<td valign="top">like the shot, the sign is a distraction.</td>', 'like the shot, the sign is a distraction.', '2006-11-02 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989693, 421035, 811, '<td valign="top">A bit more context/setting would really make this portrait tell a story.</td>', 'A bit more context/setting would really make this portrait tell a story.', '2006-11-02 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989695, 406856, 34134, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot.</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot.', '2006-11-02 15:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989697, 421037, 811, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and colors.  I think more room at the bottom (so the horse''s and jockey''s knees weren''t cut) and less at the top would have made it feel a little more complete.</td>', 'Good exposure and colors.  I think more room at the bottom (so the horse''s and jockey''s knees weren''t cut) and less at the top would have made it feel a little more complete.', '2006-11-02 15:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989698, 416265, 23962, '<td valign="top">aI love it. I''m not sure it will get dq''d though.</td>', 'aI love it. I''m not sure it will get dq''d though.', '2006-11-02 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989700, 418813, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  There seems to be a bit of noise, perhaps from brighting/lighting.  As a result, the focus looks a little off.  But, my two kids (son almost 5 yo and daughter almost 2 yo) *loved* this shot.</td>', 'Good capture.  There seems to be a bit of noise, perhaps from brighting/lighting.  As a result, the focus looks a little off.  But, my two kids (son almost 5 yo and daughter almost 2 yo) *loved* this shot.', '2006-11-02 15:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989704, 420521, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture in what appears to be a difficult lighting situation.  I like how the subjects create a diagonal up through the frame.</td>', 'Good capture in what appears to be a difficult lighting situation.  I like how the subjects create a diagonal up through the frame.', '2006-11-02 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989714, 418766, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Exposure and colors work well.  I think a bit more background (though I do like his face filling the frame) would help to tell a bit more of a story.</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Exposure and colors work well.  I think a bit more background (though I do like his face filling the frame) would help to tell a bit more of a story.', '2006-11-02 15:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989725, 411332, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and composition</td>', 'Awesome colors and composition', '2006-11-02 15:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989728, 420596, 811, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this and interesting composition.</td>', 'Great lighting on this and interesting composition.', '2006-11-02 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989735, 412863, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I also like the contrast between the green on the outside of the circle and the dead leaves in the middle.</td>', 'Good composition.  I also like the contrast between the green on the outside of the circle and the dead leaves in the middle.', '2006-11-02 15:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989744, 420971, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on this - very dramatic</td>', 'Nice lighting on this - very dramatic', '2006-11-02 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989748, 420994, 811, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch too much saturation, but the compositin and perspective is awesome.</td>', 'Maybe a touch too much saturation, but the compositin and perspective is awesome.', '2006-11-02 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989753, 416265, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow.  very desolate and dramatic looking.  Way to "capture" an emotion in a landscape.</td>', 'Wow.  very desolate and dramatic looking.  Way to "capture" an emotion in a landscape.', '2006-11-02 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989754, 419826, 811, '<td valign="top">My first thought was why is the light coming out of her head -- oops.  Otherwise a very nicely done portrait -- good lighting focus and exposure.</td>', 'My first thought was why is the light coming out of her head -- oops.  Otherwise a very nicely done portrait -- good lighting focus and exposure.', '2006-11-02 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989759, 418840, 811, '<td valign="top">He (she?) looks like he''s drowning.  Nice blue water, though.  The square crop works well, here, I think.</td>', 'He (she?) looks like he''s drowning.  Nice blue water, though.  The square crop works well, here, I think.', '2006-11-02 15:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989764, 418596, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.  The blue is a bit much, and almost overpowers the building to me, though.</td>', 'Awesome composition.  The blue is a bit much, and almost overpowers the building to me, though.', '2006-11-02 15:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
