(2989785, 421064, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but I think you pushed the blue to a point past realistic.  The orange and reds, ok, fine for this time of year.  It''s the blue on the branch in the water that seems too much for me.  Otherwise, great eye to see this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this, but I think you pushed the blue to a point past realistic.  The orange and reds, ok, fine for this time of year.  It''s the blue on the branch in the water that seems too much for me.  Otherwise, great eye to see this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 15:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989789, 415254, 7969, '<td valign="top">this is really nice, just wish the horizon was not so central</td>', 'this is really nice, just wish the horizon was not so central', '2006-11-02 15:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989800, 407395, 7969, '<td valign="top">need to straighten the horizon, nice light.</td>', 'need to straighten the horizon, nice light.', '2006-11-02 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989805, 415171, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a textbook dpc picture. I''ll be interested to see how it scores. I''ll give you a 7, because it does have some heart, not just flash.</td>', 'this is a textbook dpc picture. I''ll be interested to see how it scores. I''ll give you a 7, because it does have some heart, not just flash.', '2006-11-02 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989806, 419826, 7969, '<td valign="top">i dont like the placement of subject under that light, looks like it is gonna fall on her head, and it is distracting to an otherwise good subject</td>', 'i dont like the placement of subject under that light, looks like it is gonna fall on her head, and it is distracting to an otherwise good subject', '2006-11-02 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989810, 420192, 50695, '<td valign="top">great portrait. you captured so much of his style, his mood, yet the picture seems so intimate. I feel like I am getting a great opportunity to get close to a very guarded person. I''ll start this at 8</td>', 'great portrait. you captured so much of his style, his mood, yet the picture seems so intimate. I feel like I am getting a great opportunity to get close to a very guarded person. I''ll start this at 8', '2006-11-02 15:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989812, 411736, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful effect. you got skills. exciting composition, too. thank you for not putting the ghost on the "intersection of the thirds". I''ll start this at 8.</td>', 'wonderful effect. you got skills. exciting composition, too. thank you for not putting the ghost on the "intersection of the thirds". I''ll start this at 8.', '2006-11-02 15:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989813, 418252, 7969, '<td valign="top">wish there was a little more space on the bottom by tail, but very nice shot 9</td>', 'wish there was a little more space on the bottom by tail, but very nice shot 9', '2006-11-02 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
