(2989822, 406917, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you a 7 for taking the most un-DPC picture I''ve ever seen. Hope I don''t screw up your brown ribbon attempt...</td>', 'I''ll give you a 7 for taking the most un-DPC picture I''ve ever seen. Hope I don''t screw up your brown ribbon attempt...', '2006-11-02 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
