(2989906, 414935, 50695, '<td valign="top">remarkable feeling of tenderness from two places I almost never see tenderness: in horses and in teenagers! 7 for now</td>', 'remarkable feeling of tenderness from two places I almost never see tenderness: in horses and in teenagers! 7 for now', '2006-11-02 16:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989913, 420218, 47534, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment, and good idea, but could this benefit from a tighter crop &amp; some fill-lighting (to increase the strength of the mother &amp; daughter)?<br/> <br/>BTW - If this is YOUR family, then just enjoy the memory &amp; forget what anyone says! ;)</td>', 'Nice sentiment, and good idea, but could this benefit from a tighter crop & some fill-lighting (to increase the strength of the mother & daughter)? BTW - If this is YOUR family, then just enjoy the memory & forget what anyone says! ;)', '2006-11-02 16:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
