(2990345, 414758, 67152, '<td valign="top">The shapes of those branches are insane!  Excellent job utilizing the canopy of golds and orange to bring them out.</td>', 'The shapes of those branches are insane!  Excellent job utilizing the canopy of golds and orange to bring them out.', '2006-11-02 18:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990348, 421097, 66515, '<td valign="top">The idea here was good but hard to carry out. The two rocks draw your eyes out of the frame as there is nothing to really look at in the middle of the shot.</td>', 'The idea here was good but hard to carry out. The two rocks draw your eyes out of the frame as there is nothing to really look at in the middle of the shot.', '2006-11-02 18:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
