(2990352, 419455, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little smallish. I would prefer having a larger image to look at so we can see more detail as it is evident there is a lot to look at here of interest.</td>', 'A little smallish. I would prefer having a larger image to look at so we can see more detail as it is evident there is a lot to look at here of interest.', '2006-11-02 18:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990353, 420217, 66384, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very nice. I would like this better if I could see the pelican''s eye. Also the very bright reflection below the pelican is distracting. Easy enough to tone it down.</td>', 'The lighting is very nice. I would like this better if I could see the pelican''s eye. Also the very bright reflection below the pelican is distracting. Easy enough to tone it down.', '2006-11-02 18:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
