(2990356, 421050, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but unfortunately the baloons are a little too small to be effective. The sun on the right also seems to work against the contrast of the picture which is alright on the left side.</td>', 'I like the idea but unfortunately the baloons are a little too small to be effective. The sun on the right also seems to work against the contrast of the picture which is alright on the left side.', '2006-11-02 18:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990358, 404718, 811, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful -- elegant and graceful.</td>', 'Very very beautiful -- elegant and graceful.', '2006-11-02 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990359, 419523, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-11-02 18:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990360, 421080, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the falling leaves unfortunately. The foliage is a little out of focus and the portions of the picture that are in focus are are a bit underexposed.</td>', 'Hard to see the falling leaves unfortunately. The foliage is a little out of focus and the portions of the picture that are in focus are are a bit underexposed.', '2006-11-02 18:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990362, 412304, 66384, '<td valign="top">Why did you crop off the left side of the truck?</td>', 'Why did you crop off the left side of the truck?', '2006-11-02 18:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990364, 417039, 66515, '<td valign="top">This shot is kind of disturbing. The idea is cool however.</td>', 'This shot is kind of disturbing. The idea is cool however.', '2006-11-02 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990368, 420681, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a terrific moment to capture so candidly...great composition!!!!  :)</td>', 'What a terrific moment to capture so candidly...great composition!!!!  :)', '2006-11-02 18:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990372, 416396, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and movement in the clouds.  I do want to comment on the fact that your horizon line serves to divide the image into halves, which is not quite as dramatic or dynamic as thirds might be...however, the different areas of shore out to the water serve to give the image a bit more depth and dimension.  Nicely exposed and colored.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Lovely colors and movement in the clouds.  I do want to comment on the fact that your horizon line serves to divide the image into halves, which is not quite as dramatic or dynamic as thirds might be...however, the different areas of shore out to the water serve to give the image a bit more depth and dimension.  Nicely exposed and colored.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-02 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990376, 414479, 66384, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the surfer better. The wave is beautiful, but the surfer is the central object.</td>', 'I wish I could see the surfer better. The wave is beautiful, but the surfer is the central object.', '2006-11-02 18:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990380, 415185, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a lovely reflection.  The image almost seems surreal due to the symmetry from top to bottom.  The issue I''d like to comment upon is the fact that your horizon line really chops the image into two halves, which is not very dynamic.  In an image like this, I''d rather see less sky and more reflection, or less reflection and more sky, but I can definitely see where you were going with this because of the symmetrical composition.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a lovely reflection.  The image almost seems surreal due to the symmetry from top to bottom.  The issue I''d like to comment upon is the fact that your horizon line really chops the image into two halves, which is not very dynamic.  In an image like this, I''d rather see less sky and more reflection, or less reflection and more sky, but I can definitely see where you were going with this because of the symmetrical composition.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-02 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990383, 415413, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and good composition.  The dark clouds in the corners and the vignetting is a bit strong, but still quite dramatic.</td>', 'Lovely scene and good composition.  The dark clouds in the corners and the vignetting is a bit strong, but still quite dramatic.', '2006-11-02 18:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990386, 421020, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''d give my left eye to be able to see this in person...what a terrific view!   Such a bucolic and tranquil scene.  Gorgeous colors and good composition.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'I''d give my left eye to be able to see this in person...what a terrific view!   Such a bucolic and tranquil scene.  Gorgeous colors and good composition.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-02 18:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990391, 415509, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The wings are amazing.</td>', 'Very nice. The wings are amazing.', '2006-11-02 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990393, 419325, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed; the dark areas around the cluster of leaves is a bit too dark for my personal tastes, as I like to view more vibrant fall colors and less darkness, but that is neither here nor there.  ;)   I think this could be cropped a bit more on the left so that the leaf cluster isn''t so centered.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Nicely composed; the dark areas around the cluster of leaves is a bit too dark for my personal tastes, as I like to view more vibrant fall colors and less darkness, but that is neither here nor there.  ;)   I think this could be cropped a bit more on the left so that the leaf cluster isn''t so centered.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990399, 419958, 29011, '<td valign="top">A nice clean vibrant shot. The composition is nicely balance, so that the negative space on the left works good.</td>', 'A nice clean vibrant shot. The composition is nicely balance, so that the negative space on the left works good.', '2006-11-02 18:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990405, 420708, 66384, '<td valign="top">My eye keeps going to the crumpled backdrop. I find it distracting. Also I think the lable and bread are a little too bright. Still it is a nice composition, and the highlights on the terracotta are good. IMHO</td>', 'My eye keeps going to the crumpled backdrop. I find it distracting. Also I think the lable and bread are a little too bright. Still it is a nice composition, and the highlights on the terracotta are good. IMHO', '2006-11-02 18:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990407, 414249, 18349, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene...some areas are a bit bright, and I think the lower half of the image could use a bit less blue and maybe a little more red...but that could be my monitor.  I think this is a lovely composition; good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Pretty scene...some areas are a bit bright, and I think the lower half of the image could use a bit less blue and maybe a little more red...but that could be my monitor.  I think this is a lovely composition; good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990410, 420919, 18349, '<td valign="top">Dramatic scene...the sun in the very center is a bit anti-climactic, however.  I think this could be a great subject and the colors are beautiful and bold.  I  am not crazy about the border but that''s just a personal thing.  ;)</td>', 'Dramatic scene...the sun in the very center is a bit anti-climactic, however.  I think this could be a great subject and the colors are beautiful and bold.  I  am not crazy about the border but that''s just a personal thing.  ;)', '2006-11-02 18:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990413, 414824, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a great moment to capture...very emotive and telling of this man''s years of hard living.  :)</td>', 'What a great moment to capture...very emotive and telling of this man''s years of hard living.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990415, 407516, 66384, '<td valign="top">Hard to catch white fur and feathers without blowing out the detail. The right side of the face is lacking some detail. Also the brightness of the tree distracts from the owl.</td>', 'Hard to catch white fur and feathers without blowing out the detail. The right side of the face is lacking some detail. Also the brightness of the tree distracts from the owl.', '2006-11-02 18:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990417, 420966, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a sweet portrait.  I''d like to see some more sharpness in the eyes, especially on the lashes.  Good contrast and excellent composition.  :)</td>', 'What a sweet portrait.  I''d like to see some more sharpness in the eyes, especially on the lashes.  Good contrast and excellent composition.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990421, 421000, 18349, '<td valign="top">Moo!  Interesting minimalist piece.  The white sky is a bit plain and too white for my personal tastes, but the composition works well.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Moo!  Interesting minimalist piece.  The white sky is a bit plain and too white for my personal tastes, but the composition works well.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990426, 417533, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great textures in this image.  Good composition and black/white conversion.  Good luck in the challenge! :)</td>', 'Great textures in this image.  Good composition and black/white conversion.  Good luck in the challenge! :)', '2006-11-02 18:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990438, 420746, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalistic shot!  Plenty of action going on.  The signs are really driven home by the college building in the back.</td>', 'Great photojournalistic shot!  Plenty of action going on.  The signs are really driven home by the college building in the back.', '2006-11-02 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990439, 420084, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good catch ;)  Too bad the focus is so soft on the bird.</td>', 'Good catch ;)  Too bad the focus is so soft on the bird.', '2006-11-02 18:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990440, 420480, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the shot, but the bright spots in the upper right are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the feel of the shot, but the bright spots in the upper right are a bit distracting.', '2006-11-02 18:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990441, 419390, 35513, '<td valign="top">A nice mountain scene.  The peaks look very majestic, though the sky is a little bland.  The trees are so lovely, I might like to see a little more of them in the shot.</td>', 'A nice mountain scene.  The peaks look very majestic, though the sky is a little bland.  The trees are so lovely, I might like to see a little more of them in the shot.', '2006-11-02 18:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990443, 417039, 18349, '<td valign="top">It''s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown!!!  ;)<br/> <br/>Neat idea and nicely executed.  It''s nice to see fun shots like this amongst the grandiose vistas and flower macros.  ;)</td>', 'It''s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown!!!  ;) Neat idea and nicely executed.  It''s nice to see fun shots like this amongst the grandiose vistas and flower macros.  ;)', '2006-11-02 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990447, 414723, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadowy areas in this shot...I think it would be very moody if the light on the alligators was a little less bright.  On the whole, it makes a nice scene and evokes an almost eerie mood for me.</td>', 'I really like the shadowy areas in this shot...I think it would be very moody if the light on the alligators was a little less bright.  On the whole, it makes a nice scene and evokes an almost eerie mood for me.', '2006-11-02 18:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990452, 420217, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition and subject for this shot.  It looks almost as if the focus is on the body of the bird, rather than on the head.  That is to say, the head of the bird looks a little soft to me.  Part of that is probably due to the backlighting, but my eye is really drawn to the head and beak of the pelican.</td>', 'Good composition and subject for this shot.  It looks almost as if the focus is on the body of the bird, rather than on the head.  That is to say, the head of the bird looks a little soft to me.  Part of that is probably due to the backlighting, but my eye is really drawn to the head and beak of the pelican.', '2006-11-02 18:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990454, 411563, 23002, '<td valign="top">love the saturation</td>', 'love the saturation', '2006-11-02 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990455, 419161, 35513, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors!!  That sky is incredible, and I love the motion of the water that you''ve captured.  Nice job with placing something interesting in the foreground and background...gives depth to the photo!</td>', 'Amazing colors!!  That sky is incredible, and I love the motion of the water that you''ve captured.  Nice job with placing something interesting in the foreground and background...gives depth to the photo!', '2006-11-02 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990458, 421089, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and reflection. I wish I could see more of the top of this scene.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and reflection. I wish I could see more of the top of this scene.', '2006-11-02 18:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990459, 413963, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crisp shot, and the leaves behind make a beautiful backdrop!  Great bokeh on this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful crisp shot, and the leaves behind make a beautiful backdrop!  Great bokeh on this photo.', '2006-11-02 18:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990462, 415187, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very graceful. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Very graceful. Nice lighting.', '2006-11-02 18:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990463, 420678, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture on the wood.  I like the lighting on the wood, but I might have preferred catching a littl ebit of color in the sky as well, to complement the colors in the wood.</td>', 'Interesting texture on the wood.  I like the lighting on the wood, but I might have preferred catching a littl ebit of color in the sky as well, to complement the colors in the wood.', '2006-11-02 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990464, 417139, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot made me smile :-)  Beautiful glow around this couple, and a shot I''m sure they''ll love for many years to come!</td>', 'This shot made me smile :-)  Beautiful glow around this couple, and a shot I''m sure they''ll love for many years to come!', '2006-11-02 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990466, 413556, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, beautiful lighting...bad pose.  The unnatural angle of her head, and the fact that she is both slanting her head and leaning forward at the same time is not flattering.  The lightness of her wrist puts too much attention on the fact that her hand is also on a pretty heavy angle, and then cuts off her fingers.<br/> <br/>On the plus side I love the nice porcelin skin look, and the brightening to her teeth and eyes look great.  A different pose and this would be a knock out!</td>', 'Beautiful model, beautiful lighting...bad pose.  The unnatural angle of her head, and the fact that she is both slanting her head and leaning forward at the same time is not flattering.  The lightness of her wrist puts too much attention on the fact that her hand is also on a pretty heavy angle, and then cuts off her fingers. On the plus side I love the nice porcelin skin look, and the brightening to her teeth and eyes look great.  A different pose and this would be a knock out!', '2006-11-02 18:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990468, 420104, 23002, '<td valign="top">too much blackness which is all too centred.</td>', 'too much blackness which is all too centred.', '2006-11-02 18:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990469, 416824, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors and lighting on this shot.  I like the close up, but I wish the upper part of the flower hadn''t been cut off.</td>', 'Good colors and lighting on this shot.  I like the close up, but I wish the upper part of the flower hadn''t been cut off.', '2006-11-02 18:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990470, 419973, 23002, '<td valign="top">It kind of makes me dizzy... however there is not enough of the trunks to draw me in.  It seems to lack some punch.  Great concept though.</td>', 'It kind of makes me dizzy... however there is not enough of the trunks to draw me in.  It seems to lack some punch.  Great concept though.', '2006-11-02 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990472, 418820, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love in-the-moment captures like this...to me, it''s what photography should be about instead of the processed-to-the-gills, saturated studio shots that seem so unreal.  Beautiful.  :)</td>', 'I love in-the-moment captures like this...to me, it''s what photography should be about instead of the processed-to-the-gills, saturated studio shots that seem so unreal.  Beautiful.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990473, 420511, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl, and you captured the mood. I find the dark line in background distracting.</td>', 'Lovely girl, and you captured the mood. I find the dark line in background distracting.', '2006-11-02 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990474, 411549, 23002, '<td valign="top">nice composition and tones.</td>', 'nice composition and tones.', '2006-11-02 18:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990477, 420841, 35513, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot that certainly evokes some emotion.  I think I wish I could see it in color, as just that hint of green would add a little something IMO.  Nice job with the fog/mist.</td>', 'An interesting shot that certainly evokes some emotion.  I think I wish I could see it in color, as just that hint of green would add a little something IMO.  Nice job with the fog/mist.', '2006-11-02 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990478, 420857, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very sweet capture.  I''d consider cropping a bit more from the right side so that the little guy isn''t so central in the frame, but that''s just me.  Nice black and white.  :)</td>', 'Very sweet capture.  I''d consider cropping a bit more from the right side so that the little guy isn''t so central in the frame, but that''s just me.  Nice black and white.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
