(2990481, 420481, 23002, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2006-11-02 18:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990482, 417903, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great textures and tonal range...I do think the image is a little bit busy for my eyes to take everything in all at once.  I love the sky.  The lighthouse is such a small part of the composition, but is your title of choice.  I wonder how this would have looked from a lower vantage point, with more sky and less foreground.  :)</td>', 'Great textures and tonal range...I do think the image is a little bit busy for my eyes to take everything in all at once.  I love the sky.  The lighthouse is such a small part of the composition, but is your title of choice.  I wonder how this would have looked from a lower vantage point, with more sky and less foreground.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990483, 419826, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really nice job on the woman here, but I wish that the chandelier didn''t look like it was growing out of her head.  I do like the hint of light that the chandelier reflects, but be careful to place it to either side of the head.</td>', 'Really nice job on the woman here, but I wish that the chandelier didn''t look like it was growing out of her head.  I do like the hint of light that the chandelier reflects, but be careful to place it to either side of the head.', '2006-11-02 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
