(2990507, 420011, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is lovely...being a Texas gal, it speaks right to my heart.  Great composition and color.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Wow, this is lovely...being a Texas gal, it speaks right to my heart.  Great composition and color.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-02 18:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990510, 421070, 35513, '<td valign="top">A nice fall shot with lovely leaves.  Composition looks pretty good, but I might be interested in seeing it from a slightly lower perspective.</td>', 'A nice fall shot with lovely leaves.  Composition looks pretty good, but I might be interested in seeing it from a slightly lower perspective.', '2006-11-02 18:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990512, 416116, 59740, '<td valign="top">The white sweater is so bright and up front that my attention is drawn to it, away from her face. Otherwise a very nice study.</td>', 'The white sweater is so bright and up front that my attention is drawn to it, away from her face. Otherwise a very nice study.', '2006-11-02 18:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990513, 421018, 7969, '<td valign="top">i like this shot except for the very white sky</td>', 'i like this shot except for the very white sky', '2006-11-02 18:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990514, 414249, 23002, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2006-11-02 18:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990516, 421035, 35513, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to notice the blue eyes in this shot....there''s so much character exuding from this man.  Not a typical portrait, but I really like it.</td>', 'It took me a moment to notice the blue eyes in this shot....there''s so much character exuding from this man.  Not a typical portrait, but I really like it.', '2006-11-02 18:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990518, 412076, 7969, '<td valign="top">great capture!</td>', 'great capture!', '2006-11-02 18:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990521, 419500, 7969, '<td valign="top">nice mood and feel, very well done. 10</td>', 'nice mood and feel, very well done. 10', '2006-11-02 18:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990522, 420963, 23002, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but mallards are just not doing it for me.  especially one with all of the nice feathers molted out.</td>', 'Sorry, but mallards are just not doing it for me.  especially one with all of the nice feathers molted out.', '2006-11-02 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990523, 419949, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice moment and composition. I think the focus is too soft.</td>', 'Nice moment and composition. I think the focus is too soft.', '2006-11-02 18:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990525, 414646, 23002, '<td valign="top">great colour.</td>', 'great colour.', '2006-11-02 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990526, 416191, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing on this shot.  It makes it look almost like a comet.</td>', 'Nice post processing on this shot.  It makes it look almost like a comet.', '2006-11-02 18:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990530, 419470, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great find; lovely flowers.  I understand the whole delicate-flower-blooming-in-spite-of-razor-wire concept, and the composition does enhance the concept as well, but there are a few things that are not working for me while I view the image.  I think the foreground OOF elements distract rather than enhance this particular image, and the stick/stem going through the top half really distracts as well.  The whiteness of the background make the image a bit confusing because it''s difficult to tell if it is sky and you are outside, or if it is a backdrop, or something else.  The composition seems a bit cluttered and crowded, and the razor wire being OOF (even though it''s purposeful) also is a distraction.  Maybe a wider view or crop that shows more flower, less clutter of leaves/stems might be better.  I could be all wrong though.  I am by no means an expert and am just calling it as it comes to mind.  You obviously have a keen eye for what others probably pass by daily and never notice...which is the best gift a photographer can possibly have.  Good luck in this and in future challenges.  :)</td>', 'Great find; lovely flowers.  I understand the whole delicate-flower-blooming-in-spite-of-razor-wire concept, and the composition does enhance the concept as well, but there are a few things that are not working for me while I view the image.  I think the foreground OOF elements distract rather than enhance this particular image, and the stick/stem going through the top half really distracts as well.  The whiteness of the background make the image a bit confusing because it''s difficult to tell if it is sky and you are outside, or if it is a backdrop, or something else.  The composition seems a bit cluttered and crowded, and the razor wire being OOF (even though it''s purposeful) also is a distraction.  Maybe a wider view or crop that shows more flower, less clutter of leaves/stems might be better.  I could be all wrong though.  I am by no means an expert and am just calling it as it comes to mind.  You obviously have a keen eye for what others probably pass by daily and never notice...which is the best gift a photographer can possibly have.  Good luck in this and in future challenges.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990532, 420554, 66384, '<td valign="top">What fun! I love this.</td>', 'What fun! I love this.', '2006-11-02 18:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990534, 419271, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the action!</td>', 'Nice capture of the action!', '2006-11-02 18:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990537, 408373, 59740, '<td valign="top">I would love this photo if most of the sand were cropped off. The sand isn''t sharp and is uninteresting.</td>', 'I would love this photo if most of the sand were cropped off. The sand isn''t sharp and is uninteresting.', '2006-11-02 18:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990538, 409216, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is very surreal and emotive.  The clouds are a bit too processed for my personal tastes, and I''d like to see the ground a bit more so that the trees don''t appear to be floating in the sky.   Interesting composition; good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'This is very surreal and emotive.  The clouds are a bit too processed for my personal tastes, and I''d like to see the ground a bit more so that the trees don''t appear to be floating in the sky.   Interesting composition; good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990540, 420905, 35513, '<td valign="top">Adorable!!  I love this shot--it''s incredibly meaningful.</td>', 'Adorable!!  I love this shot--it''s incredibly meaningful.', '2006-11-02 18:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990541, 420728, 23002, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this one.</td>', 'I love the feel of this one.', '2006-11-02 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990542, 411103, 59740, '<td valign="top">Background is too distracting.</td>', 'Background is too distracting.', '2006-11-02 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990543, 415219, 66384, '<td valign="top">I wish there was less frame and a larger image. No points off for that though.</td>', 'I wish there was less frame and a larger image. No points off for that though.', '2006-11-02 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2990544, 418432, 35513, '<td valign="top">The sky is very interesting in this shot, but the gravestones are so dark that I had to look carefully to see what they were.</td>', 'The sky is very interesting in this shot, but the gravestones are so dark that I had to look carefully to see what they were.', '2006-11-02 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990545, 418252, 59740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2006-11-02 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990549, 420754, 23002, '<td valign="top">a little bit too soft.  great lighting and set though.</td>', 'a little bit too soft.  great lighting and set though.', '2006-11-02 18:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990550, 420482, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting for this shot is nice and soft, but I think I would prefer a photo that didn''t include the crib bars--they hide those lovely eyes!</td>', 'The lighting for this shot is nice and soft, but I think I would prefer a photo that didn''t include the crib bars--they hide those lovely eyes!', '2006-11-02 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990551, 416494, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and good natural color.  I think the lighting is the element that is missing for this image; particularly on the basket.  It is a bit bright and hot on the wicker and doesn''t separate the apples from the background very much.  The background on the upper left corner is a bit wrinkly/crinkly or something and that is a distraction.  I think you have a great start with this one; just play with the lighting arrangement and see what you can come up with.  :)</td>', 'Nicely composed and good natural color.  I think the lighting is the element that is missing for this image; particularly on the basket.  It is a bit bright and hot on the wicker and doesn''t separate the apples from the background very much.  The background on the upper left corner is a bit wrinkly/crinkly or something and that is a distraction.  I think you have a great start with this one; just play with the lighting arrangement and see what you can come up with.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990553, 412309, 23002, '<td valign="top">Are you going back here for the "long exposure" challenge?</td>', 'Are you going back here for the "long exposure" challenge?', '2006-11-02 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990554, 416494, 23002, '<td valign="top">nice still life.</td>', 'nice still life.', '2006-11-02 18:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990555, 421137, 59740, '<td valign="top">The lighting does not show off the crystals to best advantage. It''s too flat.</td>', 'The lighting does not show off the crystals to best advantage. It''s too flat.', '2006-11-02 18:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990557, 418117, 52130, '<td valign="top">well THIS looks familiar...still love it though. Might want to make the whole image except the flower and the moth darker. Everything kind of blends together.</td>', 'well THIS looks familiar...still love it though. Might want to make the whole image except the flower and the moth darker. Everything kind of blends together.', '2006-11-02 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990560, 414368, 35513, '<td valign="top">Buckeyes!  Nice lighting and tone on this shot, and the B&amp;W works well for the nut''s husk.  The composition here isn''t bad, but I think a macro of one of the husks would do really well as a shot too....so much texture there!</td>', 'Buckeyes!  Nice lighting and tone on this shot, and the B&W works well for the nut''s husk.  The composition here isn''t bad, but I think a macro of one of the husks would do really well as a shot too....so much texture there!', '2006-11-02 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990561, 421095, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great title. I like the image too.</td>', 'Great title. I like the image too.', '2006-11-02 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990563, 420402, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting...I''m not following the title to any particular element in the shot, but it''s your image so I guess you titled it what you thought would work best.  ;)  Personally, I feel there is way too much foreground to keep a viewer interested in the shot for very long...having to seek out the tiny elements in just the top third of the image is difficult at best.  Nice black and white conversion, however.  Good luck in the challenge. :)</td>', 'Interesting...I''m not following the title to any particular element in the shot, but it''s your image so I guess you titled it what you thought would work best.  ;)  Personally, I feel there is way too much foreground to keep a viewer interested in the shot for very long...having to seek out the tiny elements in just the top third of the image is difficult at best.  Nice black and white conversion, however.  Good luck in the challenge. :)', '2006-11-02 18:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990564, 421094, 23002, '<td valign="top">great shot...but it looks a bit soft?</td>', 'great shot...but it looks a bit soft?', '2006-11-02 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990566, 419888, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  It looks like the leopard is staring right at you!!  Saturation on the fur really brings out the colors.</td>', 'Nice capture!  It looks like the leopard is staring right at you!!  Saturation on the fur really brings out the colors.', '2006-11-02 18:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990567, 418179, 59740, '<td valign="top">What?</td>', 'What?', '2006-11-02 18:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990569, 418622, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition. I wish I could see the full face.</td>', 'I really like this composition. I wish I could see the full face.', '2006-11-02 18:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990572, 418275, 23002, '<td valign="top">nothing is totally in focus.</td>', 'nothing is totally in focus.', '2006-11-02 18:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990574, 417239, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Detail on the spiget and knob looks good...but I might prefer if the water drops were in focus as well.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Detail on the spiget and knob looks good...but I might prefer if the water drops were in focus as well.', '2006-11-02 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990575, 408713, 23002, '<td valign="top">very nice and pensive.</td>', 'very nice and pensive.', '2006-11-02 18:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990577, 416173, 59740, '<td valign="top">Not sharp. Also, too much distracting detail.</td>', 'Not sharp. Also, too much distracting detail.', '2006-11-02 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990579, 417619, 52130, '<td valign="top">ohh so cute, but really could have been improved upon by more editing...contrast, brightness, a little more color. still nice though</td>', 'ohh so cute, but really could have been improved upon by more editing...contrast, brightness, a little more color. still nice though', '2006-11-02 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990580, 413689, 23002, '<td valign="top">It looks like a great location..but it is a tad to overprocessed and not sharp...and not because it has been softened, it just appears a bit out of focus.</td>', 'It looks like a great location..but it is a tad to overprocessed and not sharp...and not because it has been softened, it just appears a bit out of focus.', '2006-11-02 18:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990581, 420596, 35513, '<td valign="top">I had to stop and look at this shot for a while...the more I look, the more I like it.  It really does make a good modern day still life!  The lighting and post processing gives it a great look.</td>', 'I had to stop and look at this shot for a while...the more I look, the more I like it.  It really does make a good modern day still life!  The lighting and post processing gives it a great look.', '2006-11-02 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990582, 404790, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good composition but not very sharp.</td>', 'Good composition but not very sharp.', '2006-11-02 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990583, 408355, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene...I''d love to see some detail in the foreground trees but the silhouette is still quite lovely.  Nice colors.  :)</td>', 'Very pretty scene...I''d love to see some detail in the foreground trees but the silhouette is still quite lovely.  Nice colors.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990584, 420207, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait!  Great focus and lighting, and I love the close framing.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait!  Great focus and lighting, and I love the close framing.', '2006-11-02 18:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990587, 413973, 59740, '<td valign="top">Too short DOF.</td>', 'Too short DOF.', '2006-11-02 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990589, 419386, 23002, '<td valign="top">Hey...that looks like a wood duck!  I have trying to find one of these to take pictures of in my area for years!</td>', 'Hey...that looks like a wood duck!  I have trying to find one of these to take pictures of in my area for years!', '2006-11-02 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990591, 419384, 23002, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2006-11-02 18:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990592, 420069, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good exposure control on what probably was a rather longish exposure.  I think I''d crop in a bit more all the way around for less negative space, and sharpen the pumpkin''s face on the top left.  :)</td>', 'Good exposure control on what probably was a rather longish exposure.  I think I''d crop in a bit more all the way around for less negative space, and sharpen the pumpkin''s face on the top left.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990593, 412702, 59740, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp and the branch cuts through the bird''s head.</td>', 'Not very sharp and the branch cuts through the bird''s head.', '2006-11-02 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990595, 417630, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting bird!  My main issue with this photo is that there is a lot of image noise, which distracts me from the bird.</td>', 'Very interesting bird!  My main issue with this photo is that there is a lot of image noise, which distracts me from the bird.', '2006-11-02 18:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990598, 418833, 23002, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2006-11-02 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990601, 417239, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF control and great color, contrast, and light.  I think the title is a bit misleading, however, being that the water itself is the essential and it''s out of focus.  Lovely shot, nonetheless.  :)</td>', 'Nice DOF control and great color, contrast, and light.  I think the title is a bit misleading, however, being that the water itself is the essential and it''s out of focus.  Lovely shot, nonetheless.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990602, 420218, 35513, '<td valign="top">The sky and water look good in this shot, and I like the emotion that the image of the mother and daughter bring...but I wish they were a little better lit (hard to do when you can''t direct the sun, I know :-)</td>', 'The sky and water look good in this shot, and I like the emotion that the image of the mother and daughter bring...but I wish they were a little better lit (hard to do when you can''t direct the sun, I know :-)', '2006-11-02 18:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990604, 421073, 23002, '<td valign="top">I am sorry...but captive eagle shots, and eagle shots in general...just way to overdone.  however the shot itself is well done so I am giving you a 5</td>', 'I am sorry...but captive eagle shots, and eagle shots in general...just way to overdone.  however the shot itself is well done so I am giving you a 5', '2006-11-02 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990605, 411808, 59740, '<td valign="top">Is this a jewelry photo? It has two competing subject. 1. The girls face. 2. the watch.</td>', 'Is this a jewelry photo? It has two competing subject. 1. The girls face. 2. the watch.', '2006-11-02 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990606, 421067, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, stunning model.  Lovely processing and does not appear to be overdone in any regard.  I do think the crop is a bit crowded and would like to see more breathing room around her face.  :)</td>', 'Great portrait, stunning model.  Lovely processing and does not appear to be overdone in any regard.  I do think the crop is a bit crowded and would like to see more breathing room around her face.  :)', '2006-11-02 18:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990607, 418626, 35513, '<td valign="top">This photo really pops!!  I like the greenish cast to this photo.  Very dramatic.</td>', 'This photo really pops!!  I like the greenish cast to this photo.  Very dramatic.', '2006-11-02 19:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990609, 417088, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2006-11-02 19:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990612, 421065, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and painterly.   I think I''d only crop off some of the darkness at the bottom and rotate ever so slightly to line up the edge that he''s peering over, so that it''s level.  Great entry.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful and painterly.   I think I''d only crop off some of the darkness at the bottom and rotate ever so slightly to line up the edge that he''s peering over, so that it''s level.  Great entry.  :)', '2006-11-02 19:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990615, 412076, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a catch. The line in the water and the reflection create a terrific design.</td>', 'Wow! What a catch. The line in the water and the reflection create a terrific design.', '2006-11-02 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990616, 420121, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountain scene!!!  This really is striking!  Beautiful colors and a splendid composition.  Wonderful landscape all around.  I really like the gradation in the sky from left to right.</td>', 'Beautiful mountain scene!!!  This really is striking!  Beautiful colors and a splendid composition.  Wonderful landscape all around.  I really like the gradation in the sky from left to right.', '2006-11-02 19:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990619, 420944, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very neat capture...image seems a bit noisy and not quite super-sharp, but the color and lighting are beautiful and it works well.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Very neat capture...image seems a bit noisy and not quite super-sharp, but the color and lighting are beautiful and it works well.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-02 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990620, 417685, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the star effect on the lights, but I think the grass in the foreground is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the star effect on the lights, but I think the grass in the foreground is a little distracting.', '2006-11-02 19:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990621, 414655, 23002, '<td valign="top">too centred.  with this great light...a different composition could have meant a ribbon.  I would have liked to see a lot more of that very cool sky.</td>', 'too centred.  with this great light...a different composition could have meant a ribbon.  I would have liked to see a lot more of that very cool sky.', '2006-11-02 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990623, 408451, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very good except for the lower left corner.</td>', 'Very good except for the lower left corner.', '2006-11-02 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990624, 414431, 54602, '<td valign="top">I love that you have your puncher square in the middle. very diplomatic of you. I wonder, though, how many "Yes!" or "no!" comments you''ll be getting. people love to speak their mind. ;o)</td>', 'I love that you have your puncher square in the middle. very diplomatic of you. I wonder, though, how many "Yes!" or "no!" comments you''ll be getting. people love to speak their mind. ;o)', '2006-11-02 19:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990628, 421006, 35513, '<td valign="top">This must have been a really difficult shot to capture!  You''ve done a nice job with the set-up.  In order to make this pop a little more, I''d like to see the black even darker and the image noise smoothed out a bit.</td>', 'This must have been a really difficult shot to capture!  You''ve done a nice job with the set-up.  In order to make this pop a little more, I''d like to see the black even darker and the image noise smoothed out a bit.', '2006-11-02 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990629, 412893, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice candid capture.  Would like to see a bit more color and contrast; also would crop the left a bit more since the green arm or whatever that is does nothing for the image.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Nice candid capture.  Would like to see a bit more color and contrast; also would crop the left a bit more since the green arm or whatever that is does nothing for the image.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-02 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990631, 414665, 54602, '<td valign="top">AMAZING!</td>', 'AMAZING!', '2006-11-02 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990632, 420933, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It has everything.</td>', 'Great photo. It has everything.', '2006-11-02 19:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990636, 408923, 23002, '<td valign="top">very cute.  meow!</td>', 'very cute.  meow!', '2006-11-02 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990638, 421088, 59740, '<td valign="top">An owl picture should have critical sharpness which this does not.</td>', 'An owl picture should have critical sharpness which this does not.', '2006-11-02 19:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990639, 406605, 23002, '<td valign="top">sorry....just not in focus and too overprocessed.</td>', 'sorry....just not in focus and too overprocessed.', '2006-11-02 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990643, 417088, 54602, '<td valign="top">very cute and demure. love the pigtails and lace. ;o)</td>', 'very cute and demure. love the pigtails and lace. ;o)', '2006-11-02 19:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990644, 421025, 59740, '<td valign="top">The horizon is so tilted that the water is going to spill out of the picture.</td>', 'The horizon is so tilted that the water is going to spill out of the picture.', '2006-11-02 19:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990645, 419890, 23002, '<td valign="top">A great shot...but I would be losing the things that look like people to the left of her.</td>', 'A great shot...but I would be losing the things that look like people to the left of her.', '2006-11-02 19:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990647, 415946, 18349, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  I think I''d crop the left and the top a bit to come in closer to the action (and also make the headless ump and the other guy in the background appear less noticeable).  Terrific color and contrast.  :)</td>', 'Excellent capture!  I think I''d crop the left and the top a bit to come in closer to the action (and also make the headless ump and the other guy in the background appear less noticeable).  Terrific color and contrast.  :)', '2006-11-02 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990648, 420892, 23002, '<td valign="top">different.  I like different.</td>', 'different.  I like different.', '2006-11-02 19:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
