(2990826, 419390, 43774, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit of contrast maybe but you have captured a wonderful scene</td>', 'Could use a bit of contrast maybe but you have captured a wonderful scene', '2006-11-02 19:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990830, 406210, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro and excellent colours</td>', 'Excellent macro and excellent colours', '2006-11-02 19:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990831, 420090, 23002, '<td valign="top">57 channels and nothing on...</td>', '57 channels and nothing on...', '2006-11-02 19:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990833, 419196, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fog shots are so moody, this one is great.</td>', 'Fog shots are so moody, this one is great.', '2006-11-02 19:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990836, 412235, 67758, '<td valign="top">Incredible! Very Nice!!</td>', 'Incredible! Very Nice!!', '2006-11-02 19:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990839, 409033, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this.  The lighting is decent, but it seems like the focus could be better.  Maybe it is just the texture of the subject, though.</td>', 'I really like the composition on this.  The lighting is decent, but it seems like the focus could be better.  Maybe it is just the texture of the subject, though.', '2006-11-02 19:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990848, 419500, 67758, '<td valign="top">Superb!!!</td>', 'Superb!!!', '2006-11-02 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990849, 421011, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the composition on this, and the exposure you have chosen (making the water look soft and foggy).  The only thing I''m not crazy about is all the blue.  It almost dominates the shot and pulls attention away from the better parts of the photograph.</td>', 'I love the composition on this, and the exposure you have chosen (making the water look soft and foggy).  The only thing I''m not crazy about is all the blue.  It almost dominates the shot and pulls attention away from the better parts of the photograph.', '2006-11-02 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990853, 409560, 23002, '<td valign="top">nothing is really in focus here.</td>', 'nothing is really in focus here.', '2006-11-02 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990858, 413457, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the simple beauty of nature. I particularly like the way the leaf is hugged by the water. <br/> <br/>I have a couple of editing suggestions although you may find them too "fine artish" or too cliche. Anyway, one is to desaturate the background since there isn''t much color there to begin with plus a grey background may give this a more classic feel. The second thought is to do a little burning around the edges of the frame. Nothing heavy just enough to compliment the way the leaf is naturally burned by the shadows around it.</td>', 'Nice job capturing the simple beauty of nature. I particularly like the way the leaf is hugged by the water.  I have a couple of editing suggestions although you may find them too "fine artish" or too cliche. Anyway, one is to desaturate the background since there isn''t much color there to begin with plus a grey background may give this a more classic feel. The second thought is to do a little burning around the edges of the frame. Nothing heavy just enough to compliment the way the leaf is naturally burned by the shadows around it.', '2006-11-02 19:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990860, 421000, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness and contrast in this.  Makes an ordinary picture of a cow something interesting.</td>', 'I love the starkness and contrast in this.  Makes an ordinary picture of a cow something interesting.', '2006-11-02 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990862, 418391, 23002, '<td valign="top">yep.  they are lines alright.  I wish I knew the point of them though.</td>', 'yep.  they are lines alright.  I wish I knew the point of them though.', '2006-11-02 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990868, 405964, 811, '<td valign="top">Very simple, yet country-like, elegance in this shot.  The red really sets up a nice contrast and the curve contrasts nicely with the handle.</td>', 'Very simple, yet country-like, elegance in this shot.  The red really sets up a nice contrast and the curve contrasts nicely with the handle.', '2006-11-02 19:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990871, 415219, 43774, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what he is holding but this is a lovely portrait of a shopkeeper (or a customer).</td>', 'I have no idea what he is holding but this is a lovely portrait of a shopkeeper (or a customer).', '2006-11-02 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990872, 409918, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait -- one she should be happy to put in a portfolio or to frame.  You did well!</td>', 'Awesome portrait -- one she should be happy to put in a portfolio or to frame.  You did well!', '2006-11-02 19:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990874, 419523, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and it''s just oozing sharpness. It''s also very clear and uncluttered. I''d say good luck but I don''t think you''ll need it. Good shot!</td>', 'Nicely exposed and it''s just oozing sharpness. It''s also very clear and uncluttered. I''d say good luck but I don''t think you''ll need it. Good shot!', '2006-11-02 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990876, 414724, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, I really like the weeds that break across the horizon. Not so sure I like the structure, what is it? Either drying nets or an old tent.</td>', 'Lovely colours, I really like the weeds that break across the horizon. Not so sure I like the structure, what is it? Either drying nets or an old tent.', '2006-11-02 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990878, 414711, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours.</td>', 'Beautiful colours.', '2006-11-02 19:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990879, 412362, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea for a bridal portrait.  My only nitpick is that I feel like it needs to be cropped a bit closer on the right.</td>', 'Awesome idea for a bridal portrait.  My only nitpick is that I feel like it needs to be cropped a bit closer on the right.', '2006-11-02 19:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990881, 420979, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like how you placed the ship right in front of the sun.</td>', 'Very nice, I like how you placed the ship right in front of the sun.', '2006-11-02 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990885, 421102, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice and bright!</td>', 'Wow, nice and bright!', '2006-11-02 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990886, 409287, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like this. Maybe a little too much burning at the top but I like everything else about it.</td>', 'I like this. Maybe a little too much burning at the top but I like everything else about it.', '2006-11-02 19:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990888, 418975, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene. It seems slightly tilted. I also think it could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene. It seems slightly tilted. I also think it could use a bit more contrast.', '2006-11-02 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990889, 420077, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, very sweet.</td>', 'Very clear, very sweet.', '2006-11-02 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990891, 420471, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, pleasing background.</td>', 'Lovely colours, pleasing background.', '2006-11-02 19:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990892, 413303, 811, '<td valign="top">this would look really good in a golfing calendar.  very nice work.</td>', 'this would look really good in a golfing calendar.  very nice work.', '2006-11-02 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990893, 420663, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, good detail. Cute snail!</td>', 'Nice macro, good detail. Cute snail!', '2006-11-02 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990895, 420121, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and colours, reflections are always a bonus. Photographed well!</td>', 'Beautiful scene and colours, reflections are always a bonus. Photographed well!', '2006-11-02 19:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990898, 417975, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition. The leaves are a nice touch. Not so sure I like the shadows but I like the composition so much that I am willing to forgive the shadows.</td>', 'I really like your composition. The leaves are a nice touch. Not so sure I like the shadows but I like the composition so much that I am willing to forgive the shadows.', '2006-11-02 19:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990899, 408820, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. The shadow bothers me a little since perhaps because it''s so subtle.</td>', 'I like the lighting. The shadow bothers me a little since perhaps because it''s so subtle.', '2006-11-02 19:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990906, 421065, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The leaves give a much needed splash of colour around the photo to allow your eye to wander over the photo and take everything in. The bold lines caused by the shadow are geometrically pleasing and the reflection of the tree is wonderful.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The leaves give a much needed splash of colour around the photo to allow your eye to wander over the photo and take everything in. The bold lines caused by the shadow are geometrically pleasing and the reflection of the tree is wonderful.', '2006-11-02 19:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990908, 419519, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective here, great colours.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective here, great colours.', '2006-11-02 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990909, 421079, 41337, '<td valign="top">These are the new water drop shots at DPC. However, I like what you did here. 7.</td>', 'These are the new water drop shots at DPC. However, I like what you did here. 7.', '2006-11-02 19:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990910, 420954, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours, nice bold composition.</td>', 'Wonderful colours, nice bold composition.', '2006-11-02 19:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990913, 413029, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a capture!!! So clear and detailed. Background is wonderful.</td>', 'What a capture!!! So clear and detailed. Background is wonderful.', '2006-11-02 19:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990914, 416976, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool, nice setup</td>', 'Very cool, nice setup', '2006-11-02 19:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990916, 416789, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colours and composition. Great still life.</td>', 'Nice bold colours and composition. Great still life.', '2006-11-02 19:51:37.000000', NULL, 1);
