(2990996, 420464, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract -- I like how the colors contrast and compliment at the same time.</td>', 'Nice abstract -- I like how the colors contrast and compliment at the same time.', '2006-11-02 20:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
