(2991304, 418826, 35513, '<td valign="top">This really grabs me!  It''s beautiful.  The lighting is superb and it''s a really great abstract macro.  Really well done!</td>', 'This really grabs me!  It''s beautiful.  The lighting is superb and it''s a really great abstract macro.  Really well done!', '2006-11-02 21:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
