(2991328, 408892, 35513, '<td valign="top">Aww :-)  Very nice lighting on this baby portrait.  I think I prefer the light fabric on the bottom of the photo as opposed to the black background.  I like that you kept the photo in color as opposed to B&amp;W...it really works well here.</td>', 'Aww :-)  Very nice lighting on this baby portrait.  I think I prefer the light fabric on the bottom of the photo as opposed to the black background.  I like that you kept the photo in color as opposed to B&W...it really works well here.', '2006-11-02 21:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991329, 408649, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, I like the contrast between the bright trees and the dark water. You could have cloned out the evergreen branches on the left side.</td>', 'Lovely colours, I like the contrast between the bright trees and the dark water. You could have cloned out the evergreen branches on the left side.', '2006-11-02 21:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
