(2991333, 411958, 35513, '<td valign="top">hehehe :-)  This brings back memories of me and my sister....don''t even ask why, but it does!  Good black and white tones and definitely interesting enough that I stayed and looked at the photo for a while.</td>', 'hehehe :-)  This brings back memories of me and my sister....don''t even ask why, but it does!  Good black and white tones and definitely interesting enough that I stayed and looked at the photo for a while.', '2006-11-02 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
