(2991337, 419500, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great job on lighting the waterfalls. The starry sky is gorgeous. Would it have been possible to light the cliffs a bit? I''d like to see a little detail in them.</td>', 'Great job on lighting the waterfalls. The starry sky is gorgeous. Would it have been possible to light the cliffs a bit? I''d like to see a little detail in them.', '2006-11-02 21:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
