(2991346, 414817, 43774, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but compare this to the recent winning photo of northern lights. This is good but not quite as good as that one (same photographer I wonder?). This seems a bit soft. It''s still gorgeous though!</td>', 'I can''t help but compare this to the recent winning photo of northern lights. This is good but not quite as good as that one (same photographer I wonder?). This seems a bit soft. It''s still gorgeous though!', '2006-11-02 21:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
