(2991354, 418874, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice view.  I wish the tree on the left wasn''t cut in half.  I really like how the sun catches the trees on the right hand side of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice view.  I wish the tree on the left wasn''t cut in half.  I really like how the sun catches the trees on the right hand side of the photo.', '2006-11-02 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
