(2991402, 420802, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the contrast between the umbrella and the tree.  Unfortunately, in my opinion, the umbrella is a dull color and doesn''t add any punch to the picture.  Perhaps in a bw?</td>', 'I like the composition and the contrast between the umbrella and the tree.  Unfortunately, in my opinion, the umbrella is a dull color and doesn''t add any punch to the picture.  Perhaps in a bw?', '2006-11-02 21:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2991403, 420681, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo...I assume that''s a street performer?  The child is so captivated :-)  The white of the street performer came out really well...you''ve done a good job exposing this shot.</td>', 'Interesting photo...I assume that''s a street performer?  The child is so captivated :-)  The white of the street performer came out really well...you''ve done a good job exposing this shot.', '2006-11-02 21:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
