(2992706, 420708, 64928, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.First of all, let me say I am an amateur and relatively new to dpc, but if this doesn''t score as you had hoped, here are some things you might consider.  It is usually good to have an odd number of objects in a grouping.  If you had only three, or added a fifth, and moved them to the right rather than having the group centered and almost bilateral it would be more pleasing to the eye.  The soup and bread does look yummy!</td>', 'Nice colors.First of all, let me say I am an amateur and relatively new to dpc, but if this doesn''t score as you had hoped, here are some things you might consider.  It is usually good to have an odd number of objects in a grouping.  If you had only three, or added a fifth, and moved them to the right rather than having the group centered and almost bilateral it would be more pleasing to the eye.  The soup and bread does look yummy!', '2006-11-03 06:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
