(2993067, 420709, 24073, '<td valign="top">The overall photo is coming out flat.  The colors, and the set-up in general just dont pop out there.  I don''t know how one would go about making it better.  Still an overall success, I''m going with an 8.</td>', 'The overall photo is coming out flat.  The colors, and the set-up in general just dont pop out there.  I don''t know how one would go about making it better.  Still an overall success, I''m going with an 8.', '2006-11-03 08:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993072, 421067, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very good processing.  Not overdone, and not underdone.  Very good.</td>', 'Very good processing.  Not overdone, and not underdone.  Very good.', '2006-11-03 08:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993076, 414121, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a great deal. The colors and contrast are quite nice - and appear very natural.  The only critique I would have is that the foreground is not as interesting as I think it could be (the brown rocks are not as interesting as the grasses in the left portion of the picture).  If you could have placed more of the grasses in the foreground, I think it may have come off better.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like this photo a great deal. The colors and contrast are quite nice - and appear very natural.  The only critique I would have is that the foreground is not as interesting as I think it could be (the brown rocks are not as interesting as the grasses in the left portion of the picture).  If you could have placed more of the grasses in the foreground, I think it may have come off better.  Nice job!', '2006-11-03 08:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993078, 420589, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well you hit this one brilliantly.  Very cool, and unique look.  I''m sold on it, I think you did a terrific job.  GL.</td>', 'Well you hit this one brilliantly.  Very cool, and unique look.  I''m sold on it, I think you did a terrific job.  GL.', '2006-11-03 08:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
