(2993566, 417266, 30049, '<td valign="top">The birds do a great job of showing context in this image (size/scale).  Without them I would find this photo kind of ho-humish, another waterfall.  :D  It''s refreshing to see an image that isn''t extremely overprocessed also.  Thanks for that.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The birds do a great job of showing context in this image (size/scale).  Without them I would find this photo kind of ho-humish, another waterfall.  :D  It''s refreshing to see an image that isn''t extremely overprocessed also.  Thanks for that.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 11:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993571, 412362, 61234, '<td valign="top">I like this in that it''s a different take on the usual wedding portrait.<br/>Nice strong hues make for a pleasing visual. My only suggestion would be to <br/>make a tighter crop getting rid of the slightly distracting up right hand corner. Otherwise, I really love it.  Congrats!</td>', 'I like this in that it''s a different take on the usual wedding portrait.Nice strong hues make for a pleasing visual. My only suggestion would be to make a tighter crop getting rid of the slightly distracting up right hand corner. Otherwise, I really love it.  Congrats!', '2006-11-03 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
