(2993806, 417710, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour, very clear. I think with an image like this is needs to be centered. A square crop might work.</td>', 'Lovely colour, very clear. I think with an image like this is needs to be centered. A square crop might work.', '2006-11-03 12:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993817, 412863, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a feeling of being in a cemetery. It looks like an old tire with dead leaves in it. Not a very apealing photo. If you were in a cemetery there must have been other grave markers that were more interesting, something that would show emotion that you could convey to us. That being said, technically this doesn''t have a lot of problems. It''s clear and there are a lot of details in the leave and concrete(?).</td>', 'I don''t get a feeling of being in a cemetery. It looks like an old tire with dead leaves in it. Not a very apealing photo. If you were in a cemetery there must have been other grave markers that were more interesting, something that would show emotion that you could convey to us. That being said, technically this doesn''t have a lot of problems. It''s clear and there are a lot of details in the leave and concrete(?).', '2006-11-03 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993822, 421064, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours reflected in the water and the ripples. The crop is odd. The stick is too centered and the whole image feels tilted. I would straighten it up a bit and crop off most of the top.</td>', 'I really like the colours reflected in the water and the ripples. The crop is odd. The stick is too centered and the whole image feels tilted. I would straighten it up a bit and crop off most of the top.', '2006-11-03 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993825, 420805, 43774, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too processed for my tastes but that is just me. Lovely composition, dramatic sky.</td>', 'It''s a bit too processed for my tastes but that is just me. Lovely composition, dramatic sky.', '2006-11-03 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
