(2994095, 415086, 33560, '<td valign="top">I notice you have chopped off half her head so that we might better enjoy her cleavage.  The choice gives dynamism to the composition; but it also makes me a little sad. There is a kind of gritty sensibility to the light and texture - especially in the arm and that enhances the treatment.  I do wish the two spots on the neck were cloned out, because that is where my eyes go.  Not only do I miss the one lively eye, but I cannot even be compensated properly by the other assets. Despite my long list of quibbles, it is a very strong photo.</td>', 'I notice you have chopped off half her head so that we might better enjoy her cleavage.  The choice gives dynamism to the composition; but it also makes me a little sad. There is a kind of gritty sensibility to the light and texture - especially in the arm and that enhances the treatment.  I do wish the two spots on the neck were cloned out, because that is where my eyes go.  Not only do I miss the one lively eye, but I cannot even be compensated properly by the other assets. Despite my long list of quibbles, it is a very strong photo.', '2006-11-03 13:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994099, 415826, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is one terrific capture. High rating from me. Sad though, I think it would get a higher score from the DPC crew if it had a bit more post. I like it the way it is though.</td>', 'This is one terrific capture. High rating from me. Sad though, I think it would get a higher score from the DPC crew if it had a bit more post. I like it the way it is though.', '2006-11-03 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994102, 421130, 62318, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet refreshing. I like the two complementary colors. The soft background colors also help. Maybe just a tad more depth (1/2 stop - 1 stop). Still great photo, and high marks from me.</td>', 'Simple, yet refreshing. I like the two complementary colors. The soft background colors also help. Maybe just a tad more depth (1/2 stop - 1 stop). Still great photo, and high marks from me.', '2006-11-03 13:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994103, 420128, 62318, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great portrait. Not sure about the crossed legs. But overall very highly rated.</td>', 'Great lighting, great portrait. Not sure about the crossed legs. But overall very highly rated.', '2006-11-03 13:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2994107, 407762, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a subtle and beautiful nude.  I wish the title were different, because there is a quietude and solitude to the photo that the title belies.</td>', 'This is a subtle and beautiful nude.  I wish the title were different, because there is a quietude and solitude to the photo that the title belies.', '2006-11-03 13:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
