(2994371, 409070, 18403, '<td valign="top">JMO, either the girl or the camera is in the wrong place. The dark abyss at her feet doesn''t help.  Move her up to the rocks bordering the upper pool and crop out the lower section. Also, level the upper pool shoreline at the base of the falls (rotate the image slightly clockwise).  Some minor adjustments would make this a winner!</td>', 'JMO, either the girl or the camera is in the wrong place. The dark abyss at her feet doesn''t help.  Move her up to the rocks bordering the upper pool and crop out the lower section. Also, level the upper pool shoreline at the base of the falls (rotate the image slightly clockwise).  Some minor adjustments would make this a winner!', '2006-11-03 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
