(2995038, 420456, 18349, '<td valign="top">Criminy this is incredible!  Love the colors and the shapes!!  It appears to move on its own, like a computer graphic.  I usually am not one for abstracts, but this is just too cool for color TV.  I''d buy this as a print for sure.  Lovely!  :)</td>', 'Criminy this is incredible!  Love the colors and the shapes!!  It appears to move on its own, like a computer graphic.  I usually am not one for abstracts, but this is just too cool for color TV.  I''d buy this as a print for sure.  Lovely!  :)', '2006-11-03 17:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995040, 421037, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great colors and exposure, but I wish I could see the bottom of the horses feet.</td>', 'Great colors and exposure, but I wish I could see the bottom of the horses feet.', '2006-11-03 17:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995041, 416265, 23611, '<td valign="top">a really nice shot but IMHO I would have cropped the top third of the sky and a bit of the foreground. I feel that the letter box format would have really balanced the image well. 8*</td>', 'a really nice shot but IMHO I would have cropped the top third of the sky and a bit of the foreground. I feel that the letter box format would have really balanced the image well. 8*', '2006-11-03 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995042, 416265, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wowsers...what a shot!!!  Love the tufts of smoke; the darkness, the gloomy sky.  Timing was just right for this one.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Wowsers...what a shot!!!  Love the tufts of smoke; the darkness, the gloomy sky.  Timing was just right for this one.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-03 17:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995043, 416265, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful post processing...it really makes this shot!</td>', 'Beautiful post processing...it really makes this shot!', '2006-11-03 17:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995044, 419282, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love this carefree portrait!!  It has a lot of character...and what a great staircase.  Just perfect for this kind of shot.  Very well done.</td>', 'Love this carefree portrait!!  It has a lot of character...and what a great staircase.  Just perfect for this kind of shot.  Very well done.', '2006-11-03 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995047, 405941, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great detail and exposure here!  The sepia tones really work for me.</td>', 'Great detail and exposure here!  The sepia tones really work for me.', '2006-11-03 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995050, 420480, 23611, '<td valign="top">subtle and yet very effective. 8*</td>', 'subtle and yet very effective. 8*', '2006-11-03 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995052, 408355, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset!  My favorite part of the shot is the section where you can see the water through the branches of the tree on the right.</td>', 'Nice sunset!  My favorite part of the shot is the section where you can see the water through the branches of the tree on the right.', '2006-11-03 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995053, 415187, 58800, '<td valign="top">a really interesting shot, good lighting to create the shadows within the bloom, it does seem to me at least to resemble something from another planet.</td>', 'a really interesting shot, good lighting to create the shadows within the bloom, it does seem to me at least to resemble something from another planet.', '2006-11-03 17:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995056, 420906, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting on this shot.  I feel like she''s kind of shirking away from the camera.</td>', 'Good composition and lighting on this shot.  I feel like she''s kind of shirking away from the camera.', '2006-11-03 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995057, 420402, 23203, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-11-03 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995059, 421128, 58800, '<td valign="top">really good wildlife shot, though i feel the crop is maybe a little tight on the right.</td>', 'really good wildlife shot, though i feel the crop is maybe a little tight on the right.', '2006-11-03 17:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995061, 418486, 35513, '<td valign="top">The black background certainly shows off the sail lines of the boat, but I think I might like to see this shot from a slightly different angle.</td>', 'The black background certainly shows off the sail lines of the boat, but I think I might like to see this shot from a slightly different angle.', '2006-11-03 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995062, 414439, 58800, '<td valign="top">great shot, good perspective with the lines leading into the distance and the plaster on the apple is just a little random but a nice touch.</td>', 'great shot, good perspective with the lines leading into the distance and the plaster on the apple is just a little random but a nice touch.', '2006-11-03 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995063, 420487, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic shot with some very nice colors.  I think perhaps I would have preferred just a little more ground included in the shot.</td>', 'Very minimalistic shot with some very nice colors.  I think perhaps I would have preferred just a little more ground included in the shot.', '2006-11-03 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995065, 414403, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lighting and detail on the cat looks really good, but somehow the pumpkin and gourd don''t seem to have the same light quality.</td>', 'Lighting and detail on the cat looks really good, but somehow the pumpkin and gourd don''t seem to have the same light quality.', '2006-11-03 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995068, 419890, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors and scenery in this shot, though I feel like the four people on the left take away from the photo a bit.</td>', 'Really nice colors and scenery in this shot, though I feel like the four people on the left take away from the photo a bit.', '2006-11-03 17:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995070, 409560, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, though I fee like too much of the detail is lost.  The mushroom looks rather plasticky.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, though I fee like too much of the detail is lost.  The mushroom looks rather plasticky.', '2006-11-03 17:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995072, 417242, 35513, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!  No other words could cover it :-)  Exceptional.</td>', 'Stunning!!  No other words could cover it :-)  Exceptional.', '2006-11-03 17:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995074, 420602, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall shot...great colors and great motion on the water.  Exposure looks perfect!</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall shot...great colors and great motion on the water.  Exposure looks perfect!', '2006-11-03 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995077, 420209, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice soft tones in the sunset...I like that it''s not oversaturated wtih color.  But I feel that perhaps a different proportion of water to land to sky might work a little better for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice soft tones in the sunset...I like that it''s not oversaturated wtih color.  But I feel that perhaps a different proportion of water to land to sky might work a little better for my tastes.', '2006-11-03 17:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995079, 411569, 58800, '<td valign="top">great colours, really deep reds here that stand out well. excellent photo could be from a magazine easily.</td>', 'great colours, really deep reds here that stand out well. excellent photo could be from a magazine easily.', '2006-11-03 17:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995081, 407440, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting backdrop for this shot.  I like that you chose a color that would help the bloom stick out.  My main concern with this photo is that the focus does not seem to be on the bloom.  The blossom itself looks too soft....perhaps detail was lost in post processing?</td>', 'Interesting backdrop for this shot.  I like that you chose a color that would help the bloom stick out.  My main concern with this photo is that the focus does not seem to be on the bloom.  The blossom itself looks too soft....perhaps detail was lost in post processing?', '2006-11-03 17:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995084, 417649, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite photos for this challenge :-)  It looks like a dancer.  The title you chose really perfectly expresses what the photo says to me.  Detail and lighting on the leaf is beautiful.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite photos for this challenge :-)  It looks like a dancer.  The title you chose really perfectly expresses what the photo says to me.  Detail and lighting on the leaf is beautiful.', '2006-11-03 17:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995086, 420402, 35513, '<td valign="top">I see the smile, and I think B&amp;W tones work ok here.  But I feel like there''s too much foreground in this shot...the interest (to me) is in the upper portion of this shot.</td>', 'I see the smile, and I think B&W tones work ok here.  But I feel like there''s too much foreground in this shot...the interest (to me) is in the upper portion of this shot.', '2006-11-03 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995090, 418663, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and glow on this horse!!  Really well done!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and glow on this horse!!  Really well done!', '2006-11-03 17:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995092, 420123, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very symbolic photo!  The framing seems to be a little bit tight...I might prefer a bit wider to balance out the shot some.  Lighting looks a little different from right to left.  Very creative shot.</td>', 'Very symbolic photo!  The framing seems to be a little bit tight...I might prefer a bit wider to balance out the shot some.  Lighting looks a little different from right to left.  Very creative shot.', '2006-11-03 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995093, 417710, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like this!  Great green color and a nice abstract macro :-)</td>', 'I like this!  Great green color and a nice abstract macro :-)', '2006-11-03 17:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995095, 421011, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighthouse scene.  The color of the light at the top of the lighthouse looks a little out of place to me...for some reason I expect to see yellow or orange.  LOVE the mist in the harbor.</td>', 'Beautiful lighthouse scene.  The color of the light at the top of the lighthouse looks a little out of place to me...for some reason I expect to see yellow or orange.  LOVE the mist in the harbor.', '2006-11-03 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995096, 418680, 58800, '<td valign="top">good leading line created by the wall, though the house through the clearing spoils it somewhat.</td>', 'good leading line created by the wall, though the house through the clearing spoils it somewhat.', '2006-11-03 17:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995097, 420135, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great Halloween portrait!  Those kids are sure having fun!!</td>', 'Great Halloween portrait!  Those kids are sure having fun!!', '2006-11-03 17:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995100, 413424, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the body is superb, but the face is a little more shadowed.  If the lighting extended all the way up the face, this would be dead on!  Perhaps using a reflector would help a bit with this.</td>', 'Lighting on the body is superb, but the face is a little more shadowed.  If the lighting extended all the way up the face, this would be dead on!  Perhaps using a reflector would help a bit with this.', '2006-11-03 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995102, 420472, 63824, '<td valign="top">Really nice I like a lot the contrast and the perspective of the picture. Only thing that bug me is the thing that she has in her hair. It''s a little too bright according to me it kinda distract my attention. I give you a 9.</td>', 'Really nice I like a lot the contrast and the perspective of the picture. Only thing that bug me is the thing that she has in her hair. It''s a little too bright according to me it kinda distract my attention. I give you a 9.', '2006-11-03 17:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995105, 418581, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W tones in this shot, and good expressions on the subjects.  My main nitpick is that the lady seems to be looking up at the camera in an awkward way that causes her forehead to wrinkle.</td>', 'Nice B&W tones in this shot, and good expressions on the subjects.  My main nitpick is that the lady seems to be looking up at the camera in an awkward way that causes her forehead to wrinkle.', '2006-11-03 17:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995106, 420009, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice motion on the water!  I think I might have liked to see more of the treetops in this shot.</td>', 'Nice motion on the water!  I think I might have liked to see more of the treetops in this shot.', '2006-11-03 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995109, 418199, 58800, '<td valign="top">great action shot. the breaking of the wave sis really striking, good capture.</td>', 'great action shot. the breaking of the wave sis really striking, good capture.', '2006-11-03 17:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995110, 414121, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountainscape!!  Great colors and detail everywhere.  That water is so clear!!</td>', 'Beautiful mountainscape!!  Great colors and detail everywhere.  That water is so clear!!', '2006-11-03 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995112, 417656, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colors of their clothes reflect the colors of the leaves :-)  What a great moment, captured forever.</td>', 'I like the way the colors of their clothes reflect the colors of the leaves :-)  What a great moment, captured forever.', '2006-11-03 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995118, 417055, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene!  It looks almost painted!  Great job on exposure, and the lightplay in this photo is beautiful.</td>', 'Lovely scene!  It looks almost painted!  Great job on exposure, and the lightplay in this photo is beautiful.', '2006-11-03 17:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995121, 420995, 63824, '<td valign="top">A little too gray and dark according to me. However, the pose is great. 6</td>', 'A little too gray and dark according to me. However, the pose is great. 6', '2006-11-03 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995123, 413134, 35513, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and detail!  Love the B&amp;W tones for this photo.  New and interesting portrait--I like it a lot!</td>', 'Perfect lighting and detail!  Love the B&W tones for this photo.  New and interesting portrait--I like it a lot!', '2006-11-03 17:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995128, 418429, 58800, '<td valign="top">the focus on the lead runner is great and the blurring of the background is a good effect as those that are farther away fom him seem of less importance.</td>', 'the focus on the lead runner is great and the blurring of the background is a good effect as those that are farther away fom him seem of less importance.', '2006-11-03 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995130, 416370, 63824, '<td valign="top">too much contrasted according to me</td>', 'too much contrasted according to me', '2006-11-03 17:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995133, 408248, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image,with a bit of sharpness will be wonderful 9</td>', 'great image,with a bit of sharpness will be wonderful 9', '2006-11-03 17:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995142, 418600, 58800, '<td valign="top">I think i can guess who this image belongs to, and its a great image of what kids do, they band together and are mean....well some of the time anyway :P. really good lighting aswel,</td>', 'I think i can guess who this image belongs to, and its a great image of what kids do, they band together and are mean....well some of the time anyway :P. really good lighting aswel,', '2006-11-03 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2995145, 416173, 58800, '<td valign="top">really a great candid. You managed to capture alot of emotion here, i think a bomb could go off and they wouldn''t notice. good shot.</td>', 'really a great candid. You managed to capture alot of emotion here, i think a bomb could go off and they wouldn''t notice. good shot.', '2006-11-03 17:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995147, 420503, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors!  Looks almost fairy-like.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors!  Looks almost fairy-like.', '2006-11-03 17:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995149, 414824, 58800, '<td valign="top">really a great shot, such alot of character in his face and he no doubt has many stories, good lighting and composition.</td>', 'really a great shot, such alot of character in his face and he no doubt has many stories, good lighting and composition.', '2006-11-03 17:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995150, 420144, 35513, '<td valign="top">The eyes on this portrait are very well done, as is the lighting.  But I wish the DOF was big enough to include some detail on her hair.  As it is now, she kinda looks bald because the hair blends into the background.</td>', 'The eyes on this portrait are very well done, as is the lighting.  But I wish the DOF was big enough to include some detail on her hair.  As it is now, she kinda looks bald because the hair blends into the background.', '2006-11-03 17:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995151, 420487, 55956, '<td valign="top">holland, a country that i love. In my 2 tours in holland always rain :( but great sky and beautiful light. well polarized the sky, perhaps too small the green and the cows are too too small. 6</td>', 'holland, a country that i love. In my 2 tours in holland always rain :( but great sky and beautiful light. well polarized the sky, perhaps too small the green and the cows are too too small. 6', '2006-11-03 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995153, 417890, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice capture!  The colors and the detail on the fox look really good.  The bits of snow at his feet really give a sense of motion.</td>', 'Wow!  Nice capture!  The colors and the detail on the fox look really good.  The bits of snow at his feet really give a sense of motion.', '2006-11-03 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995156, 412863, 35513, '<td valign="top">The dead leaves are what grabs my attention most in this photo...but I''m not sure what it is I''m really supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'The dead leaves are what grabs my attention most in this photo...but I''m not sure what it is I''m really supposed to be looking at.', '2006-11-03 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995161, 407395, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!  The treeline looks almost painted on...I love the softness there.</td>', 'Wonderful colors!  The treeline looks almost painted on...I love the softness there.', '2006-11-03 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995162, 409532, 55956, '<td valign="top">great courage with this point of view and with this angle. but i think that work well.</td>', 'great courage with this point of view and with this angle. but i think that work well.', '2006-11-03 17:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995164, 420671, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice IR work!  The water looks so smooth and glasslike.  The treetops that were moving look so wispy :-)</td>', 'Very nice IR work!  The water looks so smooth and glasslike.  The treetops that were moving look so wispy :-)', '2006-11-03 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995168, 419502, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot!  I like the way you''ve framed the action here.  The ocean has nice colors, while maintaining a natural look, which I also like.</td>', 'Nice action shot!  I like the way you''ve framed the action here.  The ocean has nice colors, while maintaining a natural look, which I also like.', '2006-11-03 17:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995170, 410569, 35513, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet fairly striking.</td>', 'Simple, yet fairly striking.', '2006-11-03 17:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995178, 420883, 35513, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....very high key shot.  I''m just not sure that the subject here is really sufficient to hold my attention.</td>', 'Hmmm....very high key shot.  I''m just not sure that the subject here is really sufficient to hold my attention.', '2006-11-03 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995179, 413530, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very lovely!  The borealis is stunning in this photo.</td>', 'Very lovely!  The borealis is stunning in this photo.', '2006-11-03 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995182, 405142, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, particularly with the light effects in this shot.</td>', 'Nice composition, particularly with the light effects in this shot.', '2006-11-03 17:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995183, 408820, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and lots of character in this shot!</td>', 'Great lighting and lots of character in this shot!', '2006-11-03 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995189, 418833, 35513, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  Another favorite in this challenge.  That brief peek at the trees is just lovely.</td>', 'Breathtaking!  Another favorite in this challenge.  That brief peek at the trees is just lovely.', '2006-11-03 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995192, 416408, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a close-up look, but still contains other balloons in full.  It''s a nice way to see the whole thing and the important thing at the same time :-)  I could wish that it wasn''t so overcast, but at least the cloud cover was interesting!</td>', 'I like that this is a close-up look, but still contains other balloons in full.  It''s a nice way to see the whole thing and the important thing at the same time :-)  I could wish that it wasn''t so overcast, but at least the cloud cover was interesting!', '2006-11-03 18:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995195, 408109, 35513, '<td valign="top">Detail and post processing on the eyes looks wonderful.  I think I might have preferred just a little more light on the left side of the face, as some of the detail there gets lost.</td>', 'Detail and post processing on the eyes looks wonderful.  I think I might have preferred just a little more light on the left side of the face, as some of the detail there gets lost.', '2006-11-03 18:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995199, 408901, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement!  Color and clarity here is perfect, which really makes the photo for me.  To have them floating on water gives a nice difference in depth as well.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement!  Color and clarity here is perfect, which really makes the photo for me.  To have them floating on water gives a nice difference in depth as well.', '2006-11-03 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995205, 412051, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting leaf!  I think perhaps that I might have preferred some stronger lighting, which I think would allow us to see more detail on this unique leaf.</td>', 'Interesting leaf!  I think perhaps that I might have preferred some stronger lighting, which I think would allow us to see more detail on this unique leaf.', '2006-11-03 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995207, 412076, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow...excellent capture.</td>', 'Wow...excellent capture.', '2006-11-03 18:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995213, 418818, 35513, '<td valign="top">Awww, nice shot!  My only complaint is one that you probably couldn''t have done a lot about--the grass is a little monotonous for me.  I wish there was something to break up the background a bit.</td>', 'Awww, nice shot!  My only complaint is one that you probably couldn''t have done a lot about--the grass is a little monotonous for me.  I wish there was something to break up the background a bit.', '2006-11-03 18:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995218, 420703, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and reflections, but the shot (overall) looks a bit hazy to me...obscuring some of the detail.</td>', 'Nice colors and reflections, but the shot (overall) looks a bit hazy to me...obscuring some of the detail.', '2006-11-03 18:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995219, 420819, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but it appears to be over saturated</td>', 'Nice picture but it appears to be over saturated', '2006-11-03 18:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995221, 408041, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot!  What a find.  Sky looks great and you have a marvelous subject.</td>', 'Very intriguing shot!  What a find.  Sky looks great and you have a marvelous subject.', '2006-11-03 18:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995223, 418903, 35513, '<td valign="top">A very high contrast photo...perhaps more so than I would like.  The two figures get rather lost in the scheme of it all.</td>', 'A very high contrast photo...perhaps more so than I would like.  The two figures get rather lost in the scheme of it all.', '2006-11-03 18:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995228, 420982, 35513, '<td valign="top">woah, the sun looks really eerie here.  Quite surreal.</td>', 'woah, the sun looks really eerie here.  Quite surreal.', '2006-11-03 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995231, 415274, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model!  The lighting (to me) is perhaps a little strong on the right hand side of her face.  I like the natural background that was chosen for the shoot.</td>', 'Beautiful model!  The lighting (to me) is perhaps a little strong on the right hand side of her face.  I like the natural background that was chosen for the shoot.', '2006-11-03 18:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995233, 417354, 35513, '<td valign="top">This photo really epitomizes fall to me.  The colors and the lighting are wonderfully captured.</td>', 'This photo really epitomizes fall to me.  The colors and the lighting are wonderfully captured.', '2006-11-03 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995239, 420104, 35513, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little too dark for my own tastes....enough so that I feel like I''ve lost too much of the detail in this shot.  The only thing to really draw my eye is the band of blue light and the greenish reflection on the wall.</td>', 'This photo is a little too dark for my own tastes....enough so that I feel like I''ve lost too much of the detail in this shot.  The only thing to really draw my eye is the band of blue light and the greenish reflection on the wall.', '2006-11-03 18:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995241, 406856, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy!!  Nice post processing!</td>', 'Very dreamy!!  Nice post processing!', '2006-11-03 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995243, 413989, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the butterfly, but I feel as though it''s a little overexposed--the colors are washed out on the butterfly.</td>', 'Good detail on the butterfly, but I feel as though it''s a little overexposed--the colors are washed out on the butterfly.', '2006-11-03 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995249, 419526, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lots of attitude!  I really like the post processing on this shot.  My only complaint is I wish that the foot of the girl on the right wasn''t cut out of the frame.</td>', 'Lots of attitude!  I really like the post processing on this shot.  My only complaint is I wish that the foot of the girl on the right wasn''t cut out of the frame.', '2006-11-03 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995252, 420696, 35513, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, but it appears rather hazy, which causes some of the detail in the mountains to be lost.</td>', 'A nice scene, but it appears rather hazy, which causes some of the detail in the mountains to be lost.', '2006-11-03 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
