(2995618, 420464, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors; very surreal.  The bottom right area beyond the "bowl" has some areas that are a bit distracting...I''d clone them out and make them just the solid color, but that''s just me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful colors; very surreal.  The bottom right area beyond the "bowl" has some areas that are a bit distracting...I''d clone them out and make them just the solid color, but that''s just me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 19:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
