(2995669, 416824, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and softness.  I think the framing is a bit "off" but I can''t really explain what I would do differently...irises are so oddly shaped that it''s difficult to frame a shot of them that "works."  The light band on the left side is distracting.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and softness.  I think the framing is a bit "off" but I can''t really explain what I would do differently...irises are so oddly shaped that it''s difficult to frame a shot of them that "works."  The light band on the left side is distracting.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-03 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
