(2995734, 420953, 18349, '<td valign="top">Pretty model.  I think the hot spots on her face are a bit too contrasty compared to the shadowed parts of her face.  Her expression makes her look a bit uncomfortable.  Her dark eyebrows also contrast heavily with the blonde hair.  Dodging the eyes and lips, and burning the highlights/cloning in the more natural skin tone might help the image have more zing.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty model.  I think the hot spots on her face are a bit too contrasty compared to the shadowed parts of her face.  Her expression makes her look a bit uncomfortable.  Her dark eyebrows also contrast heavily with the blonde hair.  Dodging the eyes and lips, and burning the highlights/cloning in the more natural skin tone might help the image have more zing.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995735, 418622, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here.</td>', 'I really like the composition here.', '2006-11-03 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995742, 412919, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and texture.  Great macro shot; I might consider cropping in on the left and the top to make the figure less centered.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Wonderful light and texture.  Great macro shot; I might consider cropping in on the left and the top to make the figure less centered.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995747, 415952, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and beautiful colors.  Good luck in the challenge! :)</td>', 'Nicely composed and beautiful colors.  Good luck in the challenge! :)', '2006-11-03 20:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995749, 416348, 18349, '<td valign="top">Neat action shot...glad to see that the zoo is carrying on after such a loss.  :)</td>', 'Neat action shot...glad to see that the zoo is carrying on after such a loss.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995752, 420002, 47534, '<td valign="top">This made me   STOP   and look - well done!7</td>', 'This made me   STOP   and look - well done!7', '2006-11-03 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995754, 414428, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture...the stars were hidden and I didn''t notice them at first glance.  Good sharpness and exposure control.  :)</td>', 'Interesting capture...the stars were hidden and I didn''t notice them at first glance.  Good sharpness and exposure control.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995757, 420907, 811, '<td valign="top">The perspective adds a lot of interest to this shot.</td>', 'The perspective adds a lot of interest to this shot.', '2006-11-03 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995760, 420553, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is some of that elusive "wow" factor...something you don''t see every day. Good color, sharpness, and clarity. :)</td>', 'This is some of that elusive "wow" factor...something you don''t see every day. Good color, sharpness, and clarity. :)', '2006-11-03 20:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995762, 420602, 811, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  I like the contrast in colors between the cool bluish water adn the orangish rocks</td>', 'Very beautiful.  I like the contrast in colors between the cool bluish water adn the orangish rocks', '2006-11-03 20:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995770, 420192, 35804, '<td valign="top">The treatment definitely suits the subject...I''ve always enjoyed his crazy hair.</td>', 'The treatment definitely suits the subject...I''ve always enjoyed his crazy hair.', '2006-11-03 20:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995773, 419455, 47534, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, but I can''t help wanting to see it larger on-screen...6</td>', 'Beautiful image, but I can''t help wanting to see it larger on-screen...6', '2006-11-03 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995779, 409560, 811, '<td valign="top">A bit more focus, and a little bit less noise reduction/softness, and this would be a totally cool shot.  The colors contrast nicely, and the idea is really neat.</td>', 'A bit more focus, and a little bit less noise reduction/softness, and this would be a totally cool shot.  The colors contrast nicely, and the idea is really neat.', '2006-11-03 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995780, 420974, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, color tones, and composition.  I, for one, don''t find pears all that appealing in subject matter, but your arrangement more than makes up for that.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, color tones, and composition.  I, for one, don''t find pears all that appealing in subject matter, but your arrangement more than makes up for that.  Very nicely done.', '2006-11-03 20:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995799, 417996, 811, '<td valign="top">To me, the straight horizontal makes this feel static and less than dynamic.  I, personally, think it would look better on the diagonal to create more motion throughout the frame.</td>', 'To me, the straight horizontal makes this feel static and less than dynamic.  I, personally, think it would look better on the diagonal to create more motion throughout the frame.', '2006-11-03 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995800, 417890, 35444, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal, nice capture.  Looks like he may be about to pounce.</td>', 'Beautiful animal, nice capture.  Looks like he may be about to pounce.', '2006-11-03 20:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995802, 420966, 811, '<td valign="top">Love those eyes.  Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Love those eyes.  Good composition and lighting.', '2006-11-03 20:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995807, 420841, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s so darn simple...that''s why this image is so so effective..."echo...perfect word for this picture. You have seen and image where most would not have...this is just a pleasure to look at and captured my attention in a rather massive pool of images, and that''s not easy to do.</td>', 'It''s so darn simple...that''s why this image is so so effective..."echo...perfect word for this picture. You have seen and image where most would not have...this is just a pleasure to look at and captured my attention in a rather massive pool of images, and that''s not easy to do.', '2006-11-03 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995808, 417239, 811, '<td valign="top">What a neat ida for a picture.  The dof you have chosen lends to make it more interesting, I think.</td>', 'What a neat ida for a picture.  The dof you have chosen lends to make it more interesting, I think.', '2006-11-03 20:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995814, 414723, 35804, '<td valign="top">Can alligators be cute? I just think this is so cute...great capture.</td>', 'Can alligators be cute? I just think this is so cute...great capture.', '2006-11-03 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
