(2995825, 413095, 35804, '<td valign="top">I positively love the fact that the figure is centered, wouldn''t have been as powerful had you followed any so called rules...this is just a really cool image.</td>', 'I positively love the fact that the figure is centered, wouldn''t have been as powerful had you followed any so called rules...this is just a really cool image.', '2006-11-03 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
