(2995848, 406210, 811, '<td valign="top">Very good detail and clarity.   Kinda spooky though. :)</td>', 'Very good detail and clarity.   Kinda spooky though. :)', '2006-11-03 20:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995861, 419046, 18349, '<td valign="top">The heron is a great yet elusive subject...I try to capture shots of them all the time but they fly off just when I get in range.  The foreground is rather distracting in your image, and the whole shot has a blue tint to it that could be backed off with a blue curve adjustment, but I also know how hard they are to capture to begin with.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'The heron is a great yet elusive subject...I try to capture shots of them all the time but they fly off just when I get in range.  The foreground is rather distracting in your image, and the whole shot has a blue tint to it that could be backed off with a blue curve adjustment, but I also know how hard they are to capture to begin with.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995863, 413192, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love the high contrast and the minimalist feel of this image.  Great humor.  :)</td>', 'Love the high contrast and the minimalist feel of this image.  Great humor.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995869, 420554, 41794, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. Love that they are silhouettes, I think it adds to the exuberant feeling of the photo. Lighting and reflection are awesome, one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. Love that they are silhouettes, I think it adds to the exuberant feeling of the photo. Lighting and reflection are awesome, one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995875, 412309, 41794, '<td valign="top">Most beautiful and unique shot I have ever seen of the Arch. Love how bright it is compared to the moody clouds in the background.</td>', 'Most beautiful and unique shot I have ever seen of the Arch. Love how bright it is compared to the moody clouds in the background.', '2006-11-03 20:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995877, 419970, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very sweet portrait of a very adorable model.  Nicely composed and well-lit.  :)</td>', 'Very sweet portrait of a very adorable model.  Nicely composed and well-lit.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995880, 413192, 41794, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know how to express how much I like this photo. So wonderful in its simplicity. And the title - how perfect could it get! This has to be a ribbon winner in my humble opinion.</td>', 'I don''t even know how to express how much I like this photo. So wonderful in its simplicity. And the title - how perfect could it get! This has to be a ribbon winner in my humble opinion.', '2006-11-03 20:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995883, 421090, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot... the flower really does pop.  I''d crop the left side in a lot and the top to make it less centered.  :)</td>', 'I like this shot a lot... the flower really does pop.  I''d crop the left side in a lot and the top to make it less centered.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995885, 406780, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and patterning...lots of interesting things to look at and explore...I really like the deep red of the brick and how it lightens towards the right of the image, a pleasing and subtle gradation.</td>', 'Nice textures and patterning...lots of interesting things to look at and explore...I really like the deep red of the brick and how it lightens towards the right of the image, a pleasing and subtle gradation.', '2006-11-03 20:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995889, 420602, 41794, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, lovely, serene and peaceful. I love the little hints of light on the rocks and the slight bit of color from the moss and leaves. Definately a favorite!</td>', 'Gorgeous, lovely, serene and peaceful. I love the little hints of light on the rocks and the slight bit of color from the moss and leaves. Definately a favorite!', '2006-11-03 20:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995891, 417055, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.  The image feels tilted to the left a bit.  Gorgeous reflection.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.  The image feels tilted to the left a bit.  Gorgeous reflection.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995893, 413556, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model and nicely composed portrait.  Love the softness.</td>', 'Very pretty model and nicely composed portrait.  Love the softness.', '2006-11-03 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995895, 407372, 41794, '<td valign="top">I love the slightly muted tones of this photo. Makes it feel like a magazine print or a postcard. Great capture of a great moment.</td>', 'I love the slightly muted tones of this photo. Makes it feel like a magazine print or a postcard. Great capture of a great moment.', '2006-11-03 20:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995898, 419161, 41794, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors and the smoothness of the water is perfect.</td>', 'Amazing colors and the smoothness of the water is perfect.', '2006-11-03 20:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995903, 418822, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great study in shadow, shape, and texture.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Great study in shadow, shape, and texture.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995907, 412076, 41794, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic - I thought that my first time through and had to come back and bump this up - 10. Amazing capture to begin with, but I love how you composed it as well for the challenge so that he isn''t dead center. The trail leading in from the right and he is heading out to the left. This is the kind of photo I aspire to take.</td>', 'This is fantastic - I thought that my first time through and had to come back and bump this up - 10. Amazing capture to begin with, but I love how you composed it as well for the challenge so that he isn''t dead center. The trail leading in from the right and he is heading out to the left. This is the kind of photo I aspire to take.', '2006-11-03 20:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995910, 415946, 56658, '<td valign="top">great timing. I love that in the shadow you can see that the ball is not actually touching the bat any longer.</td>', 'great timing. I love that in the shadow you can see that the ball is not actually touching the bat any longer.', '2006-11-03 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995915, 413029, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful beautiful photo. Very rustic with the fall leaves. Great detail in the antlers and just to be able to capture a moment like this ....fantastic!</td>', 'Beautiful beautiful photo. Very rustic with the fall leaves. Great detail in the antlers and just to be able to capture a moment like this ....fantastic!', '2006-11-03 20:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995918, 420862, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and color in the shot, but the composition is scattered and tilted to the left (the shrubs in the foreground are leaning)...the windmills or whatever those are in the background pull the eye up to them and away from the scene.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good exposure and color in the shot, but the composition is scattered and tilted to the left (the shrubs in the foreground are leaning)...the windmills or whatever those are in the background pull the eye up to them and away from the scene.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-03 20:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995927, 415118, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic sky...interesting composition; creates a minimalist, artistic impression.</td>', 'Nice dramatic sky...interesting composition; creates a minimalist, artistic impression.', '2006-11-03 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995935, 420802, 18349, '<td valign="top">Fun composition...artistic and colorful.  I can see this in a travel brochure.  :)</td>', 'Fun composition...artistic and colorful.  I can see this in a travel brochure.  :)', '2006-11-03 20:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995939, 413357, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured, incredibly poignant.  Nice detail and texture.  Composition works well, bringing us right into his eyes.  Good luck in the challenge. :)</td>', 'Wonderfully captured, incredibly poignant.  Nice detail and texture.  Composition works well, bringing us right into his eyes.  Good luck in the challenge. :)', '2006-11-03 21:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995946, 418117, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, but not quite as much as the one on the front page right now.  ;)  The colors are a bit too saturated and bright for me when looking at the other shot, but the clarity is good and the composition works well.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)</td>', 'I like this one a lot, but not quite as much as the one on the front page right now.  ;)  The colors are a bit too saturated and bright for me when looking at the other shot, but the clarity is good and the composition works well.  Good luck in the challenge!  :)', '2006-11-03 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995952, 414855, 54540, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors!  Excellent composition - the type of image to "get lost into"!  Well done.</td>', 'Stunning colors!  Excellent composition - the type of image to "get lost into"!  Well done.', '2006-11-03 21:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995959, 420898, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on this shot!  Good work.</td>', 'Excellent lighting on this shot!  Good work.', '2006-11-03 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
