(2996144, 420117, 42100, '<td valign="top">Solo is definitely correct.  Interesting how something so small can have such a powerful effect on the photograph.  Great job!</td>', 'Solo is definitely correct.  Interesting how something so small can have such a powerful effect on the photograph.  Great job!', '2006-11-03 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
