(2996528, 413834, 35513, '<td valign="top">Well, this is definitely one of a kind for this challenge!  Lighting looks really good, and you''ve captured a lot of detail.  The subject may not appeal to everyone, but the technical marks are undeniably high.</td>', 'Well, this is definitely one of a kind for this challenge!  Lighting looks really good, and you''ve captured a lot of detail.  The subject may not appeal to everyone, but the technical marks are undeniably high.', '2006-11-03 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
