(2996561, 414194, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, those waves are amazing!  I think perhaps the photo is a little overexposed for my tastes.  Not so much that I''d call it incorrect exposure--I just think the crashing waves might stand out from the sky more if the shot was slightly underexposed.</td>', 'Wow, those waves are amazing!  I think perhaps the photo is a little overexposed for my tastes.  Not so much that I''d call it incorrect exposure--I just think the crashing waves might stand out from the sky more if the shot was slightly underexposed.', '2006-11-03 23:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996564, 418589, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the mantis, but I think I would like it better without the motion blur.  Though that does certainly add a level of humor to the shot :-)</td>', 'Nice capture of the mantis, but I think I would like it better without the motion blur.  Though that does certainly add a level of humor to the shot :-)', '2006-11-03 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996566, 415086, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great model and lighting work.  The composition doesn''t really work for me...I''m not a fan of cutting off half the face.  I think I see where you were going with it, and an "edgy" composition works for this model but I really would prefer to see both eyes at least.</td>', 'Great model and lighting work.  The composition doesn''t really work for me...I''m not a fan of cutting off half the face.  I think I see where you were going with it, and an "edgy" composition works for this model but I really would prefer to see both eyes at least.', '2006-11-03 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996568, 420523, 35513, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what this is...I''m going to assume coals perhaps.  Interesting colors, and parts of it have an almost extraterrestrial feel</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what this is...I''m going to assume coals perhaps.  Interesting colors, and parts of it have an almost extraterrestrial feel', '2006-11-03 23:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996569, 413946, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the way he''s checking her out :-)  Very interesting DOF work.  The neon sign in the background is slightly distracting for me.</td>', 'I like the way he''s checking her out :-)  Very interesting DOF work.  The neon sign in the background is slightly distracting for me.', '2006-11-03 23:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996570, 416191, 49963, '<td valign="top">Wow this is just lovely.</td>', 'Wow this is just lovely.', '2006-11-03 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996571, 420953, 49963, '<td valign="top">A very raw looking photo! I like!</td>', 'A very raw looking photo! I like!', '2006-11-03 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996572, 414844, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and surroundings on this tiger!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and surroundings on this tiger!', '2006-11-03 23:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996573, 420856, 35513, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W tones certainly show off the texture of the scales, but with the background it almost becomes a little monotonous for me.  Great detail and clarity on the lizard!</td>', 'The B&W tones certainly show off the texture of the scales, but with the background it almost becomes a little monotonous for me.  Great detail and clarity on the lizard!', '2006-11-03 23:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996574, 412478, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good job on exposure.  The city looks really nice, but I  find the tree in the foreground to be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good job on exposure.  The city looks really nice, but I  find the tree in the foreground to be a bit distracting.', '2006-11-03 23:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996575, 417922, 35513, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like an ad on a bus.</td>', 'This almost looks like an ad on a bus.', '2006-11-03 23:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996578, 420464, 35513, '<td valign="top">The colors of the steel look nice against the colors of the sky, but I find myself a little frustrated that I can''t see the whole object.</td>', 'The colors of the steel look nice against the colors of the sky, but I find myself a little frustrated that I can''t see the whole object.', '2006-11-04 00:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996580, 414824, 35513, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Love the lighting and the tones, and especially love the motion blur in the background.  Amazingly well done!</td>', 'Perfect.  Love the lighting and the tones, and especially love the motion blur in the background.  Amazingly well done!', '2006-11-04 00:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996583, 414238, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors!</td>', 'Very vivid colors!', '2006-11-04 00:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996584, 421129, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  Colors look very natural, but I wish the rest of the flower wasn''t so closely cropped.</td>', 'Nice close up.  Colors look very natural, but I wish the rest of the flower wasn''t so closely cropped.', '2006-11-04 00:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996586, 412524, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good model, though I''m generally an arms girl ;-)</td>', 'Nice lighting and good model, though I''m generally an arms girl ;-)', '2006-11-04 00:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996588, 420020, 35513, '<td valign="top">Colors in the sky look nice, but I''m not sure the silhouette really works for me here...just not quite enough detail in the outline.</td>', 'Colors in the sky look nice, but I''m not sure the silhouette really works for me here...just not quite enough detail in the outline.', '2006-11-04 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996591, 414935, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is such a touching shot!!  Great capture of the emotion and bond between these two.</td>', 'This is such a touching shot!!  Great capture of the emotion and bond between these two.', '2006-11-04 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996592, 420457, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors on the cranberries, but it looks as though the lighting may have been too dark.  There''s quite a bit of image noise in this shot, which detracts a bit from the nice hand model and the cranberries.</td>', 'Good colors on the cranberries, but it looks as though the lighting may have been too dark.  There''s quite a bit of image noise in this shot, which detracts a bit from the nice hand model and the cranberries.', '2006-11-04 00:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996596, 414594, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great color on that dragonfly!!  And the composition works really well for me here.</td>', 'Great color on that dragonfly!!  And the composition works really well for me here.', '2006-11-04 00:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996597, 417903, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very dramatic B&amp;W tones in this shot!  Though to be honest, the lighthouse gets a bit lost in it all.  Great job on the sky, in particular.</td>', 'Wow!  Very dramatic B&W tones in this shot!  Though to be honest, the lighthouse gets a bit lost in it all.  Great job on the sky, in particular.', '2006-11-04 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996598, 414582, 35513, '<td valign="top">The bright purple of the button display really adds a nice point of interest to this photo.  I like that you seem to have captured these two mid-conversation.</td>', 'The bright purple of the button display really adds a nice point of interest to this photo.  I like that you seem to have captured these two mid-conversation.', '2006-11-04 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996601, 416414, 35513, '<td valign="top">The sky on this photo is really great, but I feel that the rest of it is a tad bit too dark for my tastes.  Really nice reflections on the water as well.</td>', 'The sky on this photo is really great, but I feel that the rest of it is a tad bit too dark for my tastes.  Really nice reflections on the water as well.', '2006-11-04 00:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996610, 416501, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky, but the photo appears to be a bit soft for my tastes.  The reflections on the water look really nice.</td>', 'Nice colors in the sky, but the photo appears to be a bit soft for my tastes.  The reflections on the water look really nice.', '2006-11-04 00:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996620, 420013, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice shadow and light play. There is a total absence of the 9th zone, but not critical since the subdued but clear definition compensates. 7</td>', 'Very nice shadow and light play. There is a total absence of the 9th zone, but not critical since the subdued but clear definition compensates. 7', '2006-11-04 00:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996622, 420975, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute otters, but I think I''d prefer to see it without the selective desaturation.</td>', 'Cute otters, but I think I''d prefer to see it without the selective desaturation.', '2006-11-04 00:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996625, 416332, 35513, '<td valign="top">I knew the title of this photo before I scrolled down to see it :-)  Very nice B&amp;W tones here!</td>', 'I knew the title of this photo before I scrolled down to see it :-)  Very nice B&W tones here!', '2006-11-04 00:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996629, 418766, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice character study with ideal subject. I look at the possibility of seeing this in b/w. I believe it would have faired higher. 7</td>', 'A very nice character study with ideal subject. I look at the possibility of seeing this in b/w. I believe it would have faired higher. 7', '2006-11-04 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996633, 421006, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cool light play! 7</td>', 'Cool light play! 7', '2006-11-04 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996634, 418117, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors and nice composition!  A little more detail on the moth would really make this photo pop!</td>', 'Very vibrant colors and nice composition!  A little more detail on the moth would really make this photo pop!', '2006-11-04 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996636, 414133, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the sky!  I wish for some reason that the people in the train were facing us.</td>', 'Great colors in the sky!  I wish for some reason that the people in the train were facing us.', '2006-11-04 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996641, 420476, 35513, '<td valign="top">The flag peeking out really speaks to the title of this photo.  I wish I could see a little more detail in the darker sections of this shot.</td>', 'The flag peeking out really speaks to the title of this photo.  I wish I could see a little more detail in the darker sections of this shot.', '2006-11-04 00:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996642, 420678, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most interesting image with great texture display, however, there is a lighting disparity from foreground to background, more like the foreground is artificialy lit. Great capture, regardless. 7</td>', 'A most interesting image with great texture display, however, there is a lighting disparity from foreground to background, more like the foreground is artificialy lit. Great capture, regardless. 7', '2006-11-04 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996644, 417630, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture but the over sharpening pulls the eyes before one appreciates the subject. 6</td>', 'A very nice capture but the over sharpening pulls the eyes before one appreciates the subject. 6', '2006-11-04 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996646, 420755, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good tones on this shot.  There are a couple areas on the umbrella that are a little blown out.  Nice sense of character and story in this photo.</td>', 'Good tones on this shot.  There are a couple areas on the umbrella that are a little blown out.  Nice sense of character and story in this photo.', '2006-11-04 00:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996647, 417268, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely street capture with great subject.</td>', 'Lovely street capture with great subject.', '2006-11-04 00:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996648, 408713, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  This is a superb portrait.  My only nitpick might be that I feel it could do with a hint of more shadow on the right hand side where the light is very bright....but I honestly am just taken aback by it as it is.  Wonderful model.</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  This is a superb portrait.  My only nitpick might be that I feel it could do with a hint of more shadow on the right hand side where the light is very bright....but I honestly am just taken aback by it as it is.  Wonderful model.', '2006-11-04 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996650, 414525, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very interesting in composition and in lighting. 7</td>', 'Very interesting in composition and in lighting. 7', '2006-11-04 00:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996653, 417855, 35513, '<td valign="top">The framing of this shot certainly directs the viewer to the eye area, but I feel like it may be framed a little too tightly.  Good detail and exposure here.</td>', 'The framing of this shot certainly directs the viewer to the eye area, but I feel like it may be framed a little too tightly.  Good detail and exposure here.', '2006-11-04 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996655, 411736, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most intriguing and interesting capture that imparts its pensive mood. 7</td>', 'A most intriguing and interesting capture that imparts its pensive mood. 7', '2006-11-04 00:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996656, 415841, 35513, '<td valign="top">Sports Illustrated worthy.  Great colors, superb action!</td>', 'Sports Illustrated worthy.  Great colors, superb action!', '2006-11-04 00:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996658, 411415, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on this macro!  Especially the abdomen.</td>', 'Good detail on this macro!  Especially the abdomen.', '2006-11-04 00:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2996660, 417617, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset!  You may get a couple comments about a tilted horizon...though I think it''s more the perspective of the shot than an issue of not being level.</td>', 'Very nice sunset!  You may get a couple comments about a tilted horizon...though I think it''s more the perspective of the shot than an issue of not being level.', '2006-11-04 00:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
