(2997019, 421025, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find the tilt rather off-putting.  Additionally there seems to be rather a lot of what appears to be chromatic abberation on the sky line - one of my lines has a problem with this, so I have to be careful what I choose to shoot.  I am also wondering how you had the white balance set - personally I would have been tempted to set it at a higher colour temperature.</td>', 'I find the tilt rather off-putting.  Additionally there seems to be rather a lot of what appears to be chromatic abberation on the sky line - one of my lines has a problem with this, so I have to be careful what I choose to shoot.  I am also wondering how you had the white balance set - personally I would have been tempted to set it at a higher colour temperature.', '2006-11-04 03:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997022, 420980, 67258, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit soft - did you use auto focus, or manual?  Many cameras struggle with auto-focus in low light, so ifyou were using this it may be better to switch to manual next time round.  The photo is also tilted; a slight adjustment would sort this.  The composition and scene have potential.</td>', 'The focus is a bit soft - did you use auto focus, or manual?  Many cameras struggle with auto-focus in low light, so ifyou were using this it may be better to switch to manual next time round.  The photo is also tilted; a slight adjustment would sort this.  The composition and scene have potential.', '2006-11-04 03:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997023, 406917, 67258, '<td valign="top">I may be missing something here, but I don''t really see the ''point'' of this photo - perhaps it''s a cultural thing and I''m completely missing the relevance of the bottle tops?</td>', 'I may be missing something here, but I don''t really see the ''point'' of this photo - perhaps it''s a cultural thing and I''m completely missing the relevance of the bottle tops?', '2006-11-04 03:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997031, 420071, 67258, '<td valign="top">The composition of this just doesn''t do it for me.  I like the idea of the lone swimmer returning from the sea, and the shadow and the use of silhouette is effective, although I would have preferred the figure to have been just a little larger and further into the frame.</td>', 'The composition of this just doesn''t do it for me.  I like the idea of the lone swimmer returning from the sea, and the shadow and the use of silhouette is effective, although I would have preferred the figure to have been just a little larger and further into the frame.', '2006-11-04 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
