(2997049, 419853, 67258, '<td valign="top">I will own to bias here, as I am no lover of partial desaturation.  I find the choice of blue as the only colour to remain makes the photo look very cold.  I would suspect that you are trying to draw attention to the contrast between the historic dress and the intrusion of 21st century paraphenalia, but I feel it would have been better left.</td>', 'I will own to bias here, as I am no lover of partial desaturation.  I find the choice of blue as the only colour to remain makes the photo look very cold.  I would suspect that you are trying to draw attention to the contrast between the historic dress and the intrusion of 21st century paraphenalia, but I feel it would have been better left.', '2006-11-04 03:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
