(2997149, 417975, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for a shot. Good color. The composition is very nice, and I think the leaves are a real nice touch. I think the lighting may be hurting the image a little though. It seems a little harsh, and therefore is causing some deep shadows, that to me feel detrimental to the photo. I think that a little more subdued and even light could strengthen the presentation here.</td>', 'This is a great idea for a shot. Good color. The composition is very nice, and I think the leaves are a real nice touch. I think the lighting may be hurting the image a little though. It seems a little harsh, and therefore is causing some deep shadows, that to me feel detrimental to the photo. I think that a little more subdued and even light could strengthen the presentation here.', '2006-11-04 04:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
