(2997421, 418312, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found the image lacked punch.  I think it is the color balance that bothers me, but it also seems to be an uninteresting landscape.  Clouds seem a bit painted looking.  Perhaps it is the cyan balance that was used, or maybe a noise reducer was applied to make it look a bit unreal.  You have a decent eye, but this particular image does not do much for me.</td>', 'Found the image lacked punch.  I think it is the color balance that bothers me, but it also seems to be an uninteresting landscape.  Clouds seem a bit painted looking.  Perhaps it is the cyan balance that was used, or maybe a noise reducer was applied to make it look a bit unreal.  You have a decent eye, but this particular image does not do much for me.', '2006-11-04 08:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997422, 408451, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones on this one.</td>', 'Beautiful tones on this one.', '2006-11-04 08:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997423, 420590, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice part of the wilderness, that''s for sure.<br/>But with the mountains sloping off to the left like that, it gives the illusion of a very crooked horizon; even the clouds look slanted. However, the river looks right.</td>', 'Nice part of the wilderness, that''s for sure.But with the mountains sloping off to the left like that, it gives the illusion of a very crooked horizon; even the clouds look slanted. However, the river looks right.', '2006-11-04 08:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997426, 417242, 43405, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Just wish I could see this for myself one day.</td>', 'Amazing. Just wish I could see this for myself one day.', '2006-11-04 08:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997428, 420098, 43405, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. IMHO I think the application of a Nutral Density filter or equivalent just to darken the sky a tad (brought the clouds out), would really have worked well here.</td>', 'Nice photograph. IMHO I think the application of a Nutral Density filter or equivalent just to darken the sky a tad (brought the clouds out), would really have worked well here.', '2006-11-04 08:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997431, 414121, 43405, '<td valign="top">I like this. Would be interesting to see two identical shots, one with a polarising filter, and one without. Well done.</td>', 'I like this. Would be interesting to see two identical shots, one with a polarising filter, and one without. Well done.', '2006-11-04 08:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997434, 414855, 43405, '<td valign="top">NIce vibrant colours, well composed.</td>', 'NIce vibrant colours, well composed.', '2006-11-04 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997435, 420805, 32767, '<td valign="top">This looks quite oversharpened and a bit over saturated. Over sharpening seems to have become a style here at DPC but I can''t yet figure out why. Good luck.</td>', 'This looks quite oversharpened and a bit over saturated. Over sharpening seems to have become a style here at DPC but I can''t yet figure out why. Good luck.', '2006-11-04 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997437, 420632, 55956, '<td valign="top">a very good image, only too much small.</td>', 'a very good image, only too much small.', '2006-11-04 08:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
