(2997478, 420809, 58800, '<td valign="top">good choice to have the short exposure and have the still water here, if it had the movement blur i think it would have detracted from the image.</td>', 'good choice to have the short exposure and have the still water here, if it had the movement blur i think it would have detracted from the image.', '2006-11-04 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
