(2997573, 416191, 3032, '<td valign="top">Usually I do not like heavily saturated landscapes, but this one is an exception. I think it is because of the balance between the fore- and background and the gradation in the sky and on the ground. There is simply a lot of balance.<br/>I first saw these walking rocks in Fred Miranda''s gallery. A very cool subject.  I can see from the background that this one was shot in the same location. The composition on this one is great and I really like the way the light works here. Only 10 so far.<br/></td>', 'Usually I do not like heavily saturated landscapes, but this one is an exception. I think it is because of the balance between the fore- and background and the gradation in the sky and on the ground. There is simply a lot of balance.I first saw these walking rocks in Fred Miranda''s gallery. A very cool subject.  I can see from the background that this one was shot in the same location. The composition on this one is great and I really like the way the light works here. Only 10 so far.', '2006-11-04 10:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
