(2998420, 408041, 58800, '<td valign="top">great image. love the rusting wreck and the stone outcrop adds some interest in the background.</td>', 'great image. love the rusting wreck and the stone outcrop adds some interest in the background.', '2006-11-04 18:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998423, 409216, 32108, '<td valign="top">Image is way too dark for my taste</td>', 'Image is way too dark for my taste', '2006-11-04 18:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998425, 411371, 14614, '<td valign="top">a very sweet face -- such a great model.  I get the connection between the two of you for sure.  On the technical side -- there seem to be some red dots on your white background that could have been dodged out.  Also the oof right eye distracts me a bit.  I like the black and white choice as it highlights your title in the tones on the "gray" muzzle.  In all, one of my higher scorers.</td>', 'a very sweet face -- such a great model.  I get the connection between the two of you for sure.  On the technical side -- there seem to be some red dots on your white background that could have been dodged out.  Also the oof right eye distracts me a bit.  I like the black and white choice as it highlights your title in the tones on the "gray" muzzle.  In all, one of my higher scorers.', '2006-11-04 18:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998433, 420982, 32108, '<td valign="top">while the colors are good the majority of the image is too dark to hold interest</td>', 'while the colors are good the majority of the image is too dark to hold interest', '2006-11-04 18:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998441, 415185, 32108, '<td valign="top">the reflection is good but the subject is weak for a free study</td>', 'the reflection is good but the subject is weak for a free study', '2006-11-04 18:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998450, 411549, 14614, '<td valign="top">like the leading lines via the wake as it pulls my eye to the other boad and makes your title really work.  The mountain in the distance gives something great to see in the final 1/3 of your image.  The B&amp;W work well and the overall misty feel works for the distance portion.  To move it up a level?  I''d like a wider tonal range go give the light toned boats more of a pop and the distant mountains more of a presence.</td>', 'like the leading lines via the wake as it pulls my eye to the other boad and makes your title really work.  The mountain in the distance gives something great to see in the final 1/3 of your image.  The B&W work well and the overall misty feel works for the distance portion.  To move it up a level?  I''d like a wider tonal range go give the light toned boats more of a pop and the distant mountains more of a presence.', '2006-11-04 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998451, 416348, 58800, '<td valign="top">great shot. good colours and sense of movement.</td>', 'great shot. good colours and sense of movement.', '2006-11-04 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998463, 420634, 58800, '<td valign="top">good use of the blur around the focussed area. and goos use of sepia.</td>', 'good use of the blur around the focussed area. and goos use of sepia.', '2006-11-04 18:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998473, 418432, 32108, '<td valign="top">because the image is so dark that there is little interest</td>', 'because the image is so dark that there is little interest', '2006-11-04 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998479, 420917, 14614, '<td valign="top">You have chosen the perfect match of title and emotion shown by your model.  The light colors (hair, shirt, backgroud) work well together (and set off the blue eyes).  I like how there are no blown out spots (tough to do with so much light).  Suggestions?  A bit more light on the left side of her face would work a bit better for me (perhaps accomplished by shifting her hair?)</td>', 'You have chosen the perfect match of title and emotion shown by your model.  The light colors (hair, shirt, backgroud) work well together (and set off the blue eyes).  I like how there are no blown out spots (tough to do with so much light).  Suggestions?  A bit more light on the left side of her face would work a bit better for me (perhaps accomplished by shifting her hair?)', '2006-11-04 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998481, 420967, 32108, '<td valign="top">Sun rays are extremely difficult to catch with a digital camera and good PP is required  to do them justice.</td>', 'Sun rays are extremely difficult to catch with a digital camera and good PP is required  to do them justice.', '2006-11-04 18:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998483, 420812, 58800, '<td valign="top">great period model. good lighting.</td>', 'great period model. good lighting.', '2006-11-04 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998487, 416396, 32108, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the caste in the image and the subject is too distant to hold interest</td>', 'I don''t like the caste in the image and the subject is too distant to hold interest', '2006-11-04 18:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998490, 407440, 32108, '<td valign="top">nice colors but way to OOF</td>', 'nice colors but way to OOF', '2006-11-04 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998494, 420828, 14614, '<td valign="top">Good timing on the capture and the tie to the title works well.  I''m distracted from the "models" by the background and the oof foreground (lower right) and that takes away from the impact of the image for me.  The light didn''t help you bring out the subjects any as the tones are similar in both the subjects and the surrounding area.</td>', 'Good timing on the capture and the tie to the title works well.  I''m distracted from the "models" by the background and the oof foreground (lower right) and that takes away from the impact of the image for me.  The light didn''t help you bring out the subjects any as the tones are similar in both the subjects and the surrounding area.', '2006-11-04 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998496, 420069, 32108, '<td valign="top">OOF and not enough depth</td>', 'OOF and not enough depth', '2006-11-04 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998499, 413519, 32108, '<td valign="top">don''t like the composition or contrast of this image</td>', 'don''t like the composition or contrast of this image', '2006-11-04 18:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998501, 420954, 32108, '<td valign="top">great colours but little interest</td>', 'great colours but little interest', '2006-11-04 18:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2998502, 421104, 14614, '<td valign="top">the colors on the right are amazing -- you work with the dark area (by adding a face that appears out of nowhere) give the photo interest.  I find the laft half takes away from the compositional interest you created elsewhere.</td>', 'the colors on the right are amazing -- you work with the dark area (by adding a face that appears out of nowhere) give the photo interest.  I find the laft half takes away from the compositional interest you created elsewhere.', '2006-11-04 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1);
