(2998968, 421065, 28471, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  The green and blue create and interesting contrast when paired with the red and yellow leaves.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  The green and blue create and interesting contrast when paired with the red and yellow leaves.', '2006-11-04 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
