(2998975, 420596, 28471, '<td valign="top">Great job with this still life.  Before I saw the title I knew it was a still life.  I love the lighting and the texture of the wall or backdrop behind the kitchen items. (9)</td>', 'Great job with this still life.  Before I saw the title I knew it was a still life.  I love the lighting and the texture of the wall or backdrop behind the kitchen items. (9)', '2006-11-04 21:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
