(2999055, 421025, 18349, '<td valign="top">The tilt and choppy composition make this image look like an afterthought rather than purposeful.  There appears to be a blue tint to the image as well.  Great clarity, DOF, and exposure control.</td>', 'The tilt and choppy composition make this image look like an afterthought rather than purposeful.  There appears to be a blue tint to the image as well.  Great clarity, DOF, and exposure control.', '2006-11-04 22:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2999057, 420922, 18349, '<td valign="top">Water is nicely exposed and the shutter speed makes it look very silky; lighting however is a bit flat and the image lacks some depth.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Water is nicely exposed and the shutter speed makes it look very silky; lighting however is a bit flat and the image lacks some depth.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-04 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2999061, 420969, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors; the smooth background makes the bird stand out well.  Could use some more sharpness on the feathers and eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty colors; the smooth background makes the bird stand out well.  Could use some more sharpness on the feathers and eyes.', '2006-11-04 22:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
