(2999071, 420114, 18349, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  The mist is captured beautifully; the visible portion of the mountain on the left side is quite distracting.  I''d almost consider cropping or cloning it out.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  The mist is captured beautifully; the visible portion of the mountain on the left side is quite distracting.  I''d almost consider cropping or cloning it out.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-04 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
