(2999080, 418600, 18349, '<td valign="top">LOL this is cute.  Hope it''s hanging on a wall in your home!  Would like to see more light on the front boy''s face and on the left side on the girl''s face.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'LOL this is cute.  Hope it''s hanging on a wall in your home!  Would like to see more light on the front boy''s face and on the left side on the girl''s face.  Good luck in the challenge.  :)', '2006-11-04 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
