(2999095, 421071, 18349, '<td valign="top">Pretty color and composition...but the image is a bit flat and lacks "pop."  I think maybe some contrast adjustment might help.  :)</td>', 'Pretty color and composition...but the image is a bit flat and lacks "pop."  I think maybe some contrast adjustment might help.  :)', '2006-11-04 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
