(3000942, 419890, 7743, '<td valign="top">.. as in Ellie Phant? Are those storks in the background?<br/> <br/>I like the position of the elephant and the space left in front form movement.  The forest adds context.  I''m sure this looks much sharper in a larger size but seems to need some sharpening at this size.</td>', '.. as in Ellie Phant? Are those storks in the background? I like the position of the elephant and the space left in front form movement.  The forest adds context.  I''m sure this looks much sharper in a larger size but seems to need some sharpening at this size.', '2006-11-05 09:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
