(3000957, 420923, 7743, '<td valign="top">The position of the boat in the frame is good however could possibly be a little bit lower.  Separation of the boat from the background would help as well.  This would require a higher vantage point on the part of the photographer.<br/> <br/>One last thing, the horizon is tilted slightly to the left.  Not enough to be intentional (IMO) and is therefore distracting.<br/> <br/>Good catch with the birds in the frame.</td>', 'The position of the boat in the frame is good however could possibly be a little bit lower.  Separation of the boat from the background would help as well.  This would require a higher vantage point on the part of the photographer. One last thing, the horizon is tilted slightly to the left.  Not enough to be intentional (IMO) and is therefore distracting. Good catch with the birds in the frame.', '2006-11-05 09:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
