(3002643, 420633, 58800, '<td valign="top">good shot, i love the lighting to give the wood such a warm tone.</td>', 'good shot, i love the lighting to give the wood such a warm tone.', '2006-11-05 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002645, 418515, 35513, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I find the tree in the foreground (splitting the frame) to be a bit distracting.  I like the lone figure in the woods, enjoying the experience of being there.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I find the tree in the foreground (splitting the frame) to be a bit distracting.  I like the lone figure in the woods, enjoying the experience of being there.', '2006-11-05 17:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002651, 420497, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones in this shot, which set the mood in just the way I expect for this kind of shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice warm tones in this shot, which set the mood in just the way I expect for this kind of shot.  Nicely done.', '2006-11-05 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002655, 419991, 58800, '<td valign="top">i think the exposure was just a little long and that it would have benefited from having a little more detail.</td>', 'i think the exposure was just a little long and that it would have benefited from having a little more detail.', '2006-11-05 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002662, 420523, 58800, '<td valign="top">good idea, though the foreground is so out of focus that it becomes a little distracting.</td>', 'good idea, though the foreground is so out of focus that it becomes a little distracting.', '2006-11-05 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002663, 419949, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the tight framing of this shot, but I might prefer if it appeared that the subjects had a little more connection with the camera and/or viewer.  Soft focus gives a mood here, but I think it might be a touch too much for my taste.  The lighting is wonderful...very lovely.  And exposure looks good too.</td>', 'I like the tight framing of this shot, but I might prefer if it appeared that the subjects had a little more connection with the camera and/or viewer.  Soft focus gives a mood here, but I think it might be a touch too much for my taste.  The lighting is wonderful...very lovely.  And exposure looks good too.', '2006-11-05 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002668, 420663, 58800, '<td valign="top">good close shot. good colours aswel.</td>', 'good close shot. good colours aswel.', '2006-11-05 17:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002670, 420604, 35513, '<td valign="top">For me, photos of statues don''t capture my interest in quite the same way as some other subject choices.  You have good exposure on this shot and your colors are nice and natural.  But I find the memorial in the foreground a bit distracting from the rest of the scene.</td>', 'For me, photos of statues don''t capture my interest in quite the same way as some other subject choices.  You have good exposure on this shot and your colors are nice and natural.  But I find the memorial in the foreground a bit distracting from the rest of the scene.', '2006-11-05 17:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002672, 411774, 58800, '<td valign="top">really odd angle but it works. it does feel a little noisy/grainy at the busier area where all the cables and such intersect.</td>', 'really odd angle but it works. it does feel a little noisy/grainy at the busier area where all the cables and such intersect.', '2006-11-05 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002678, 420406, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, impressive bluff!  The color contrast between the bluff and the sky is very unique...I''d be curious to know if that''s the natural color of the sky.</td>', 'Wow, impressive bluff!  The color contrast between the bluff and the sky is very unique...I''d be curious to know if that''s the natural color of the sky.', '2006-11-05 17:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002679, 420217, 58800, '<td valign="top">good composition, and good work to get the lighting when it was like this.</td>', 'good composition, and good work to get the lighting when it was like this.', '2006-11-05 17:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002681, 418582, 58800, '<td valign="top">really good textures and colours.</td>', 'really good textures and colours.', '2006-11-05 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002686, 418833, 58800, '<td valign="top">amazing, really love how al the mist adds such feeling to the image, great shot.</td>', 'amazing, really love how al the mist adds such feeling to the image, great shot.', '2006-11-05 17:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002687, 418666, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and detail here.  Colors and lighting are spot on.  Love that the background nicely contrasts with the subject color.  I might suggest extending the subject out to the right a little more--or cropping off some of the frame on the right hand side to achieve a similar effect.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and detail here.  Colors and lighting are spot on.  Love that the background nicely contrasts with the subject color.  I might suggest extending the subject out to the right a little more--or cropping off some of the frame on the right hand side to achieve a similar effect.', '2006-11-05 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3002690, 420128, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model!  Nice surroundings as well.  Lighting and exposure is spot on.  Could be a photo in a catalog, for sure!</td>', 'Beautiful model!  Nice surroundings as well.  Lighting and exposure is spot on.  Could be a photo in a catalog, for sure!', '2006-11-05 17:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
