(3005788, 413168, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cades Cove?  Looks familiar, but I haven''t been there in 20 years.  :D  I like the composition and the subject is fine.  Time of day for taking this makes it difficult to add any drama to the scene.  The light is harsh and shadows are limited.  Some may like it that way, and I think it''s fine overall, but it''s not going to score high points from an artistic sense that many DPC voters have come to expect.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cades Cove?  Looks familiar, but I haven''t been there in 20 years.  :D  I like the composition and the subject is fine.  Time of day for taking this makes it difficult to add any drama to the scene.  The light is harsh and shadows are limited.  Some may like it that way, and I think it''s fine overall, but it''s not going to score high points from an artistic sense that many DPC voters have come to expect.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-06 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
