(3005864, 412076, 59458, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but you can really see the post processing. It looks like you should have used a smaller cloning tool.</td>', 'I like the shot but you can really see the post processing. It looks like you should have used a smaller cloning tool.', '2006-11-06 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005870, 420749, 59458, '<td valign="top">Like the shot but it is really noisy</td>', 'Like the shot but it is really noisy', '2006-11-06 11:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005876, 413303, 57712, '<td valign="top">The major factor in the image seems to be the lighting. It''s very flat and as such very undramatic. The colors also seem rather drab. Different lighting conditions, often based on time of day, can really make a difference to the impact of an image.</td>', 'The major factor in the image seems to be the lighting. It''s very flat and as such very undramatic. The colors also seem rather drab. Different lighting conditions, often based on time of day, can really make a difference to the impact of an image.', '2006-11-06 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005882, 420841, 57712, '<td valign="top">Very minimalist and moody. I find it very appealing.</td>', 'Very minimalist and moody. I find it very appealing.', '2006-11-06 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005905, 419379, 57712, '<td valign="top">I find most of the water droplets to be distracting. Some of them are halo''d with blue/purple (chromatic aberration). I''m not really sure what the subject is. I''m guessing it is the leaf, but there are so many elements competing with each other that it is a little chaotic and so my interest isnt really caught on any one thing.</td>', 'I find most of the water droplets to be distracting. Some of them are halo''d with blue/purple (chromatic aberration). I''m not really sure what the subject is. I''m guessing it is the leaf, but there are so many elements competing with each other that it is a little chaotic and so my interest isnt really caught on any one thing.', '2006-11-06 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
