(3005927, 416854, 68148, '<td valign="top">Really good building of the image and the colors are amazing</td>', 'Really good building of the image and the colors are amazing', '2006-11-06 12:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005930, 421025, 57712, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, since there arent any distinct things I dislike about the image, but it just doesnt grab me. I''m not a fan of the tilt, but it doesnt bother me. There just doesnt seem to be anything in the image to pull and retain my attention. It''s just one of those ''ok, next'' type images.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, since there arent any distinct things I dislike about the image, but it just doesnt grab me. I''m not a fan of the tilt, but it doesnt bother me. There just doesnt seem to be anything in the image to pull and retain my attention. It''s just one of those ''ok, next'' type images.', '2006-11-06 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005945, 420521, 57712, '<td valign="top">The mix of black and white with the strong light and smoke/mist/rain really sets a dramatic atmosphere to the shot. It feels very film noir. There is a lot to see but each element seems to have its own mystery and story. I like it.</td>', 'The mix of black and white with the strong light and smoke/mist/rain really sets a dramatic atmosphere to the shot. It feels very film noir. There is a lot to see but each element seems to have its own mystery and story. I like it.', '2006-11-06 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005950, 421119, 53243, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the blurring of the background was intentional, but it''s distracting</td>', 'I''m not sure if the blurring of the background was intentional, but it''s distracting', '2006-11-06 12:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005965, 420218, 53243, '<td valign="top">Thre is too much dead space in this photo.</td>', 'Thre is too much dead space in this photo.', '2006-11-06 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005969, 419965, 53243, '<td valign="top">nice capture - great telephoto lens.</td>', 'nice capture - great telephoto lens.', '2006-11-06 12:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005974, 420898, 53243, '<td valign="top">I love the shade of colors for this evening shot - the lighting gives it a warm touch.</td>', 'I love the shade of colors for this evening shot - the lighting gives it a warm touch.', '2006-11-06 12:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005977, 419949, 53243, '<td valign="top">The baby''s face along with the father''s would have been more effective in my opinion.</td>', 'The baby''s face along with the father''s would have been more effective in my opinion.', '2006-11-06 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005998, 421122, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not a composition that appeals to me - it took me some time to work out what I was seeing.  The lighting does''t really work for me - both too bright and too dark in equal measure.  I''m not sure what your aim was with this photo, but keep experimenting!</td>', 'Not a composition that appeals to me - it took me some time to work out what I was seeing.  The lighting does''t really work for me - both too bright and too dark in equal measure.  I''m not sure what your aim was with this photo, but keep experimenting!', '2006-11-06 12:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006009, 416330, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would prefer this without the foreground foliage.</td>', 'I would prefer this without the foreground foliage.', '2006-11-06 12:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006017, 419827, 67258, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop, losing the right hand section to the division of the advertising board may help to make this composition a little more balanced.</td>', 'A tighter crop, losing the right hand section to the division of the advertising board may help to make this composition a little more balanced.', '2006-11-06 12:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006022, 419888, 53243, '<td valign="top">You must have an excellent telephoto lens to have survived to submit this photo - wonderful capture</td>', 'You must have an excellent telephoto lens to have survived to submit this photo - wonderful capture', '2006-11-06 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006039, 418308, 67258, '<td valign="top">Weather wise it looks as though this wasn''t a particular good day for taking photographs!  Whilst you have caught some good glistening water, the sky - which takes up more than half the photo - is dull and devoid of interest.</td>', 'Weather wise it looks as though this wasn''t a particular good day for taking photographs!  Whilst you have caught some good glistening water, the sky - which takes up more than half the photo - is dull and devoid of interest.', '2006-11-06 12:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006043, 421119, 67258, '<td valign="top">Tilt shift lens?</td>', 'Tilt shift lens?', '2006-11-06 12:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006044, 420602, 43565, '<td valign="top">Beautiful--I like the detail of the rocks and the pattern at the bottom of the falls.</td>', 'Beautiful--I like the detail of the rocks and the pattern at the bottom of the falls.', '2006-11-06 12:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006056, 407787, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks like a post card!  I like the way the line of the sidewalk and shore lead to the buildings.</td>', 'This looks like a post card!  I like the way the line of the sidewalk and shore lead to the buildings.', '2006-11-06 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006061, 420967, 67258, '<td valign="top">Sunrays like this are always exciting to see, but from a photographic standpoint this would have been improved with a skyline with a bit more interest - some trees or buildings, or even people, as the light would have allowed for strong silhouettes.</td>', 'Sunrays like this are always exciting to see, but from a photographic standpoint this would have been improved with a skyline with a bit more interest - some trees or buildings, or even people, as the light would have allowed for strong silhouettes.', '2006-11-06 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006063, 414428, 43565, '<td valign="top">I love thie lighting on the building and the sky.  I wish there was a little detail in the bushes in the foreground.  7</td>', 'I love thie lighting on the building and the sky.  I wish there was a little detail in the bushes in the foreground.  7', '2006-11-06 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006152, 419826, 53243, '<td valign="top">the candelier looks like it is coming out of her head and is very distracting</td>', 'the candelier looks like it is coming out of her head and is very distracting', '2006-11-06 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006175, 408956, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''m new to photography, but I MUST learn to create this effect!  A really beautiful photo which makes me want to investigate further.  Love it!</td>', 'I''m new to photography, but I MUST learn to create this effect!  A really beautiful photo which makes me want to investigate further.  Love it!', '2006-11-06 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006182, 421044, 67006, '<td valign="top">Fun and interesting, an excellent shot in my opinion.</td>', 'Fun and interesting, an excellent shot in my opinion.', '2006-11-06 12:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006205, 410696, 67006, '<td valign="top">A fun pic, but I think it''d be better more sepia-toned.  My image looks too green.</td>', 'A fun pic, but I think it''d be better more sepia-toned.  My image looks too green.', '2006-11-06 12:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006256, 413913, 67006, '<td valign="top">This should be the cover of a book.  Interesting and conjures up all sorts of scenarios.  Perfect for B&amp;W.</td>', 'This should be the cover of a book.  Interesting and conjures up all sorts of scenarios.  Perfect for B&W.', '2006-11-06 13:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006262, 420895, 67006, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I don''t even like seagulls, but this pic is superb!</td>', 'Wow!  I don''t even like seagulls, but this pic is superb!', '2006-11-06 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006273, 420456, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''d like to learn more about how you set up this shot....Very interesting and an inspiration to us beginners!</td>', 'I''d like to learn more about how you set up this shot....Very interesting and an inspiration to us beginners!', '2006-11-06 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006290, 419888, 67006, '<td valign="top">Absolutely spellbounding!  Perfect lighting and focus....lucky you.</td>', 'Absolutely spellbounding!  Perfect lighting and focus....lucky you.', '2006-11-06 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006304, 415560, 67006, '<td valign="top">Looks like my hometown....Nice pic!</td>', 'Looks like my hometown....Nice pic!', '2006-11-06 13:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006323, 414525, 67006, '<td valign="top">Not that it matters, but I don''t get the title.  But, I think this is a very interesting shot.  Makes me wonder....</td>', 'Not that it matters, but I don''t get the title.  But, I think this is a very interesting shot.  Makes me wonder....', '2006-11-06 13:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006388, 417139, 31742, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! 10</td>', 'Beautiful! 10', '2006-11-06 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006483, 419458, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition on those pumpkins.  A lot of times I go for more overstated color, but this case I''m really fond of the undestated color.  It really makes this a more timeless photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice composition on those pumpkins.  A lot of times I go for more overstated color, but this case I''m really fond of the undestated color.  It really makes this a more timeless photograph.  Well done!', '2006-11-06 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006490, 420596, 42100, '<td valign="top">I find this very interesting for a rather ordinary subject.  I guess it''s the tones and light which makes this so interesting.  Very nice!  I''m curious, this looks like it was achieved by painting with light.</td>', 'I find this very interesting for a rather ordinary subject.  I guess it''s the tones and light which makes this so interesting.  Very nice!  I''m curious, this looks like it was achieved by painting with light.', '2006-11-06 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006495, 420192, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, is that really him!?!  A very clever concept and excellent execution.</td>', 'Wow, is that really him!?!  A very clever concept and excellent execution.', '2006-11-06 14:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006516, 414824, 42100, '<td valign="top">This photo really moves beyond just another homeless person photo.  The composition is excellent, especially with slightly blurred bus as the  backdrop.  But the real standout of this photo is the lighting, it shows the detail masterfully.</td>', 'This photo really moves beyond just another homeless person photo.  The composition is excellent, especially with slightly blurred bus as the  backdrop.  But the real standout of this photo is the lighting, it shows the detail masterfully.', '2006-11-06 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006527, 418008, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very artful portrait, loaded with the flavour of a different culture.  I really like bold eyegrabbing backdrop which doesn''t overwhelm the subjects.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very artful portrait, loaded with the flavour of a different culture.  I really like bold eyegrabbing backdrop which doesn''t overwhelm the subjects.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-06 14:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006531, 406856, 30049, '<td valign="top">This one has to be looked at for a little while to really be appreciated.  I hope that voters slow down enough for a good look, but with 600+ entries I wouldn''t hold my breath.  Wonderful color and a nice job of post-processing this to give it a warm, rich look.  Good luck!</td>', 'This one has to be looked at for a little while to really be appreciated.  I hope that voters slow down enough for a good look, but with 600+ entries I wouldn''t hold my breath.  Wonderful color and a nice job of post-processing this to give it a warm, rich look.  Good luck!', '2006-11-06 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006535, 417088, 42100, '<td valign="top">The composition and lighting are very nice on this protrait.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The composition and lighting are very nice on this protrait.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-06 14:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006549, 413357, 42100, '<td valign="top">All that great detail in his beard and the wrinkles in his face, yet I''m still drawn to his eyes and their understated twinkle.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'All that great detail in his beard and the wrinkles in his face, yet I''m still drawn to his eyes and their understated twinkle.  Very nicely done!', '2006-11-06 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006555, 406985, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wow! you''ve gotten in really close. But the head is much too bright, it even looks to be covering it eyes ;)</td>', 'Wow! you''ve gotten in really close. But the head is much too bright, it even looks to be covering it eyes ;)', '2006-11-06 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006564, 420207, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, you really captured the warmth and joy of your subject.  Well done!  There doesn''t seem to be enough of that ribbon showing to add to the photo, instead it draws the eye out of the frame some.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, you really captured the warmth and joy of your subject.  Well done!  There doesn''t seem to be enough of that ribbon showing to add to the photo, instead it draws the eye out of the frame some.', '2006-11-06 14:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006565, 415509, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very cute :) Catching the ladybug about to fly off, priceless. Great shot.<br/> <br/>-Techo</td>', 'Very cute :) Catching the ladybug about to fly off, priceless. Great shot. -Techo', '2006-11-06 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006593, 420681, 42100, '<td valign="top">The whites of the entertainer seem a bit too white, kind of disjointed with the rest of the photo.  It''s like the entertainer was processed for high key, and rest of the photo was processed for richer, deeper tones.  The slice of life vibe of this really make it an interesting photo though, and makes the bright whites more of a minor issue.</td>', 'The whites of the entertainer seem a bit too white, kind of disjointed with the rest of the photo.  It''s like the entertainer was processed for high key, and rest of the photo was processed for richer, deeper tones.  The slice of life vibe of this really make it an interesting photo though, and makes the bright whites more of a minor issue.', '2006-11-06 14:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006602, 421102, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and detail to this macro.  I like the circle bokeh in the backdrop.  The highlights on its back are a little on the bright side, but don''t seem to take away from the quality of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice color and detail to this macro.  I like the circle bokeh in the backdrop.  The highlights on its back are a little on the bright side, but don''t seem to take away from the quality of the photo.', '2006-11-06 14:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006609, 407307, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting and great sky in this desolate scene.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool lighting and great sky in this desolate scene.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-06 14:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006617, 420944, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting in this photo.  Very interesting how these three birds posed for you like that.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting in this photo.  Very interesting how these three birds posed for you like that.', '2006-11-06 14:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006720, 406210, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a great macro shot.  Lighting and clarity is outstanding!  Well done.  I hope you share some of your secrets in the photographer''s comments when this challenge has finished and your photo is gracing the front page.  :D</td>', 'What a great macro shot.  Lighting and clarity is outstanding!  Well done.  I hope you share some of your secrets in the photographer''s comments when this challenge has finished and your photo is gracing the front page.  :D', '2006-11-06 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006725, 420607, 2382, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait! I love the expression you''ve captured.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait! I love the expression you''ve captured.', '2006-11-06 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006837, 404955, 38161, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2006-11-06 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006950, 418275, 32293, '<td valign="top">while i like the subject and color, i''m not able to focus on any one spot.  possibly to soft of a focus, for me anyways.</td>', 'while i like the subject and color, i''m not able to focus on any one spot.  possibly to soft of a focus, for me anyways.', '2006-11-06 15:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006957, 420480, 32293, '<td valign="top">i''m not exactly certain what i''m looking at.<br/>is that a basketball, a bowling ball??? i''m lost without alot of definition.</td>', 'i''m not exactly certain what i''m looking at.is that a basketball, a bowling ball??? i''m lost without alot of definition.', '2006-11-06 15:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006961, 411003, 32293, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but would have liked to see more detail of forward subject.</td>', 'I like the concept, but would have liked to see more detail of forward subject.', '2006-11-06 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006964, 420841, 32293, '<td valign="top">this seems very close to the challenge "After the game".<br/>A bit on the dark side for my eye as well.</td>', 'this seems very close to the challenge "After the game".A bit on the dark side for my eye as well.', '2006-11-06 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006969, 410672, 32293, '<td valign="top">I like the soft color and nicely defined detail of this.</td>', 'I like the soft color and nicely defined detail of this.', '2006-11-06 15:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006973, 418432, 32293, '<td valign="top">not sure what it is i''m looking at in the foreground with no detail. too dark for my eye.</td>', 'not sure what it is i''m looking at in the foreground with no detail. too dark for my eye.', '2006-11-06 15:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006981, 421132, 32293, '<td valign="top">I like the subtleness of this.  Your subject almost blends in perfectly with the ground cover.<br/>Nice focus.  I also like the fact you have your subject off center but not to the point of obscurity.</td>', 'I like the subtleness of this.  Your subject almost blends in perfectly with the ground cover.Nice focus.  I also like the fact you have your subject off center but not to the point of obscurity.', '2006-11-06 15:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006985, 419226, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice detail with this.  You light on the left helps to define, outline and intensify your subject on the right side.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nice detail with this.  You light on the left helps to define, outline and intensify your subject on the right side.  Nicely captured.', '2006-11-06 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006989, 420930, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice bold blue sky.  Rocks stand out nicely.  Love the variety of textures you were able to capture as well as shadows.</td>', 'Nice bold blue sky.  Rocks stand out nicely.  Love the variety of textures you were able to capture as well as shadows.', '2006-11-06 15:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006992, 421035, 32293, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The top of his head almost blends in with the background to much.   perhaps a bit higher with your angle would eliminate that.<br/>Beautiful detail.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The top of his head almost blends in with the background to much.   perhaps a bit higher with your angle would eliminate that.Beautiful detail.', '2006-11-06 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3006995, 411332, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid color and detail.<br/>Nicely captured!</td>', 'Nice vivid color and detail.Nicely captured!', '2006-11-06 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007000, 420982, 32293, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure where the orange comes in.. i see a purple sky, but the moon to me sure looks pink.<br/>My eye would almost prefer a tighter crop across the bottom.  to much blank space.</td>', 'i''m not sure where the orange comes in.. i see a purple sky, but the moon to me sure looks pink.My eye would almost prefer a tighter crop across the bottom.  to much blank space.', '2006-11-06 15:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007002, 416191, 32293, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and textures as well as vivid colors.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and textures as well as vivid colors.', '2006-11-06 15:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007008, 419866, 32293, '<td valign="top">LOL.. K this one made me laugh out loud!<br/>Nice vivid colors and detail.<br/>i really enjoy this one!</td>', 'LOL.. K this one made me laugh out loud!Nice vivid colors and detail.i really enjoy this one!', '2006-11-06 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007012, 415826, 32293, '<td valign="top">This one says warmth to me on so many levels.  In color tones and subject matter especially.  I love everything about this shot.<br/>Beautiful color, detail, focus and cropping, just to name a few.</td>', 'This one says warmth to me on so many levels.  In color tones and subject matter especially.  I love everything about this shot.Beautiful color, detail, focus and cropping, just to name a few.', '2006-11-06 16:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007019, 420009, 32293, '<td valign="top">I like the initial view of this, but then the blue becomes almost to overwhelming to my eye.  I would have enjoyed seeing more of the reds and oranges you see further back in the shot.</td>', 'I like the initial view of this, but then the blue becomes almost to overwhelming to my eye.  I would have enjoyed seeing more of the reds and oranges you see further back in the shot.', '2006-11-06 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
