(3007553, 420192, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s come down to this... kidnapping celebs tsk tsk ;) j/k<br/>Really nice lighting here. I like the pumpkin face shadow to the right of him but the shadow on the left looks out of place. Maybe a shadow of Edward Scissor Hand''s hand?</td>', 'It''s come down to this... kidnapping celebs tsk tsk ;) j/kReally nice lighting here. I like the pumpkin face shadow to the right of him but the shadow on the left looks out of place. Maybe a shadow of Edward Scissor Hand''s hand?', '2006-11-06 18:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007559, 413684, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharp as a tack macro. Do think it''s little overexposed and the blue sky doesn''t look naturally blue for some reason.</td>', 'Very nice sharp as a tack macro. Do think it''s little overexposed and the blue sky doesn''t look naturally blue for some reason.', '2006-11-06 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007601, 418663, 63218, '<td valign="top">a point of view as if I were another horse--lovely--10!</td>', 'a point of view as if I were another horse--lovely--10!', '2006-11-06 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007604, 419973, 63218, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2006-11-06 18:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007610, 421102, 29011, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah! great shot. It''s watching you alright ;)<br/>The way the fellow is backlit makes this extra special and not just a closeup. Also like the overexposed areas on it''s back.</td>', 'Oh yeah! great shot. It''s watching you alright ;)The way the fellow is backlit makes this extra special and not just a closeup. Also like the overexposed areas on it''s back.', '2006-11-06 18:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007611, 412076, 29011, '<td valign="top">While the bird itself isn''t very detailed the capture as a whole is awesome. Great shot!</td>', 'While the bird itself isn''t very detailed the capture as a whole is awesome. Great shot!', '2006-11-06 18:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007618, 420721, 29011, '<td valign="top">The beautiful jade colored water is a very complimenting background/foreground. It''s a perfect shot all around , just for that piece of wood/lumber near the bottom right, spoils it a bit. Still, I like this a lot.</td>', 'The beautiful jade colored water is a very complimenting background/foreground. It''s a perfect shot all around , just for that piece of wood/lumber near the bottom right, spoils it a bit. Still, I like this a lot.', '2006-11-06 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007621, 420898, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is splendid. I''ve seen shots of couples on walks but this gives off a whole different atmosphere, meant in a very good way. Even though you dont see any faces the sentiment comes across via their body language and the surroundings sure are memorable. Reminds me of the Dimaonds Are Forever commercial playing in the States.</td>', 'This is splendid. I''ve seen shots of couples on walks but this gives off a whole different atmosphere, meant in a very good way. Even though you dont see any faces the sentiment comes across via their body language and the surroundings sure are memorable. Reminds me of the Dimaonds Are Forever commercial playing in the States.', '2006-11-06 18:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007628, 418600, 29011, '<td valign="top">haha :) Fun shot.<br/>I wonder how the shot would look in a portrait crop, show more of the middle boy''s body with him in a similar stance as the others. The lighting is good. Pitty though that the girl''s face isn''t as sharp as the rest.</td>', 'haha :) Fun shot.I wonder how the shot would look in a portrait crop, show more of the middle boy''s body with him in a similar stance as the others. The lighting is good. Pitty though that the girl''s face isn''t as sharp as the rest.', '2006-11-06 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007630, 414855, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Try using 72 lines per inch when you reduce your photo.  It might help with the compression.  I have this problem as well and my images are doing better by using less pixels per line.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Try using 72 lines per inch when you reduce your photo.  It might help with the compression.  I have this problem as well and my images are doing better by using less pixels per line.  Hope this helps.', '2006-11-06 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007631, 413946, 29011, '<td valign="top">Without the title , would''ve thought that guy in the back was checking the lady out. I reckon he''s the groom? he should''ve been wearing his tux because she''s still in her wedding dress. He would''ve been more regonizable as the groom.</td>', 'Without the title , would''ve thought that guy in the back was checking the lady out. I reckon he''s the groom? he should''ve been wearing his tux because she''s still in her wedding dress. He would''ve been more regonizable as the groom.', '2006-11-06 18:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3007634, 417825, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! love the effect. Great job with the photo as a whole. Hope you''ll leave us some tidbits in the photo description :)</td>', 'This is awesome! love the effect. Great job with the photo as a whole. Hope you''ll leave us some tidbits in the photo description :)', '2006-11-06 18:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
