(3008146, 414665, 47852, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture... love the action of the bird mid flight, and the little girls expression of amazement.  She''s holding her arm so it is extra still so she doesn''t scare the bird away... all the components are just perfect.  Great focus, and the shallow dof makes the background just melt away.  Some may say it has a snapshot sort of feel to it, but I think you did a wonderful job... this is a wonderful example of a great photo that captures a precious moment.  I hope this shot does well for you!</td>', 'Fantastic capture... love the action of the bird mid flight, and the little girls expression of amazement.  She''s holding her arm so it is extra still so she doesn''t scare the bird away... all the components are just perfect.  Great focus, and the shallow dof makes the background just melt away.  Some may say it has a snapshot sort of feel to it, but I think you did a wonderful job... this is a wonderful example of a great photo that captures a precious moment.  I hope this shot does well for you!', '2006-11-06 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
