(3008204, 417060, 47852, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting the things the eye finds to focus in on with a shot like this.   For example, it''s good to see that you decided NOT to put on the sunglasses while you were driving down the dark street at 59 mph while holding up a camera to take a long exposure shot.  That just seems dangerous :P  That is quite a lot of colored lights though surrounding you!</td>', 'It''s interesting the things the eye finds to focus in on with a shot like this.   For example, it''s good to see that you decided NOT to put on the sunglasses while you were driving down the dark street at 59 mph while holding up a camera to take a long exposure shot.  That just seems dangerous :P  That is quite a lot of colored lights though surrounding you!', '2006-11-06 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
