(3009129, 420410, 59697, '<td valign="top">This picture has good potential, but the contrast has been drastically reduced. I think you used too much dodging or shadow/highlight in Photoshop. If you can use a tripod, take 2 seperate exposures for the sky and ground, then merge them with a layer mask. Also be sure to clone out sensor spots (upper left corner).</td>', 'This picture has good potential, but the contrast has been drastically reduced. I think you used too much dodging or shadow/highlight in Photoshop. If you can use a tripod, take 2 seperate exposures for the sky and ground, then merge them with a layer mask. Also be sure to clone out sensor spots (upper left corner).', '2006-11-07 02:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3009173, 405941, 65025, '<td valign="top">I love the backlighting.  And is that snow in the air, or frost?  It''s pretty cool.  8</td>', 'I love the backlighting.  And is that snow in the air, or frost?  It''s pretty cool.  8', '2006-11-07 02:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
