(3009194, 421025, 54228, '<td valign="top">This has the making of a good photograph, however, there are a few things I would like to suggest.<br/> <br/>- Try to find a location where the reflection is straight up and down for the tree<br/>- The bridge being on an angle is very distracting<br/>- I would not have cropped the top of the tree or included the tree on the far left</td>', 'This has the making of a good photograph, however, there are a few things I would like to suggest. - Try to find a location where the reflection is straight up and down for the tree- The bridge being on an angle is very distracting- I would not have cropped the top of the tree or included the tree on the far left', '2006-11-07 02:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
