(3011158, 413556, 67301, '<td valign="top">I love the face, eyes and hair in this shot  but some how the bust area dose not look right.  The head and arm in the foreground seems to have magnified them making the bust look small and out of proportion.</td>', 'I love the face, eyes and hair in this shot  but some how the bust area dose not look right.  The head and arm in the foreground seems to have magnified them making the bust look small and out of proportion.', '2006-11-07 17:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
