(3011775, 420497, 42100, '<td valign="top">The lighting and tones are very nice.  Compositionally, I think you showed too much of the side of barrel there''s not much going on of interest.  I think there are some far more interesting things happening with the fronts of the barrels, and the perspective they have as they continue off in the distance.</td>', 'The lighting and tones are very nice.  Compositionally, I think you showed too much of the side of barrel there''s not much going on of interest.  I think there are some far more interesting things happening with the fronts of the barrels, and the perspective they have as they continue off in the distance.', '2006-11-07 20:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011784, 420590, 61318, '<td valign="top">it''s a beautiful location, but the tilted horizon is very distracting.</td>', 'it''s a beautiful location, but the tilted horizon is very distracting.', '2006-11-07 20:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011790, 416265, 42100, '<td valign="top">Sure looks exactly like the title says.  The scene that is, not your photograph, lol.  The branch coming in from the side doesn''t work at all.  A lower perspective where you could get those silhouetted, leafless trees more in front of that gloomy sky might also of been interesting.</td>', 'Sure looks exactly like the title says.  The scene that is, not your photograph, lol.  The branch coming in from the side doesn''t work at all.  A lower perspective where you could get those silhouetted, leafless trees more in front of that gloomy sky might also of been interesting.', '2006-11-07 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3011802, 420217, 42100, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent, very dramatic.  Your choice of DOF is also just right.  The bird is way too centered and compositionally and overall feels a little unbalanced.  One suggestion would be to move a little to your right, placing the bird to the left one-third and keeping the sailboat in the same position in the frame it is now.  I think that would help the balance, and give a little separation between the boat and bird.<br/> <br/>I usually try not to give how I would of done it comments, but I really like the light and DOF.  I think the composition I described would compliment nicely.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent, very dramatic.  Your choice of DOF is also just right.  The bird is way too centered and compositionally and overall feels a little unbalanced.  One suggestion would be to move a little to your right, placing the bird to the left one-third and keeping the sailboat in the same position in the frame it is now.  I think that would help the balance, and give a little separation between the boat and bird. I usually try not to give how I would of done it comments, but I really like the light and DOF.  I think the composition I described would compliment nicely.', '2006-11-07 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
