(3011843, 414613, 42100, '<td valign="top">Some great, warm lighting you got here, really looks nice.  I find the composition a little on the busy side though, just too much going on.  What''s happening to your left?  You might of been able to get some nice leading lines from the boat rails if you could of composed more in that direction.</td>', 'Some great, warm lighting you got here, really looks nice.  I find the composition a little on the busy side though, just too much going on.  What''s happening to your left?  You might of been able to get some nice leading lines from the boat rails if you could of composed more in that direction.', '2006-11-07 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
