(3012666, 418903, 1717, '<td valign="top">i like the high contrast but something about it just seems so harsh...almost to the point of hurting my eyes.  i played around with it a bit and this is what i came up with.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=424513" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1717/thumb/424513.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1717/thumb/424513.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1717/thumb/424513.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>duplicate layer<br/>gaussian blur at 5.0 px radius<br/>opacity reduced to 15%<br/>light smart sharpen<br/> <br/>sorry for being so presumptuous as to offer suggestions to someone of your obvious talent.  i very much admire you and your work.</td>', 'i like the high contrast but something about it just seems so harsh...almost to the point of hurting my eyes.  i played around with it a bit and this is what i came up with.  duplicate layergaussian blur at 5.0 px radiusopacity reduced to 15%light smart sharpen sorry for being so presumptuous as to offer suggestions to someone of your obvious talent.  i very much admire you and your work.', '2006-11-08 02:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
