(3013118, 420883, 11854, '<td valign="top">I loved this! I can''t tell you how many times my kids have done this, along with the dog. I once had paw prints from the front of my hood, up the windshield, covering the roof and then off the back windshield for one last push before the dog jumped. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I loved this! I can''t tell you how many times my kids have done this, along with the dog. I once had paw prints from the front of my hood, up the windshield, covering the roof and then off the back windshield for one last push before the dog jumped. I gave it a 7.', '2006-11-08 06:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
