(3014339, 416191, 22046, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing the original. What an amazing difference. It went from a flat picture to WOW! Not too much post processing in my book. The key question is did you want to show "what it looked like" or create a work of art. I go for the second and you definitely succeeded. Great photo! Ann C</td>', 'Thanks for sharing the original. What an amazing difference. It went from a flat picture to WOW! Not too much post processing in my book. The key question is did you want to show "what it looked like" or create a work of art. I go for the second and you definitely succeeded. Great photo! Ann C', '2006-11-08 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
