(3014491, 413134, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful portrait, and I only gave it a 6... :( It must have been that cheap watch. No... a momentary madness, I was hypnotized by looking through hundreds of free study photos. I saw lots of photos that I liked (I know, I''m too easy!) and I was trying to be ruthless. You have got to be one of the most underrated photographers here, but it''s a role you play well. :)</td>', 'this is a wonderful portrait, and I only gave it a 6... :( It must have been that cheap watch. No... a momentary madness, I was hypnotized by looking through hundreds of free study photos. I saw lots of photos that I liked (I know, I''m too easy!) and I was trying to be ruthless. You have got to be one of the most underrated photographers here, but it''s a role you play well. :)', '2006-11-08 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3014495, 421079, 7778, '<td valign="top">What intricate finery! And the light, constrained in the highlights, yet still distinctively revealing a myriad of black, instant by instant!<br/> <br/>O, can we have this the size of two or three heads hung at eye-level? :-D<br/> <br/>-The title, too, encourages to take nothing for granted and this increases the overall <i>range</i> of this shot.<br/> <br/>Fine eye and sense you show here with a craft so appropriate and dedicated, it''s invisible.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 13:19:36.</i></td>', 'What intricate finery! And the light, constrained in the highlights, yet still distinctively revealing a myriad of black, instant by instant! O, can we have this the size of two or three heads hung at eye-level? :-D -The title, too, encourages to take nothing for granted and this increases the overall range of this shot. Fine eye and sense you show here with a craft so appropriate and dedicated, it''s invisible.', '2006-11-08 13:11:32.000000', '2006-11-08 13:19:36.000000', 0),
