(3015938, 419888, 56417, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot!</td>', 'wonderful shot!', '2006-11-08 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015942, 420121, 64929, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Outstanding capture - congrats!!!</td>', 'Wow!  Outstanding capture - congrats!!!', '2006-11-08 19:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015944, 418360, 56417, '<td valign="top">very well done! this is an incredible shot!</td>', 'very well done! this is an incredible shot!', '2006-11-08 19:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015956, 414250, 30982, '<td valign="top">Apparently you should have cut down the tree.  :-)  Colors in this are wonderful - you did a really good job of capturing the light at that time of day.  Very good detail on the structure as well!</td>', 'Apparently you should have cut down the tree.  :-)  Colors in this are wonderful - you did a really good job of capturing the light at that time of day.  Very good detail on the structure as well!', '2006-11-08 20:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015959, 416494, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked this quite well, actually.  Nice, quiet, calm picture.  Most of your commenters point out the need for better light on the apples themselves - I agree with that.  Basic composition is there, tone (feeling) is there - just a bit needed in the light department maybe.  Still, I gave it a 6 and like the muted, soft overall color.</td>', 'I liked this quite well, actually.  Nice, quiet, calm picture.  Most of your commenters point out the need for better light on the apples themselves - I agree with that.  Basic composition is there, tone (feeling) is there - just a bit needed in the light department maybe.  Still, I gave it a 6 and like the muted, soft overall color.', '2006-11-08 20:02:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015971, 420873, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Cloned out a small inconvenient house"... LOL!   I love the blues and the somewhat twisted perspective of this - nice shot!</td>', '"Cloned out a small inconvenient house"... LOL!   I love the blues and the somewhat twisted perspective of this - nice shot!', '2006-11-08 20:09:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3015979, 419349, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, perfect post processing.  Congrats!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, perfect post processing.  Congrats!!', '2006-11-08 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016004, 418360, 57920, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot it''s breathtaking!</td>', 'Incredible shot it''s breathtaking!', '2006-11-08 20:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016024, 418820, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feeling of joy in this picture (from the dog''s exuberance).  Your hubby, despite definitely looking cold, seems to be enjoying the dog''s antics as well.  Neat shot!!</td>', 'Wonderful feeling of joy in this picture (from the dog''s exuberance).  Your hubby, despite definitely looking cold, seems to be enjoying the dog''s antics as well.  Neat shot!!', '2006-11-08 20:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016034, 406605, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m one of those that also likes harshish lighting scenes, where the light plays on the subject, so I liked this one.  I did think the blue was a bit strong, but what I liked best was the cat''s eyes and the way he was looking at you, it seems!  I think the composition is strong as well.</td>', 'I''m one of those that also likes harshish lighting scenes, where the light plays on the subject, so I liked this one.  I did think the blue was a bit strong, but what I liked best was the cat''s eyes and the way he was looking at you, it seems!  I think the composition is strong as well.', '2006-11-08 20:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016036, 416191, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well presented and indeed a visual beauty more like a vision from a ludid dream. Congratulations on your Blue.</td>', 'Very well presented and indeed a visual beauty more like a vision from a ludid dream. Congratulations on your Blue.', '2006-11-08 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016040, 418996, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great picture Teresa!  Good set up!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 20:29:08.</i></td>', 'Great picture Teresa!  Good set up!', '2006-11-08 20:28:54.000000', '2006-11-08 20:29:08.000000', 0),
(3016043, 420607, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, this an image that etched itself in my mind while voting. It feels as if I am touching the lovely feautures with my fingers. An image that clinges to the viewer. Awesome! Congratulations on your Red.</td>', 'Now, this an image that etched itself in my mind while voting. It feels as if I am touching the lovely feautures with my fingers. An image that clinges to the viewer. Awesome! Congratulations on your Red.', '2006-11-08 20:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016052, 420554, 22734, '<td valign="top">Yes, another fine image by a legend. Manny, you are not only a master of the portrait but of the celebration of life. This image jumps with joy! Congratulations on your Yellow.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-09 11:26:49.</i></td>', 'Yes, another fine image by a legend. Manny, you are not only a master of the portrait but of the celebration of life. This image jumps with joy! Congratulations on your Yellow.', '2006-11-08 20:31:16.000000', '2006-11-09 11:26:49.000000', 0),
(3016062, 419368, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the images formed by the broken windows - not only is there a bat, but there''s a bird in the lower one.  Nice what looks to be either early morning or evening light.</td>', 'I like the images formed by the broken windows - not only is there a bat, but there''s a bird in the lower one.  Nice what looks to be either early morning or evening light.', '2006-11-08 20:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016069, 420456, 22734, '<td valign="top">An ingenious set up that jolts my creative world. Working one medium against the other to produce a "mind boggling" visual delight. Love it.<br/>Congratulations on your 4th place and worthy of a ribbon.</td>', 'An ingenious set up that jolts my creative world. Working one medium against the other to produce a "mind boggling" visual delight. Love it.Congratulations on your 4th place and worthy of a ribbon.', '2006-11-08 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016074, 420709, 30982, '<td valign="top">I just read the comments.  I don''t notice things like cropping at joints, which may explain why I suck.  But they seem to be good comments - seems to be a shot that especially the guys liked.  I also don''t see it as flat - color and contrast seem to be fine on my monitor.</td>', 'I just read the comments.  I don''t notice things like cropping at joints, which may explain why I suck.  But they seem to be good comments - seems to be a shot that especially the guys liked.  I also don''t see it as flat - color and contrast seem to be fine on my monitor.', '2006-11-08 20:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016076, 420927, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image I expected in the top 5 if not all the way up. It is possibly the most dramatic live action capture of a surfer. Congratulations on your 5th place.</td>', 'An image I expected in the top 5 if not all the way up. It is possibly the most dramatic live action capture of a surfer. Congratulations on your 5th place.', '2006-11-08 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3016081, 413029, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now here we have a respite in which to enjoy the present with this lovely and funny capture. Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'Now here we have a respite in which to enjoy the present with this lovely and funny capture. Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2006-11-08 20:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016083, 420602, 42567, '<td valign="top">Another great picture!!  Keep''em coming!  Congratulations on your top 10</td>', 'Another great picture!!  Keep''em coming!  Congratulations on your top 10', '2006-11-08 20:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016088, 415695, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed a delightful shot - I gave this a 7 and I''ve been suffering from landscape overkill lately so that''s a very good score.  What makes this better than the average DPC oversaturated landscape is a) it''s not oversaturated, and b) the inclusion of the reeds and the snow in the foreground.  Very nicely composed!</td>', 'Indeed a delightful shot - I gave this a 7 and I''ve been suffering from landscape overkill lately so that''s a very good score.  What makes this better than the average DPC oversaturated landscape is a) it''s not oversaturated, and b) the inclusion of the reeds and the snow in the foreground.  Very nicely composed!', '2006-11-08 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016101, 419500, 22734, '<td valign="top">Larus: you are quite an amazing individual. You are like a step and repeat machine that delivers as fast but then not really a repeat of subject matter but rather quality. Anytime I see Larus, I want to see the study. Congratulations on your top ten finish with this beauty emerging from the dark. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 22:49:05.</i></td>', 'Larus: you are quite an amazing individual. You are like a step and repeat machine that delivers as fast but then not really a repeat of subject matter but rather quality. Anytime I see Larus, I want to see the study. Congratulations on your top ten finish with this beauty emerging from the dark. ', '2006-11-08 20:42:03.000000', '2006-11-08 22:49:05.000000', 0),
(3016106, 420121, 22734, '<td valign="top">Beautiful with adoring colors and a smashing reflection. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Beautiful with adoring colors and a smashing reflection. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016124, 415826, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image that tucks on the heart strings! Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'An image that tucks on the heart strings! Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2006-11-08 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016128, 411332, 22734, '<td valign="top">Captured to perfection with nothing else wanting. The colors are vivid. Congratulations on your 11th finish.</td>', 'Captured to perfection with nothing else wanting. The colors are vivid. Congratulations on your 11th finish.', '2006-11-08 20:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016130, 415171, 22734, '<td valign="top">Perfect opportunity for a spledid composition and glad you took advantage of it. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Perfect opportunity for a spledid composition and glad you took advantage of it. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:49:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016132, 417927, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most interesting capture. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'A most interesting capture. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016138, 407372, 22734, '<td valign="top">Love it. The high voltage action appears to go on even when so well frozen. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Love it. The high voltage action appears to go on even when so well frozen. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016142, 413357, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very deep and lovely character study. Joy, you are a wonder! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'A very deep and lovely character study. Joy, you are a wonder! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016143, 421079, 22734, '<td valign="top">What an artful and lovely entry. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'What an artful and lovely entry. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016146, 412309, 22734, '<td valign="top">Massive and wonderous. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Massive and wonderous. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016147, 412076, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image that still lingers in my mind. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'An image that still lingers in my mind. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016150, 419161, 22734, '<td valign="top">These images and specially this one always invokes a mystical feeling. A great capture. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'These images and specially this one always invokes a mystical feeling. A great capture. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016151, 420607, 32997, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot...you have a wonderful eye, and know how to avoid all the over-processing traps...<br/>this is an image that sticks with me...</td>', 'wonderful shot...you have a wonderful eye, and know how to avoid all the over-processing traps...this is an image that sticks with me...', '2006-11-08 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016155, 414665, 22734, '<td valign="top">I am so happy to learn that this image belongs to you. A dandy of a capture and a portfolio gem. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'I am so happy to learn that this image belongs to you. A dandy of a capture and a portfolio gem. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-11-08 20:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016157, 420607, 37961, '<td valign="top">Woah....so much texture. Congrats on the ribbon!!</td>', 'Woah....so much texture. Congrats on the ribbon!!', '2006-11-08 20:56:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016171, 421095, 30982, '<td valign="top">The light here is gorgeous - it seems to be that lovely soft light of either morning or evening.  Great find with the tree growing there - makes you wonder if it was intentionally planted or just sprung up on its own.</td>', 'The light here is gorgeous - it seems to be that lovely soft light of either morning or evening.  Great find with the tree growing there - makes you wonder if it was intentionally planted or just sprung up on its own.', '2006-11-08 21:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016180, 421025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Let me guess - the tilted landscape police got you.  Yep, seems to be a bit of that in the comment section.  But you also did receive some good constructive comments, too, which is a rarity these days.  You did have wonderful water for reflections and excellent color.  But I will admit to being one of those who does prefer landscapes with water to be either straight or tilted for a fairly apparent reason.</td>', 'Let me guess - the tilted landscape police got you.  Yep, seems to be a bit of that in the comment section.  But you also did receive some good constructive comments, too, which is a rarity these days.  You did have wonderful water for reflections and excellent color.  But I will admit to being one of those who does prefer landscapes with water to be either straight or tilted for a fairly apparent reason.', '2006-11-08 21:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016184, 418680, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like the composition of this, with the pathway seeming to lead away, possibly into a meadow.  I like the house in the background - adds to the "leading away" concept.  But yes, it does seem too light on this monitor.  I''d like to see it redone if you get a chance.</td>', 'I do like the composition of this, with the pathway seeming to lead away, possibly into a meadow.  I like the house in the background - adds to the "leading away" concept.  But yes, it does seem too light on this monitor.  I''d like to see it redone if you get a chance.', '2006-11-08 21:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016191, 420192, 57378, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments guys - I thought it might do a little better but you never know and it''s one persons taste against another. Till next time.<br/>Thanks<br/>Jeff<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments guys - I thought it might do a little better but you never know and it''s one persons taste against another. Till next time.ThanksJeff ', '2006-11-08 21:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016200, 415826, 64571, '<td valign="top">What an awesome capture!  Simply beautiful.</td>', 'What an awesome capture!  Simply beautiful.', '2006-11-08 21:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016201, 414250, 40973, '<td valign="top">Actually the tree edges adds some texture to help balance the smoothness of the building. I love photographs at this time of day and this captures that beautiful light well.</td>', 'Actually the tree edges adds some texture to help balance the smoothness of the building. I love photographs at this time of day and this captures that beautiful light well.', '2006-11-08 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016203, 420121, 64571, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot!  I love your title, too!!</td>', 'Spectacular shot!  I love your title, too!!', '2006-11-08 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016234, 409918, 25678, '<td valign="top">You mean I can''t think, wow, that must be a cozy sweater she''s got there?<br/> <br/>Nice shot your royal P-ness.  Killer lighting you''ve got there</td>', 'You mean I can''t think, wow, that must be a cozy sweater she''s got there? Nice shot your royal P-ness.  Killer lighting you''ve got there', '2006-11-08 21:49:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3016236, 413963, 25678, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with the colours in the background!!</td>', 'Wonderful shot with the colours in the background!!', '2006-11-08 21:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
