(3018951, 420980, 30982, '<td valign="top">When shooting at night, you need to underexpose from what the camera tells you.  Sometimes a whole lot.  I generally go for at least one stop under and usually more than that.  For a scene like this, set the camera on manual, set your aperture to about f/7.1, then check what it tells you to expose as far as shutter speed.  Click down until it''s one stop underexposed, take a shot, then try one at two stops underexposed.  Using the smaller aperture will create the star-like effects from the lights, too.  This is a great location and worth a reshoot if you get the chance.</td>', 'When shooting at night, you need to underexpose from what the camera tells you.  Sometimes a whole lot.  I generally go for at least one stop under and usually more than that.  For a scene like this, set the camera on manual, set your aperture to about f/7.1, then check what it tells you to expose as far as shutter speed.  Click down until it''s one stop underexposed, take a shot, then try one at two stops underexposed.  Using the smaller aperture will create the star-like effects from the lights, too.  This is a great location and worth a reshoot if you get the chance.', '2006-11-09 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019049, 418008, 16241, '<td valign="top">congrats on your highest score, i was one of your 10''s</td>', 'congrats on your highest score, i was one of your 10''s', '2006-11-09 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019060, 413357, 25397, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Strikeslip:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s practically around the corner from my office.  I always make a point of kicking that guy in the ribs as I walk by.  Just to let him know I notice him there, blocking the sidewalk. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>He sits on the newspaper stand, so that''s highly unlikely unless you are Shaq or Kazam.</td>', 'Originally posted by Strikeslip: That''s practically around the corner from my office.  I always make a point of kicking that guy in the ribs as I walk by.  Just to let him know I notice him there, blocking the sidewalk.  He sits on the newspaper stand, so that''s highly unlikely unless you are Shaq or Kazam.', '2006-11-09 22:56:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019166, 418252, 22734, '<td valign="top">You now, top 30 with so many entries is still pretty good. This image certainly belongs higher but I am sure that you are happy with it as it can adorn any portfolio. Good work.</td>', 'You now, top 30 with so many entries is still pretty good. This image certainly belongs higher but I am sure that you are happy with it as it can adorn any portfolio. Good work.', '2006-11-10 00:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019172, 407307, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely dramatic sky to adorn the remnants of crumbling stone. Top 30 is still good! Nice work.</td>', 'A lovely dramatic sky to adorn the remnants of crumbling stone. Top 30 is still good! Nice work.', '2006-11-10 00:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019173, 417242, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture and fine presentation. Top 30 out of so many speaks of the nice visual appeal of this image. In a smaller challenge (entries) this would have fared in the top 10. Very good work.</td>', 'A lovely capture and fine presentation. Top 30 out of so many speaks of the nice visual appeal of this image. In a smaller challenge (entries) this would have fared in the top 10. Very good work.', '2006-11-10 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019178, 414824, 22734, '<td valign="top">A strong image and underrated. At least it made the top 30 because out of over 600, top 30 is good. Keep up the nice work.</td>', 'A strong image and underrated. At least it made the top 30 because out of over 600, top 30 is good. Keep up the nice work.', '2006-11-10 00:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019183, 420974, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice study and to finish 25 out of 618 is still a good accomplishment.</td>', 'Nice study and to finish 25 out of 618 is still a good accomplishment.', '2006-11-10 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019185, 406544, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice presentation and 26 out of 618 attest to its appeal.</td>', 'A very nice presentation and 26 out of 618 attest to its appeal.', '2006-11-10 00:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019187, 420511, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture and lost in the maze of so many entries that even 27 out of 618 speak about the visual beauty in composition and presentation. Outstanding work!</td>', 'A lovely capture and lost in the maze of so many entries that even 27 out of 618 speak about the visual beauty in composition and presentation. Outstanding work!', '2006-11-10 00:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019190, 417081, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely and think 28 out of 618! Yes, it is underrated but with so many images so much falls by the waysaide.</td>', 'Lovely and think 28 out of 618! Yes, it is underrated but with so many images so much falls by the waysaide.', '2006-11-10 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019196, 420043, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is gigantic with such a mellow flow and an image that deserves a much higher standing, yet out of so many entries a top 30 is good because out of all the voters, the majority agreed on its spectacular visual beauty. When number of entries get so high there is always the danger of oversight and then that 20% for those who spend the least time voting. Keep up the good quality.</td>', 'This is gigantic with such a mellow flow and an image that deserves a much higher standing, yet out of so many entries a top 30 is good because out of all the voters, the majority agreed on its spectacular visual beauty. When number of entries get so high there is always the danger of oversight and then that 20% for those who spend the least time voting. Keep up the good quality.', '2006-11-10 00:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019197, 420511, 60805, '<td valign="top">Well done, my favorite</td>', 'Well done, my favorite', '2006-11-10 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019200, 417890, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another fine image amidst a large number of entries where in the voting becomes unmanagable and some images get short changed their due credit.</td>', 'Another fine image amidst a large number of entries where in the voting becomes unmanagable and some images get short changed their due credit.', '2006-11-10 00:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019202, 409918, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely study and to enter it in a challenge where the numbers exceed 600 is like trying to hit the lotto to get the credit it deserves. Think of all those that never even finished voting because of the time constraints and then the lazy voter. Anyway, this is a fine capture and one that lives before and after any challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely study and to enter it in a challenge where the numbers exceed 600 is like trying to hit the lotto to get the credit it deserves. Think of all those that never even finished voting because of the time constraints and then the lazy voter. Anyway, this is a fine capture and one that lives before and after any challenge.', '2006-11-10 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019207, 420805, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well captured and beautifully presented. Many images suffer when the entry count is so high. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very well captured and beautifully presented. Many images suffer when the entry count is so high. Keep up the good work.', '2006-11-10 00:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019208, 420925, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and still 36 out of 618 is still good. When you have the dpv voters trying to evaluate over 600 images with other pending challenges it is humanly impossible to judge such high numbers. Nice work.</td>', 'A lovely image and still 36 out of 618 is still good. When you have the dpv voters trying to evaluate over 600 images with other pending challenges it is humanly impossible to judge such high numbers. Nice work.', '2006-11-10 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019209, 418833, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image should have finished much, much higher. Like in the top 10. Yet, to have entered it into a pot that exceeds over 600, makes it very hard for it to get the credit it deserves. It can very well be that many of those who give up after 20% voting never even seen this gem.</td>', 'This image should have finished much, much higher. Like in the top 10. Yet, to have entered it into a pot that exceeds over 600, makes it very hard for it to get the credit it deserves. It can very well be that many of those who give up after 20% voting never even seen this gem.', '2006-11-10 00:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3019212, 406870, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another beauty that gets short changed because of the high number of entries. Keep up the nice work as your images get better and better.</td>', 'Another beauty that gets short changed because of the high number of entries. Keep up the nice work as your images get better and better.', '2006-11-10 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
