(3021623, 419827, 55838, '<td valign="top">Captured at the perfect moment!  I imagine you didn''t have the luxury of 10-takes on this one!  Cool sky - I might have brightened it up a bit and made it even more contrasty &amp; cloned out the sensor dust.  I''m afraid I have to agree with those who don''t like the sign in the shot - the composition would be more pleasing IMO croped so that the crowd was leveled up along the bottom and the sign was gone. Too bad a photo doesn''t allow you to hear the incredible sound of these jets!</td>', 'Captured at the perfect moment!  I imagine you didn''t have the luxury of 10-takes on this one!  Cool sky - I might have brightened it up a bit and made it even more contrasty & cloned out the sensor dust.  I''m afraid I have to agree with those who don''t like the sign in the shot - the composition would be more pleasing IMO croped so that the crowd was leveled up along the bottom and the sign was gone. Too bad a photo doesn''t allow you to hear the incredible sound of these jets!', '2006-11-11 08:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
