(3023462, 421047, 53690, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> this is the better of the two photos that are the same. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And in case you missed it, mine is the one that is the "same".  I think we might have even been there at the same time and in the same location!  Looks like your image is from a few minutes before mine due to the number of balloons.  I was so surprised to see an image so similar to mine.  Great job capturing the essence of that morning.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-12 10:15:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: this is the better of the two photos that are the same.   And in case you missed it, mine is the one that is the "same".  I think we might have even been there at the same time and in the same location!  Looks like your image is from a few minutes before mine due to the number of balloons.  I was so surprised to see an image so similar to mine.  Great job capturing the essence of that morning.', '2006-11-12 07:38:52.000000', '2006-11-12 10:15:41.000000', 0),
