(3056981, 407372, 53147, '<td valign="top">This picture has inspired me to ask my wife for a day off from the kids and home on the next beautiful day to go to the races and give this a go. I love this image Enzo - the colors, the clarity, the captured action - all top notch.</td>', 'This picture has inspired me to ask my wife for a day off from the kids and home on the next beautiful day to go to the races and give this a go. I love this image Enzo - the colors, the clarity, the captured action - all top notch.', '2006-11-23 05:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3056990, 406870, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well this is just lovely Jimmy! Beautiful location enhanced by amazing processing. Feels like you could be hiding behind a tree and waiting for a group of elves to come walking down the path. Excellent work my man!</td>', 'Well this is just lovely Jimmy! Beautiful location enhanced by amazing processing. Feels like you could be hiding behind a tree and waiting for a group of elves to come walking down the path. Excellent work my man!', '2006-11-23 05:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3057000, 419349, 53147, '<td valign="top">I promise to never get sick of your animal shots as long as you dont get sick of mine. Our tigers and lions are the only cats that have alot of unshaded area. All the others are in forest like environments and the lighting is very poor. I would love to be able to capture some of the smaller (smaller in relation to tigers and lions) cats like this. Once again - beautiful work. Maybe I need to go to the zoo today!</td>', 'I promise to never get sick of your animal shots as long as you dont get sick of mine. Our tigers and lions are the only cats that have alot of unshaded area. All the others are in forest like environments and the lighting is very poor. I would love to be able to capture some of the smaller (smaller in relation to tigers and lions) cats like this. Once again - beautiful work. Maybe I need to go to the zoo today!', '2006-11-23 05:56:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3057979, 413909, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed with the pose... LOL</td>', 'I''m impressed with the pose... LOL', '2006-11-23 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3058961, 418008, 38648, '<td valign="top">Cute couple.  Love the colors</td>', 'Cute couple.  Love the colors', '2006-11-24 04:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3064520, 418029, 42957, '<td valign="top">This photo is terribly underrated.  I like the artistic processing, the vignette effect on the net.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-27 01:04:31.</i></td>', 'This photo is terribly underrated.  I like the artistic processing, the vignette effect on the net.', '2006-11-27 01:03:20.000000', '2006-11-27 01:04:31.000000', 0),
(3064805, 417898, 6388, '<td valign="top">i agree that the crop is a little off on this one...it could go either way - tighter or looser - but as is seems a  little constraining.  I don''t care if body parts are cut off, i just like to know that it''s deliberate.<br/> <br/>the black and white backdrop doesn''t agree with her very well i don''t think...it seems a little strong and pulls attention away from her.  something a little more neutral might work better.<br/> <br/>not trying to be overly critical, just sharing some thoughts.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'i agree that the crop is a little off on this one...it could go either way - tighter or looser - but as is seems a  little constraining.  I don''t care if body parts are cut off, i just like to know that it''s deliberate. the black and white backdrop doesn''t agree with her very well i don''t think...it seems a little strong and pulls attention away from her.  something a little more neutral might work better. not trying to be overly critical, just sharing some thoughts. P', '2006-11-27 02:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
