(3067767, 420521, 34192, '<td valign="top">Now this I know.  Aubrey Bodine - elevating the working man to art.  Yeah, he was film and 40 years ago and a pictoralist (a dirty word around here, or so it seems)... Excellent work.  Wish there was more space.  Should have done better in the challenge.</td>', 'Now this I know.  Aubrey Bodine - elevating the working man to art.  Yeah, he was film and 40 years ago and a pictoralist (a dirty word around here, or so it seems)... Excellent work.  Wish there was more space.  Should have done better in the challenge.', '2006-11-28 07:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067784, 412866, 34192, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe the score on this one.  Excellent lighting and tones.  Good looking kid too. :)  This is one you hang on the wall.</td>', 'Can''t believe the score on this one.  Excellent lighting and tones.  Good looking kid too. :)  This is one you hang on the wall.', '2006-11-28 07:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3073070, 410430, 46177, '<td valign="top">This one is very pretty, love the colours and what a great reflection!</td>', 'This one is very pretty, love the colours and what a great reflection!', '2006-11-29 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3076249, 414935, 14476, '<td valign="top">You''re right.  This is a keeper. Forever.<br/>Lovely capture.</td>', 'You''re right.  This is a keeper. Forever.Lovely capture.', '2006-11-30 17:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3079348, 419435, 64773, '<td valign="top">This is a really lovely image. I love the ''muted'' colour, excellent exposure, wonderful processing...she has a great expression and lovely eyes which could be the focus of the shot, but my eyes keep drifting down to the other focus of the shot :-)</td>', 'This is a really lovely image. I love the ''muted'' colour, excellent exposure, wonderful processing...she has a great expression and lovely eyes which could be the focus of the shot, but my eyes keep drifting down to the other focus of the shot :-)', '2006-12-01 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3087204, 414532, 656, '<td valign="top">I find this a much stronger composition if you crop most of the sky out of the shot (about an inch of the top, so there are no areas of white in the trees)<br/> <br/>That way, my eye tends to stay in the scene.  It doesn''t jump up to the bright, high contrast areas and I stay within the shot that I think you want us to look at.</td>', 'I find this a much stronger composition if you crop most of the sky out of the shot (about an inch of the top, so there are no areas of white in the trees) That way, my eye tends to stay in the scene.  It doesn''t jump up to the bright, high contrast areas and I stay within the shot that I think you want us to look at.', '2006-12-04 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3087896, 407307, 42013, '<td valign="top">The starkness of this image is very appealing. Great play of light and shadows.</td>', 'The starkness of this image is very appealing. Great play of light and shadows.', '2006-12-04 23:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3091226, 420671, 34013, '<td valign="top">lovely photo</td>', 'lovely photo', '2006-12-06 01:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3091273, 420712, 34013, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot</td>', 'gorgeous shot', '2006-12-06 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3094824, 414824, 34013, '<td valign="top">wow. awesome shot. great tones. i''ve been gone for too long!!</td>', 'wow. awesome shot. great tones. i''ve been gone for too long!!', '2006-12-06 23:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3095052, 417060, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture quite a bit, very much actually.  However, IMO, as an entry to a challenge, especially a free study, it looks sort of too "sloppy" to get a good score.  It is tilted, and even though tilt might work here, it is not tilted enough to look intentional (it looks accidental).  The windshield looks hazy and dirty.  The colours are too much into the yellows.<br/> <br/>A couple ideas to try: (1) a clean windshield; (2) anchoring the camera more to one side maybe, or maybe rotating the camera slightly; (3) adjusting colours in post-processing.</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture quite a bit, very much actually.  However, IMO, as an entry to a challenge, especially a free study, it looks sort of too "sloppy" to get a good score.  It is tilted, and even though tilt might work here, it is not tilted enough to look intentional (it looks accidental).  The windshield looks hazy and dirty.  The colours are too much into the yellows. A couple ideas to try: (1) a clean windshield; (2) anchoring the camera more to one side maybe, or maybe rotating the camera slightly; (3) adjusting colours in post-processing.', '2006-12-07 00:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3101403, 420841, 23394, '<td valign="top">that''s cracker!  the silence rages</td>', 'that''s cracker!  the silence rages', '2006-12-08 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
