(3160526, 404955, 24212, '<td valign="top">My take on this: possibly a little too much saturation, possibly a little too much yellow. Moving rapidly on, placement of the DOF is masterful. A little portion of the ground in front of kitty is sharp as is the face, superbly so, so that the fact that the rest of the body is going out of focus really focusses(!) attention on the head and shoulders. Great composition and use of ROT. I''m sure that this took an awful lot of patience to get, just waiting for the moment. Extremely well done indeed.</td>', 'My take on this: possibly a little too much saturation, possibly a little too much yellow. Moving rapidly on, placement of the DOF is masterful. A little portion of the ground in front of kitty is sharp as is the face, superbly so, so that the fact that the rest of the body is going out of focus really focusses(!) attention on the head and shoulders. Great composition and use of ROT. I''m sure that this took an awful lot of patience to get, just waiting for the moment. Extremely well done indeed.', '2006-12-29 18:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
