(3279515, 418596, 65924, '<td valign="top">Incredible Discovery. Beautiful Photograph. Expertly captured and edited. I''d be proud to hang that on a wall. Bravo. Not a negative comment to be had. A change in sky would be the only thing to possibly want for... but, with this sort of quality, it would only change the picture, not necessarily improve it. Cheers.</td>', 'Incredible Discovery. Beautiful Photograph. Expertly captured and edited. I''d be proud to hang that on a wall. Bravo. Not a negative comment to be had. A change in sky would be the only thing to possibly want for... but, with this sort of quality, it would only change the picture, not necessarily improve it. Cheers.', '2007-01-25 02:05:05.000000', NULL, 0),
