(3287168, 419542, 50641, '<td valign="top">My kind of picture... Although this probably would have scored better in a bokeh challenge, it did ok considering how competitive free studies can be.  I love that hue of rusty orange, but to share a little secret - if you reduce the saturation (the yellow aspect, maybe a touch of the red too) just a little, the samaras will look more sharply focussed.  I love the complementary blue hue in the background.  Overall, very nice!</td>', 'My kind of picture... Although this probably would have scored better in a bokeh challenge, it did ok considering how competitive free studies can be.  I love that hue of rusty orange, but to share a little secret - if you reduce the saturation (the yellow aspect, maybe a touch of the red too) just a little, the samaras will look more sharply focussed.  I love the complementary blue hue in the background.  Overall, very nice!', '2007-01-26 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
