(3763217, 406544, 63269, '<td valign="top">I keep seeing this, and never cease to be amused by it. It is such a striking, provocative image. I love it! It screams at the viewer to look at it. The way that the model''s expression clash with the mouth on the newspaper is hilariously ironic. And the editing is so neat - the gritty look of the skin works perfectly with the newspaper. This photo has a character of it''s own. <br/> <br/>Excellent capture.</td>', 'I keep seeing this, and never cease to be amused by it. It is such a striking, provocative image. I love it! It screams at the viewer to look at it. The way that the model''s expression clash with the mouth on the newspaper is hilariously ironic. And the editing is so neat - the gritty look of the skin works perfectly with the newspaper. This photo has a character of it''s own.  Excellent capture.', '2007-06-10 13:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
