(3878042, 411569, 63269, '<td valign="top">completely exquisite. I was reading the comments and then noticed the crooked horizon too... but the bench is straight. I hate it when I get that problem, where two different objects that are supposed to be perfectly horizontal end up at two different angles, and you can''t fix one without messing up the other! But the vibrant reds and soft blue tones are so striking and beautiful. I love this!</td>', 'completely exquisite. I was reading the comments and then noticed the crooked horizon too... but the bench is straight. I hate it when I get that problem, where two different objects that are supposed to be perfectly horizontal end up at two different angles, and you can''t fix one without messing up the other! But the vibrant reds and soft blue tones are so striking and beautiful. I love this!', '2007-07-07 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 0),
