(3985262, 406870, 48228, '<td valign="top">This could be the beginning of a fairy tale story..... <br/>Once upon a time, in the deep woods, a golden light appeared, as we came accross "An Enchanted Forrest"....... <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=406870" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/565/thumb/406870.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/565/thumb/406870.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/565/thumb/406870.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-09 21:39:20.</i></td>', 'This could be the beginning of a fairy tale story..... Once upon a time, in the deep woods, a golden light appeared, as we came accross "An Enchanted Forrest"....... ', '2007-08-09 22:37:59.000000', '2007-08-09 22:39:20.000000', 0),
