(3999262, 419135, 14986, '<td valign="top">Tones and lighting are excellent.  I agree it needed a little more thought in composition though.  Beautiful location.  I''d say your experiment was a success!</td>', 'Tones and lighting are excellent.  I agree it needed a little more thought in composition though.  Beautiful location.  I''d say your experiment was a success!', '2007-08-15 02:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
