(4653545, 420607, 47470, '<td valign="top">This child is not male.  This child is female.  You can tell by the hair.<br/> <br/>Males children keep their heads mostly shaved, with a thin line of short hair running down the center.  Female children wear their hair in braids until puberty when they change their hair style into the traditional long braids covered in the ochre-butter mixture.  The number of braids a female child has tells about her family members.  Forward facing braids tell about her parents (whether she has both or just one) and back facing braids tell about the grandparents.</td>', 'This child is not male.  This child is female.  You can tell by the hair. Males children keep their heads mostly shaved, with a thin line of short hair running down the center.  Female children wear their hair in braids until puberty when they change their hair style into the traditional long braids covered in the ochre-butter mixture.  The number of braids a female child has tells about her family members.  Forward facing braids tell about her parents (whether she has both or just one) and back facing braids tell about the grandparents.', '2008-04-22 15:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4654692, 413192, 22301, '<td valign="top">I feel a story and character in each one of the birds.</td>', 'I feel a story and character in each one of the birds.', '2008-04-23 04:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
