(4774478, 413963, 30049, '<td valign="top">October 2006?  :-)  I picked this immediately out of your ''Selected Portfolio Photographs'' lineup! <br/> <br/>I can see now that I gave this a pretty high mark back when it was posted as a challenge entry, and understandably so.  :-)  The background really makes this stand out, and the sharply focused bird doesn''t hurt at all either.  He-he.<br/> <br/>Nice lineup choice (and you have tons to choose from!).</td>', 'October 2006?  :-)  I picked this immediately out of your ''Selected Portfolio Photographs'' lineup!  I can see now that I gave this a pretty high mark back when it was posted as a challenge entry, and understandably so.  :-)  The background really makes this stand out, and the sharply focused bird doesn''t hurt at all either.  He-he. Nice lineup choice (and you have tons to choose from!).', '2008-06-18 11:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
